{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:57:56Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:57:56Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Polish the about page visual details\n\nMirrors the home page''s recent treatment: the three value cards now\ncarry a description each, wrapped in a hover-lift card, a \"Nosso\npropósito\" badge above \"Nossos valores\" matching the hero''s own\neyebrow label, and a closing CTA section so the page doesn''t end\nabruptly right after the values grid.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"8a64d4e19542bc9dfb2e4675542963d1c0767c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/8a64d4e19542bc9dfb2e4675542963d1c0767c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/6e01118cbe09d029a46741adab4ceeca162d2f55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/6e01118cbe09d029a46741adab4ceeca162d2f55","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDZlMDExMThjYmUwOWQwMjlhNDY3NDFhZGFiNGNlZWNhMTYyZDJmNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60","sha":"8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60"}],"sha":"6e01118cbe09d029a46741adab4ceeca162d2f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/6e01118cbe09d029a46741adab4ceeca162d2f55"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:53:48Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:53:48Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Polish the home page visual details\n\nSymmetric feature cards (all three now carry a description, wrapped\nin a shadowed card on a warm gold tint background instead of bare\nicons+text), a badge above \"Destaques do ateliê\" matching the hero''s\nown eyebrow label, and a reusable .hover-lift class applied to the\nfeature cards and the testimonial carousel card for a subtler,\npremium feel on hover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"6aa56a184a8f1726934cc581ca2431cdb1fb518f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/6aa56a184a8f1726934cc581ca2431cdb1fb518f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDg5ODJiZjQzYTQ2YmQ2MDk0NjMxODE0OTZjODU0NDFiNjZiMjNmNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75","sha":"e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75"}],"sha":"8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8982bf43a46bd609463181496c85441b66b23f60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:26:45Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:26:45Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Surface an error message when the AI suggest-reply/summary calls fail\n\nBoth generateSummary (dashboard) and suggestReply (contact messages)\npreviously just reset their loading flag on error, leaving the admin\nwith no indication anything went wrong — the button silently went\nback to normal. Adds a friendly error message on failure, matching\nthe pattern already used by the product description generator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"ba57f538738c4aa940cfacfc7b48f1b4cab19bc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/ba57f538738c4aa940cfacfc7b48f1b4cab19bc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGU5MmRmYTJiZWJmYWY2MzU3MmE0MmIwYTViODY0MmQ2YTFjNTViNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0","sha":"ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0"}],"sha":"e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e92dfa2bebfaf63572a42b0a5b8642d6a1c55b75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:10:45Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:10:45Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Extend the ai-cost rate limit to the admin AI routes\n\nAdds three dedicated Gateway routes ahead of each resource''s generic\ncatch-all, so only the AI-calling endpoint is limited and the rest of\nthat admin area is untouched: generate-description (Catalog),\nsuggest-reply (Backoffice contact), and dashboard/summary\n(Backoffice) all get RateLimiterPolicy: ai-cost. Confirmed live\nagainst the local Gateway: 20 requests go through, the 21st gets 429.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"9bfe8055d23c81cebad25967f81bb796cd6022c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/9bfe8055d23c81cebad25967f81bb796cd6022c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGVlNjZhMzNhM2FlYTU2NWM4NDJmYjEyNTIxYWExZTEyYzY4NDIxYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19","sha":"ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19"}],"sha":"ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ee66a33a3aea565c842fb12521aa1e12c68421b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:35:30Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:35:30Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix a broken Gateway route for the AI dashboard summary endpoint\n\nWhile checking whether the ai-cost rate limit policy covers the\nadmin AI routes (it covers none of them — confirmed live against\nthe local Gateway that generate-description, suggest-reply and\ndashboard/summary all route with zero rate limiting), found that\nbackoffice-dashboard-route matched only the exact path\n/api/admin/dashboard, unlike every other admin route''s\n{**catch-all} pattern. POST /api/admin/dashboard/summary never\nreached Backoffice through the Gateway — it 404''d before auth or\nrate limiting ever ran. Fixed the route pattern and confirmed live\n(rebuilt + recreated the local gateway container) that the endpoint\nnow reaches Backoffice (404 -> 401, pending auth).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"f8dd5b1b37d1b0203dd4c256d1cae9cdd3132dce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/f8dd5b1b37d1b0203dd4c256d1cae9cdd3132dce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGViZDY2ZGM5NzEwN2UxNTc2ZWQxZTEwOGM1YzJhMTM5YjIxYmRmMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4","sha":"b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4"}],"sha":"ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebd66dc97107e1576ed1e108c5c2a139b21bdf19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:12:14Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:12:14Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Document the real test-restore.sh validation run against the VPS\n\nCloses out the previously-known \"written but never actually run\"\ngap: a real run against production found three genuine bugs (fixed\nin the two prior commits), and a second run after the fixes\nsuccessfully restored all 4 databases with plausible row counts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"fbd9e4e0ea958a94872aeb3adbcc9752aeeb0429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/fbd9e4e0ea958a94872aeb3adbcc9752aeeb0429"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGI3NjQ2Yzc5N2RkZjQ3Njc5ZWMxZjg5ZGVmYzMwMzFkZjI0MDkyZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade","sha":"781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade"}],"sha":"b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b7646c797ddf47679ec1f89defc3031df24092d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Force docker exec chmod to run as root in test-restore.sh\n\nReal run on the VPS showed docker exec on this SQL Server image\ndefaults to the unprivileged mssql user, not root — so the chmod\nadded in the previous fix failed with \"Operation not permitted\" (you\ncan''t chmod a file you don''t own). Adding -u root gives it permission\nto fix the docker-cp''d backup''s mode before RESTORE DATABASE reads it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"4805a00cd18710af9534f4d430b96162f82f7789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/4805a00cd18710af9534f4d430b96162f82f7789"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDc4MWIyODRhZGQ5M2Y3ZGJlNjkzZGZmNzcwYWQwZjFhY2ViOWJhZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b","sha":"534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b"}],"sha":"781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/781b284add93f7dbe693dff770ad0f1aceb9bade"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:59:51Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:59:51Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix test-restore.sh silently reporting a failed restore as OK\n\nReal run on the VPS surfaced two bugs: (1) docker cp leaves the\ncopied .bak root-owned, which sqlservr''s unprivileged mssql user\ncan''t read, so RESTORE DATABASE failed with \"Access is denied\"; (2)\nsqlcmd was invoked without -b (abort on error), so that failure\ndidn''t propagate as a non-zero exit, and the downstream row-count\ncheck''s `[ \"$ROW_COUNT\" -le 0 ]` silently treated the resulting SQL\nerror text as a false condition instead of failing loudly — the\nscript printed \"OK\" with the raw error message embedded in it.\n\nFixes: chmod the copied backup so mssql can read it, add -b to\nsqlcmd, and validate ROW_COUNT is actually an integer before doing\nnumeric comparisons on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"b9d475e7110d6550fd53143dd9cca813b03aee6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/b9d475e7110d6550fd53143dd9cca813b03aee6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDUzNGQwOTVhMWE1ODZhNzUyMjdmNDc3ZjRlM2JiNjBjMGE2NDk5NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9","sha":"ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9"}],"sha":"534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/534d095a1a586a75227f477f4e3bb60c0a64995b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:47:41Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:47:41Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix stale .env path in the VPS backup/restore-test scripts\n\nBoth scripts pointed ENV_FILE at /var/www/atelie-bebe-microservices/\nmicroservices/.env, a leftover from before the git subtree split that\nextracted this repo under its current name and path\n(/var/www/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos). With the old path the\nSA password lookup would silently come back empty and every sqlcmd\ncall would fail auth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"49aeed3ab28ec1455d3dda628f075bd0781df254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/49aeed3ab28ec1455d3dda628f075bd0781df254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGViZThjYmM4NjZiYjZlNmQzYjg3NDI1MzJlMGM0ZWVhYThlNWRlZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692","sha":"c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692"}],"sha":"ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/ebe8cbc866bb6e6d3b8742532e0c4eeaa8e5def9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:34:21Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:34:21Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add unit tests for the AI feature orchestration in Catalog and Orders\n\nMocks ISemanticSearchTranslator, IReviewModerationScreener and\nIEmbroideryModerationScreener via NSubstitute to cover ProductService,\nReviewService and OrderService''s handling of the AI collaborators\n(orchestration, flag propagation, and the cases where the screener\nmust not even be called) without hitting the real Anthropic API.\n11 new tests (121 -> 132). Updates the spec/README test counts and\nnotes which AI endpoints still lack coverage (RF31-33, called\ndirectly from Backoffice/Catalog endpoints with no service layer).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"054ed52baf43828f9055f99230c5aeb018c7cd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/054ed52baf43828f9055f99230c5aeb018c7cd81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGM4YTQ1ZWE5OThmYTgwM2NlNjU2ZGJhNzYzYzcxNDMxY2E2YmQ2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71","sha":"9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71"}],"sha":"c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c8a45ea998fa803ce656dba763c71431ca6bd692"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:15:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:15:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Document the AI features in the spec catalog and README\n\nAdds Requisitos 19-23, RF28-RF33 and RNF07 covering semantic search,\nreview/embroidery moderation screening, the AI-assisted admin tools\nand the ai-cost rate limit, plus a Status entry noting the features''\nknown gaps (no automated test coverage yet, test-restore.sh unrun,\nrate limiting not extended to the admin AI routes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"ae604bd0828a4bea71c51dc34ef9f0fd5010ee79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/ae604bd0828a4bea71c51dc34ef9f0fd5010ee79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDllZGFlZTQwYmNhYWZiMDhiYTk0NDdhMGY3NzMxMDk4YTUxNjhlNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1","sha":"1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1"}],"sha":"9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9edaee40bcaafb08ba9447a0f7731098a5168e71"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:09:47Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:09:47Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Redesign storefront and admin visual identity\n\nReplaces the brown palette with a honey-gold accent that pairs with\nthe existing salmon and sage colors, gives the logo a prominent,\nimage-based favicon/navbar treatment, makes pages full-bleed with\nmobile-friendly grids, and brings typography and button sizing in\nline across every public and admin page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"933e640b09cd8f518b6ccbaffe1913fc274eb551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/933e640b09cd8f518b6ccbaffe1913fc274eb551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDFlZWY2NDdmYjAxMmYxMGI3Mjg0MzU1NmQ0YTk2NzdmNzg2YWMwYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424","sha":"c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424"}],"sha":"1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1eef647fb012f10b72843556d4a9677f786ac0b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:09:25Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:09:25Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add Anthropic-powered AI features across catalog, orders and backoffice\n\nAdds semantic product search, review and embroidery-text moderation\nscreening, AI-drafted contact replies, product description generation,\na narrative dashboard summary, rate limiting on the AI-cost search\nroute, a backup-restore validation script, and a broadened full-text\nproduct search.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SrtG8z6ytehMcgSVyLKnyg","tree":{"sha":"8c7fa3332e99a3f8cb22251aa40a6ec46b3b2c4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/8c7fa3332e99a3f8cb22251aa40a6ec46b3b2c4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGM1MWJiOWZkNjQxYzhjOGZhZTE1ZmFhNzc2Yjk5MmY2MDFlZDk0MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec","sha":"5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec"}],"sha":"c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c51bb9fd641c8c8fae15faa776b992f601ed9424"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:35:37Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:35:37Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fall back to the signup address when checking out with no saved one\n\nAccounts created before RegisterAsync started also saving a CustomerAddress\n(this session''s earlier fix) only ever got their signup address written to\nCustomer''s own AddressStreet/etc fields — invisible to \"Meus endereços\" and\nto checkout''s prefill, which only reads CustomerAddressService.list() and\npast orders. Both checkout paths now fall back to that same address data\nalready returned by getProfile(), so an existing customer''s original signup\naddress loads too, not just new signups going forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRByfmnRRPdqHAdbRuZTzH","tree":{"sha":"9a48186c005ec44493085067475e74fb0fb0c12f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/9a48186c005ec44493085067475e74fb0fb0c12f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDUxODNkY2ZmMWNlMzFlZTY3NWRhYWU3NzA2MGJiOTIzNTE0NGFjZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830","sha":"f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830"}],"sha":"5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/5183dcff1ce31ee675daae77060bb9235144acec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:16:19Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:16:19Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Save the signup address as the customer''s default saved address\n\nRegistration collects a full address, but it was only ever written to\nCustomer''s own AddressStreet/etc fields — nothing customer-facing reads\nthose (see CustomerAddress''s doc comment: they''re kept only for backward\ncompatibility). \"Meus endereços\" stayed empty and checkout had nothing to\nprefill from until the customer manually added an address or completed a\nfirst order, even though they''d just typed one in at signup.\n\nRegisterAsync now also creates a CustomerAddress (marked default) from the\nsame fields, so it flows into both immediately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRByfmnRRPdqHAdbRuZTzH","tree":{"sha":"9f7f79dfaa309c0906a9d576af3fd14d415eb275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/9f7f79dfaa309c0906a9d576af3fd14d415eb275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGYxNTRhMGE2ZDliYjVmNGEwYmU3NTQwZjk2OGRkYzk1YzM1OTM4MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964","sha":"b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964"}],"sha":"f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f154a0a6d9bb5f4a0be7540f968ddc95c3593830"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T22:55:06Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T22:55:06Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Format prefilled CPF and resume checkout after a login prompted by it\n\nThe checkout CPF field was being prefilled with the raw 11-digit value the\nAPI stores, instead of the punctuated 000.000.000-00 shape the input\notherwise expects — now formatted via a small formatCpf helper shared by\nboth the checkout modal and the standalone /checkout page.\n\nAlso: clicking \"Continuar\" while logged out closed the checkout modal and\nsent the customer to /entrar, but logging in just dropped them back on\nwhatever page they started from — cart intact, but the modal gone and no\nway back into it except finding the cart icon again. The login page now\nreopens the same modal at the delivery step (profile/address prefill and\nall) when the login was triggered that way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRByfmnRRPdqHAdbRuZTzH","tree":{"sha":"17f7309bc3dcc38b1c998af4b4050640479535c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/17f7309bc3dcc38b1c998af4b4050640479535c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGI5YmU4ODg1ZTlmMjU4ZjRiMjU5ODA1MWU4MGUxYzE0MjU0NDE5NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b","sha":"91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b"}],"sha":"b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b9be8885e9f258f4b2598051e80e1c1425441964"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T22:41:53Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T22:41:53Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Log out automatically when the API rejects an expired/invalid token\n\nA stale token in localStorage left the customer/admin UI looking logged in\n(cached name/e-mail) while every authenticated call (profile, addresses,\netc.) quietly 401''d underneath with no error handling — e.g. the checkout\nmodal''s \"Continuar\" step would show the name/e-mail but silently fail to\nprefill phone, CPF and saved address for an already-registered customer.\nThe interceptor now clears the session on a 401 so the UI reflects reality\nand the customer is prompted to log in again instead of looking broken.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRByfmnRRPdqHAdbRuZTzH","tree":{"sha":"cceab59b26b91ccf28dd9ae457b45b85b5b2b295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/cceab59b26b91ccf28dd9ae457b45b85b5b2b295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDkxY2QxOTc1ODY2Y2MyOWQ0YjRjMGQ0Y2JiMDhhZjE2NzRlN2IzM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/908aeeac7d950578279bc7cd3d7405f63c6ceb8f","sha":"908aeeac7d950578279bc7cd3d7405f63c6ceb8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/908aeeac7d950578279bc7cd3d7405f63c6ceb8f"}],"sha":"91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/91cd1975866cc29d4b4c0d4cbb08af1674e7b33b"},{"author":null,"com