Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T21:22:03Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Remove the \"Dicas para o casal\" section and menu links from the storefront\n\nDrops the delivered-work showcase section from the home page and the\ncorresponding \"Dicas para o casal\" links from the header and footer nav.\nThe /dicas-para-o-casal route and gallery page remain reachable directly,\nthey''re just no longer linked from the home page or menu.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRByfmnRRPdqHAdbRuZTzH","tree":{"sha":"f6687930e1e6adf92be174efb5231c3c7bdd6607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/f6687930e1e6adf92be174efb5231c3c7bdd6607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/cd4926cb2e563a2b2f3fe3a504c8bdc0befc8c0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/cd4926cb2e563a2b2f3fe3a504c8bdc0befc8c0d","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGNkNDkyNmNiMmU1NjNhMmIyZjNmZTNhNTA0YzhiZGMwYmVmYzhjMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2","sha":"50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2"}],"sha":"cd4926cb2e563a2b2f3fe3a504c8bdc0befc8c0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/cd4926cb2e563a2b2f3fe3a504c8bdc0befc8c0d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:41:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:41:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Preserve line breaks in the product description on the storefront\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"ad41b277e9cbada9ed790a99cc94dfcc98652d49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/ad41b277e9cbada9ed790a99cc94dfcc98652d49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDUwMjM2YWI1MWEwMjA0NWYxMDA4NWZkMTZiODVhZTAzYjZlNTYyZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6","sha":"bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6"}],"sha":"50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/50236ab51a02045f10085fd16b85ae03b6e562f2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:00:19Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:00:19Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Send an automatic review-request e-mail a few days after delivery\n\nNew background processor (same shape as AbandonedCartReminderProcessor) polls\nfor orders sitting in Entregue past a 5-day wait with no reminder sent yet,\nand raises one e-mail per order inviting the customer to review what they\nbought — the review feature already existed, nothing was nudging customers\nto actually use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"36200c981b1d71fce3dc0705e1e51752f082f03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/36200c981b1d71fce3dc0705e1e51752f082f03a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGJlYTJkZDcwMTU1ZTQxYjJhZDdjZjI2MTg1MTAyMDc0ZGFmYjZkYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5","sha":"1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5"}],"sha":"bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/bea2dd70155e41b2ad7cf26185102074dafb6db6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:59Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:59Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add boleto as a checkout payment method via PagBank\n\nCharges directly against PagBank''s Order API (payment_method BOLETO), same\npattern as the existing PIX/card flow — reaches customers without a credit\ncard. Requires a billing address regardless of delivery method (PagBank''s own\nrequirement), unlike PIX/card which only need one for shipping. Verified\nagainst PagBank''s real sandbox API: barcode + PDF link returned correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"b9d47ae9592f88ee7a67f088955d7f658f8a3e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/b9d47ae9592f88ee7a67f088955d7f658f8a3e50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDFlZmZiYTY3NTdhYmVjNjMwMmMxODU2ZDViN2Q5ZjE1N2U4Mzg4ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355","sha":"8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355"}],"sha":"1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/1effba6757abec6302c1856d5b7d9f157e8388d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:43Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:43Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add a configurable production lead time per product\n\nMade-to-order embroidered items don''t ship instantly — lets the admin set an\nestimated business-day count per product, shown on its public page, to cut\ndown on \"when will it ship\" WhatsApp questions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"9f523e6529f17a43cac0b5b5b572f24f9c79d443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/9f523e6529f17a43cac0b5b5b572f24f9c79d443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDhjMjVmYjFkNGE4N2UzYzI4OGFkOTBhYzE2ZDM0NDFjNjJkYWYzNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55","sha":"0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55"}],"sha":"8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c25fb1d4a87e3c288ad90ac16d3441c62daf355"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:26Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:59:26Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Cache the public product listing to cut SQL load on browsing spikes\n\nShort-TTL IMemoryCache on ListAsync/ListFeaturedAsync/ListCategoriesAsync for\nanonymous reads; every write invalidates it immediately via a shared\nCancellationChangeToken instead of waiting out the TTL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"2ef4947db978b203d9de6d8c15433f417a6a06c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/2ef4947db978b203d9de6d8c15433f417a6a06c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDA3MjlhNWZkYTc1OTQ5MTE1ZTNjOGRkYjljY2IyNjMxOGM4M2JkNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2","sha":"185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2"}],"sha":"0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/0729a5fda75949115e3c8ddb9ccb26318c83bd55"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:32:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:32:18Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Show the atelier''s CNPJ in the storefront footer\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"e69fdd869fb049b60455b37dfff7aa764ba379a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/e69fdd869fb049b60455b37dfff7aa764ba379a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDE4NTQ2NGQwMzFmNmIwZDllMzJkZTgzYjRlYjQ0N2M5ZjdjNDZjZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a","sha":"d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a"}],"sha":"185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/185464d031f6b0d9e32de83b4eb447c9f7c46cf2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:35:39Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:35:39Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Simplify home fabric highlight to just \"100% algodão\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016RqBLQJmEdBeuSkkHU5M3W","tree":{"sha":"0c08226edd9f1ccb67bd538011886c4f7643a527","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/0c08226edd9f1ccb67bd538011886c4f7643a527"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGQzYTYxZTcwZWNmMWE1ZWIxOGVkMGU0ODk5ZGM1Njg0ZWE5ODU5M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995","sha":"2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995"}],"sha":"d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/d3a61e70ecf1a5eb18ed0e4899dc5684ea98593a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:01:35Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:01:35Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Show \"Remover\" for already-anonymized customers in the admin list\n\nThe whole Ações cell, including the delete button, was gated behind\n\"!customer.isAnonymized\" -- so even after fixing\nCustomerAdminService.RemoveAsync to purge an anonymized customer once\ntheir last order is gone, there was no way to trigger it from the\nadmin UI at all. \"Editar\" (and \"Validar e-mail\") stay hidden for an\nanonymized account, but \"Remover\" is now always shown. Also tailors\nthe confirm() message for that case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"8c4885fec735a54a3d4d71e7fa267c0ec58da382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/8c4885fec735a54a3d4d71e7fa267c0ec58da382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDJiNWFhNTJjZWIzZTcyZTgzNTUzZjJiOTU5MTIyMjU5M2NkNGQ5OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640","sha":"44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640"}],"sha":"2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/2b5aa52ceb3e72e83553f2b9591222593cd4d995"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T23:32:11Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T23:32:11Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Clear the cart when the customer taps \"Falar no WhatsApp\" at checkout\n\nWhile online payment is under construction, the only way to \"finish\"\ncheckout is via the WhatsApp handoff -- but the cart items stayed\nbehind, so the badge/cart page kept nagging the customer with items\nthey''d already reached out about. Both checkout entry points (modal\nand standalone /checkout page) now clear the cart when that link is\nclicked, same as a normal successful order does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"28160b8df8af99f9e03f865d4dbb95769f60172e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/28160b8df8af99f9e03f865d4dbb95769f60172e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDQ0ZTE3MzRhYzRhMDQzZmQ4YmFlNGVmOGVlZWFlYTFlZDMwMTY2NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca","sha":"aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca"}],"sha":"44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e1734ac4a043fd8bae4ef8eeeaea1ed3016640"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:56:24Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:56:24Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Allow purging an anonymized customer once their last order is gone\n\nCustomerAdminService.RemoveAsync no-op''d whenever a customer was\nalready anonymized, never re-checking their order count. An admin\ndeleting that customer''s last remaining order (the new order-deletion\nfeature) left an unreachable \"Cliente removido\" ghost row that the\nadmin''s own delete-customer button could never clean up. Now the order\ncount is re-checked every time, so a zero-order anonymized customer\ngets hard-deleted like any other zero-order customer would.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"da0238c8291357d94c4e2c667451401ed418cb89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/da0238c8291357d94c4e2c667451401ed418cb89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGFhMjg0OTBmNTU4YThkNTE3ZDNkODI3ODVjNjEyMWNlMzgwZmEwY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150","sha":"f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150"}],"sha":"aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/aa28490f558a8d517d3d82785c6121ce380fa0ca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:56:12Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:56:12Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix checkout modal never loading customer data after registering\n\nCheckoutModal is mounted once per session and reused across route\nnavigation. Its one-shot profile/address load latched its \"done\" flag\nbefore checking whether a user was logged in, so the very first modal\nopen as an anonymous visitor (the cart icon has no auth check) burned\nthe one-shot forever -- the customer''s name/email/phone/CPF/address\nnever loaded even after registering or logging in and reopening the\nsame modal instance later in the session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"d15f456b5aa56adeab55a753eeec4c331509fb6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/d15f456b5aa56adeab55a753eeec4c331509fb6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGY2MDYyNTYwNjFiNDQ3NjIyYWU3M2M1ZmE0ODYwY2VmYWQyNmUxNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08","sha":"99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08"}],"sha":"f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/f606256061b447622ae73c5fa4860cefad26e150"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:28:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:28:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Deep-link home showcase photos into the gallery lightbox\n\nEach photo in the home''s \"Peças entregues com carinho\" section now\nlinks to /dicas-para-o-casal?foto=<index> instead of doing nothing;\nthe gallery page opens its lightbox on that exact photo once the real\nimages load. Relies on both places calling the same ordered\nGalleryImage listing (CreatedAt desc), so the index lines up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"6fb4f5b428d60fa9f56193b20b2bd3934a6dd82c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/6fb4f5b428d60fa9f56193b20b2bd3934a6dd82c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDk5ZjAwNTQ0YjVhZGQwZDQxNzUwYjE0ZWE4YjYzMGU4NWM4ZjRmMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785","sha":"9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785"}],"sha":"99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/99f00544b5add0d41750b14ea8b630e85c8f4f08"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:46:04Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:46:04Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add spec/ (SDD requirements, design, tasks) for the microservices repo\n\nMirrors the frozen monolith''s Spec-Driven Development format (user\nstory + EARS acceptance criteria per requirement, cross-referenced to\nREADME''s RF/RNF numbers), scoped to what''s actually built in this\narchitecture rather than porting the monolith''s full RF01-RF57\ncatalog. Fixes README''s Requisitos section, which still linked to the\nmonolith''s own spec/, and documents the spec/ convention in CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"fd0a8a0980f7806bcb8196ca3d277dbb904a5a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/fd0a8a0980f7806bcb8196ca3d277dbb904a5a7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDllZjgwOTk2MzkwODVmZTQzM2E5YjMzNjc4ODdjYTEzNDNlMjE3ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c","sha":"7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c"}],"sha":"9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9ef8099639085fe433a9b3367887ca1343e21785"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:28:33Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:28:33Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Update README requirements/status catalog with recent feature work\n\nAdds RF22-RF27 (status-change emails, PDF receipt content, reviews\ncarousel, restricted order deletion, PagBank under-construction gate,\n15-min idle logout) and matching Status entries, which had fallen\nbehind since the last README update at the repo split. Also documents\nthe Galeria -> Dicas para o casal rename.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"fa5b7416f2a484f687d9fe1bc1aa3dbb9bf22488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/fa5b7416f2a484f687d9fe1bc1aa3dbb9bf22488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDdkMWFhZDc4NGE1Njc4MDc4NzZhNmY5NTc2MjdhNWE4OWRhN2ZlMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36","sha":"dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36"}],"sha":"7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d1aad784a567807876a6f957627a5a89da7fe1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:43:14Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:43:14Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Rename storefront Galeria section to \"Dicas para o casal\"\n\nRenames the public gallery nav item, page, SEO metadata, home CTA, and\nsitemap entry from Galeria (/galeria) to Dicas para o casal\n(/dicas-para-o-casal), keeping the same content. /galeria now redirects\nto the new path. The admin management screen keeps the \"Galeria\" label\nsince it''s about managing gallery images, not the customer-facing name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"8b08d545963fb0c2c0d2a3b13836bf23f86548a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/8b08d545963fb0c2c0d2a3b13836bf23f86548a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGRiYThiMTRkOGUxZTEwYmQ4MDA5NTgzODM0N2I4NDJjMzhlOGZhMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7","sha":"48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7"}],"sha":"dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/dba8b14d8e1e10bd80095838347b842c38e8fa36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:43:08Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:43:08Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Auto-logout customer/admin sessions after 15 minutes idle\n\nNew IdleTimeoutService (shared) tracks mouse/keyboard/touch/scroll\nactivity and fires a callback after a configurable timeout, with\nlisteners registered outside Angular''s zone so idle mice movements don''t\ntrigger change detection. PublicLayout and AdminLayout each start their\nown instance around their own auth state (IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS = 15 min) —\nlogs out and redirects to /entrar or /admin/login respectively. Browsing\nanonymously (not logged in) never starts a timer; logging out or the\nlayout being destroyed stops it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"a61fbf7af14c79d8e73aa41f7e27c798adeb13ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/a61fbf7af14c79d8e73aa41f7e27c798adeb13ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDQ4MjYwZWE1NmIyMjMyMjViMjEwYTY0M2RjMTIyZWE3NjMwNDQ5YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189","sha":"44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189"}],"sha":"48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/48260ea56b223225b210a643dc122ea7630449a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:42:41Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:42:41Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Hold payment behind a \"coming soon\" notice until PagBank goes to production\n\nProduction is still running PagBank in sandbox mode (PAGBANK_SANDBOX=true,\nconfirmed on the VPS) — meaning every PIX/card charge today is fake, not\nreal money, even though the checkout flow looks fully functional. Added\nGET /api/payments/pagbank/status (public, no PagBank call, just echoes\nPagBank:Sandbox) so checkout can gate on it before rendering anything.\n\nBoth checkout entry points (the modal and the standalone /checkout page)\nnow replace the payment-method selector and the \"Confirmar pedido\"\nbutton with a \"Pagamento on-line em construção\" notice and a WhatsApp\nlink when sandbox is true — the order summary/coupon/totals stay visible,\njust nothing lets you actually submit an unpayable order. Fails toward\nshowing the notice (not the real form) if the status check itself errors.\n\nVerified: GET /api/payments/pagbank/status returns {\"sandbox\":true}\nagainst the local stack (matching production''s real .env); logged in as\na customer, added an item, and confirmed both entry points show the\nWhatsApp notice with no payment form or submit button reachable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"dd16a68ff75befbb798b12210620e86349b94df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/dd16a68ff75befbb798b12210620e86349b94df2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDQ0ZTE0NmIwZjZiZGU0ODQ4NWFhMDQ3OWExOWJkOGQ2NjE1ZjAxODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37","sha":"a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37"}],"sha":"44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/44e146b0f6bde48485aa0479a19bd8d6615f0189"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:42:15Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:42:15Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add order deletion in admin, restricted to AdminManagement\n\nNew DELETE /api/admin/orders/{id} — requires both the Orders permission\n(the group''s existing requirement) and AdminManagement (added on this\none route specifically), so only whoever holds AdminManagement — the\n\"administradora geral\" in the granular-permissions model — can\npermanently delete order history; the rest of the Orders-permission\nadmins keep read/status/tracking-code access only. OrderItem rows cascade\n(already configured), nothing else references an Order.\n\nAdmin order list: a trash-icon button next to \"Detalhes\", visible only\nwhen auth.hasPermission(''AdminManagement'') is true — the backend is the\nreal enforcement, this is just UX (no point showing a button that would\n403).\n\nVerified against the running stack: an Orders-only admin gets 403; the\nAdminManagement admin gets 204 and the order disappears from the list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"33c6e83f3e3eec221ee3adb95ffb40fa5e80d829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/33c6e83f3e3eec221ee3adb95ffb40fa5e80d829"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGE0NTVlOTFjNzYyNjZmYjI2MWIwYTMwNDQwMmMxZjNlYTE0ZTNiMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4","sha":"c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4"}],"sha":"a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/a455e91c76266fb261b0a304402c1f3ea14e3b37"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:58Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:58Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"UI polish: footer brand wrap, FAQ heading, return-policy wording, tooltips\n\n- Footer''s \"Ateliê Layette Baby\" (.brand-embroidered, fs-3) was wrapping\n  onto two lines in the narrow footer column — reduced to fs-5 and added\n  text-nowrap, keeps the same decorative style, fits on one line.\n- FAQ page: the \"Ajuda\" badge and the \"Perguntas frequentes\" h1 rendered\n  on the same line, because .section-title is display:inline-block (on\n  purpose, elsewhere, so its underline matches the text width exactly)\n  and immediately followed an inline-block badge. Forced both onto their\n  own line with d-block (Bootstrap''s utility carries !important, so it\n  wins over the more specific but non-important .section-title rule).\n- FAQ + Terms of Use: \"posso trocar ou devolver?\" only described\n  defect-based exchanges — added that a plain return (no defect) is only\n  accepted if the piece is in perfect condition: unused, unwashed, and\n  exactly as it was sent.\n- Favorite/wishlist toggle buttons are icon-only with no visible label —\n  added a native title attribute (this app doesn''t load Bootstrap''s JS,\n  so no bootstrap Tooltip component; a native tooltip needs nothing extra\n  and was missing entirely).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"ad591b5a8a90f9fb197009acc0dbaf3f97c191b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/ad591b5a8a90f9fb197009acc0dbaf3f97c191b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGM4OTBmMGUzYjJmZjNmM2Y1YzY1MjlkZWE3YWFiNTgyMDM5NWVhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92","sha":"7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92"}],"sha":"c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c890f0e3b2ff3f3f5c6529dea7aab5820395eaf4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:40Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:40Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Turn the homepage reviews section into an actual carousel\n\nWas a static grid showing every featured review at once. Now shows one\nreview at a time (prev/next controls + dot indicators, auto-advances\nevery 6s, pauses/resets on manual navigation) using Bootstrap''s carousel\nmarkup — driven manually via activeReviewIndex, since this app never\nloads Bootstrap''s JS bundle (see public-layout.ts''s dropdown/collapse\ncomment for why).\n\nNeeded the carousel SCSS partial in *two* places, not one: this app is a\nNative Federation shell + remotes, and when Home renders composed under\nthe shell (the only way a real user sees it), the styles actually in\neffect are the shell''s own src/styles.scss — storefront''s own\nstyles.scss (which I''d added the partial to first) only governs\nstorefront running standalone. Found this by checking\ndocument.styleSheets in the composed page and getting zero \".carousel\"\nrules despite the storefront-standalone build having 53 of them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"cf8a5f18f38e1300edc46dce54a75d430e9daffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/cf8a5f18f38e1300edc46dce54a75d430e9daffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDdhMTdhM2ZhNGMyZWY4N2JlYjZiMDcwNDRjMDAxZjU5MTU2ZmJmOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599","sha":"471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599"}],"sha":"7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7a17a3fa4c2ef87beb6b07044c001f59156fbf92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:25Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:41:25Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Make the PDF receipt look like an actual receipt: logo, letterhead, items table\n\nWas plain jsPDF text lines with no branding. Now: the ateliê''s logo\n(fetched from /images/logo-atelie.png and embedded, not hardcoded as\nbase64 in source), the company name/address/CNPJ as a letterhead and\nfooter, and the line items as a real bordered table (jspdf-autotable)\nwith quantity/item (embroidery details included when present)/unit\nprice/subtotal columns instead of one line of plain text per item.\n\nAdds SITE_ADDRESS and SITE_CNPJ to core/constants/site.ts — the address\nis the same one already used as the shipping-estimate''s departure point\n(shipping.service.ts previously had its own private copy of this string;\nit now imports the shared constant instead of duplicating it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"b0b37376b9fb90a2272b8e3e9a1daf2ebaca9134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/b0b37376b9fb90a2272b8e3e9a1daf2ebaca9134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDQ3MTU0MGM5OWM0ZTFiZTQ0Zjg2ODA2MTU1NDE0YzI0MmFlNDc1OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0","sha":"c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0"}],"sha":"471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/471540c99c4e1be44f86806155414c242ae47599"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:40:57Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:40:57Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix order-status-change emails silently failing on every status change\n\nOrderStatusChangedDomainEvent.OldStatus/NewStatus are the OrderStatus\nenum, but the outbox serializer used System.Text.Json''s default\n(numeric) enum representation while the Notifications consumer''s\nmatching record declares them as string (it has no reference to\nOrders.Core''s enum type, by design — services don''t share CLR types\nacross the event boundary). Every single status change — \"Recebido\" to\n\"EmProducao\" included, and cancellations — threw a JsonException in the\nconsumer before ever reaching SendOrderStatusChangedAsync, so no e-mail\n(or WhatsApp) notification went out for any transition.\n\nFixed at the shared serializer used to write every domain event to the\noutbox: enums now serialize as their string name. This is the only\ndomain event with an enum property today, so nothing else changes\nbehavior, but it''s a general fix, not a one-off workaround — any future\nevent with an enum field gets this for free.\n\nVerified against the running stack: created an order, changed its status\nvia the admin API, and confirmed the consumer''s log went from\n\"JsonException: ... Path: $.OldStatus\" to a clean (though locally\nunconfigured) Resend/WhatsApp attempt — same failure mode as\nOrderCreatedDomainEvent, which was never affected by this bug.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"0748d54ba4db05f25703c32d8c77a9fce7ab0413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/0748d54ba4db05f25703c32d8c77a9fce7ab0413"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGM2YzAwZDRkN2ZhMzg5YzhlMjI2MmU4ODlkNjYzYjExYTZjZjNiZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588","sha":"e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588"}],"sha":"c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/c6c00d4d7fa389c8e2262e889d663b11a6cf3be0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:29:46Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:29:46Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Set up standalone repo: CI workflow, CLAUDE.md, fix README paths\n\nExtracted from pauloffalves1/atelie-bebe''s microservices/ subtree via\ngit subtree split. Adds the CI workflow (copied from the monorepo,\npaths updated since there''s no more microservices/ prefix) and a\nCLAUDE.md for this repo specifically. Fixes README.md references that\nassumed the old monorepo layout (../.github/workflows/microservices-ci.yml,\n\"microservices/\" path prefixes, the old repo''s intro paragraph).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"253038c0f6630b06bad699aaf303281ab96329a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/253038c0f6630b06bad699aaf303281ab96329a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGU2ODQyZTZhMGFkYjRhOTE3MDkyYThlZGEwNjA2NGU1YzdjOWQ1ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36","sha":"3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36"}],"sha":"e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/e6842e6a0adb4a917092a8eda06064e5c7c9d588"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:53:04Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:53:04Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix local dotnet-run dev configs (stale SQLite conn strings) + gitignore uploads\n\nThe 4 appsettings.Development.json files (Identity, Catalog, Orders,\nBackoffice) still had SQLite connection strings (\"Data Source=identity.db\"\netc.) left over from before the SQLite -> SQL Server migration. Since\neach DbContext now calls UseSqlServer unconditionally, this silently\nbroke `dotnet run` outside Docker (the only local-dev path that actually\nreads these files) — the SQLite string gets parsed as an invalid SQL\nServer address. Fixed to the same localhost/Trusted_Connection string\nalready hardcoded as each service''s fallback default.\n\nAlso adds services/catalog/AtelieBebe.Catalog.Api/uploads/ to .gitignore\n— there was no entry for it, so a local dev uploads folder (e.g. restored\nfrom a production backup) would have been picked up by a broad `git add`.\n\nVerified by restoring a real production SQL Server backup (via\nops/backup-dbs.sh''s .bak files, pulled over SSH) into a local SQL Server\ninstance and running Identity via `dotnet run`: connects, applies the\nAddAdminPermissions migration cleanly, serves login requests. Confirmed\nvia direct SSH into production''s sqlserver container that none of this\ntouched the real production database (its __EFMigrationsHistory still\nonly has InitialCreate).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"8952d1de691d5d9388e17fdb3eb14cf34fcc1403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/8952d1de691d5d9388e17fdb3eb14cf34fcc1403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDNlZjgxODM1ZDc3MGRmMTg0NGNiZDdlMjc2ZjAzZmM3NTBmOTViMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a","sha":"9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a"}],"sha":"3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/3ef81835d770df1844cbd7e276f03fc750f95b36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:57:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:57:23Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add granular admin permissions, multi-admin management, self-service password change\n\nAdmins are no longer all-or-nothing: AdminPermission (SharedKernel) is a\n[Flags] enum, one flag per feature area (Products, Orders, Coupons,\nReviews, ContactMessages, Newsletter, Customers, SiteContent, Dashboard,\nAdminManagement). Identity issues one JWT claim per granted flag; every\nservice registers one authorization policy per flag and each admin\nendpoint group now requires its specific permission instead of blanket\n\"AdminOnly\".\n\n- AdminManagement is itself just a flag — whoever holds it can register\n  new admins (POST /api/admin/admins) and edit anyone''s permissions,\n  including their own, via the new \"Administradores\" admin page.\n  AdminManagementService refuses to remove AdminManagement from, or\n  delete, the last admin who holds it, and refuses self-deletion.\n- Any admin can change their own password (POST /api/admin/auth/change-\n  password, added to the existing \"Segurança\" page alongside 2FA) with\n  no AdminManagement permission needed — same self-service rule already\n  used for 2FA.\n- The seeded admin gets AdminPermission.All; a migration backfills the\n  same to every pre-existing admin (SQL-level default on the ADD COLUMN\n  only, not a model-level default — see the comment in\n  AdminConfiguration.cs on why that distinction matters for a brand-new\n  admin created with zero permissions).\n- admin-layout.html hides nav items the current admin lacks permission\n  for (UX only — the backend policy is the actual enforcement).\n\nVerified against the running stack: seeded admin gets all 10 permission\nclaims; a limited admin gets 403 on ungranted areas and 200 on granted\nones; change-password works; both safety guards (last AdminManagement\nholder, self-deletion) return 409. 121/121 unit tests and 7/7 e2e still\npass. Requirements RF18-RF21 added to microservices/README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"256235cba20466aa613ef181540eb28c67b01e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/256235cba20466aa613ef181540eb28c67b01e92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDliOTdmODg4YmM5NDkyYWE2ZDY5NzM1ZjllMTJiZjZmMDU0NzI5NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc","sha":"6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc"}],"sha":"9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/9b97f888bc9492aa6d69735f9e12bf6f0547296a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:06:39Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:06:39Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Document the real shipping origin address; seed 3 fake 5-star reviews\n\nshipping.service.ts: added SHIPPING_ORIGIN_ADDRESS (Avenida Getúlio\nVargas, 1730 - Baeta Neves, São Bernardo do Campo - SP, 09751-251) as the\ndocumented departure point the by-state estimate is relative to — no\nlogic change, there''s still no real Correios/postage-contract API this\ngets sent to.\n\nCatalog''s DbInitializer: seeds 3 pre-approved 5-star reviews (fixed\ncustomer GUIDs, so restarts don''t duplicate them) across 3 of the seeded\nproducts, for the homepage testimonials section to have content. Verified\nvia the running stack (GET /api/products/reviews/featured) and idempotent\nacross a container restart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"30ac7fa3ca19b7c3f3ad4ecc7cb4e7381c0db01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/30ac7fa3ca19b7c3f3ad4ecc7cb4e7381c0db01a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDZhMGEzMjAyOThkMjhhMDg0NDczZWEwMmQyODhjNmM4ZTk1MWZkZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708","sha":"fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708"}],"sha":"6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/6a0a320298d28a084473ea02d288c6c8e951fddc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:55:58Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:55:58Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix high-severity NuGet vulnerabilities in microservices\n\n- Microsoft.OpenApi 2.3.0 -> 2.12.2 in the 4 Api projects (GHSA-v5pm-xwqc-g5wc,\n  stack overflow parsing untrusted OpenAPI documents with circular refs).\n- SQLitePCLRaw.lib.e_sqlite3 pinned to 3.53.3 in DataMigration.csproj,\n  overriding the vulnerable 2.1.11 pulled transitively via\n  Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite (GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q, memory\n  corruption). No advisory-listed fixed version existed for 2.1.11 itself;\n  a newer SQLitePCLRaw major line does carry the fix.\n\ndotnet list package --vulnerable now reports none across the solution;\nbuild and all 109 unit tests still pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"0d74c01bd360223510f473ae3f9ee93aa198d9d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/0d74c01bd360223510f473ae3f9ee93aa198d9d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGZjNTI0N2RjM2M1MDgyOTBjMWM1NDE2MDk2NDMxNDYyYzNjNTk3MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb","sha":"b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb"}],"sha":"fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/fc5247dc3c508290c1c5416096431462c3c59708"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:27:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:27:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Run the k6 load test in CI, reusing the e2e job''s docker compose stack\n\nAdds a step after the Playwright run that fires load-tests/gateway-smoke.js\nagainst the already-running Gateway via `docker run --network host`\n(works cleanly on GitHub''s ubuntu runners since the runner is the Docker\nhost directly). Avoids paying for a second compose build/up just for\nthis. README updated to match — k6 is no longer listed as \"not run in CI\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"fb0e938959d86de84f0f357ba29dc5e1ee203ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/fb0e938959d86de84f0f357ba29dc5e1ee203ecb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKGIxNjM2OTEzMTRjMzM3MDdjMWJlNTFkZjNmN2NiNWU5ODQ5NWI4ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9","sha":"14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9"}],"sha":"b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/b163691314c33707c1be51df3f7cb5e98495b8eb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:16:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:16:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add CI, a solution-wide dotnet test, and validate the load/e2e suite\n\n- AtelieBebe.Microservices.slnx: one dotnet test for all 5 *.Core.Tests\n  projects (109 tests) instead of running each directory separately.\n- .github/workflows/microservices-ci.yml: unit-tests job runs that\n  solution; e2e job generates a throwaway JWT key pair + dummy .env,\n  brings up docker compose, and runs the 7 Playwright specs.\n- README: documents both, corrects the e2e troubleshooting note (the\n  failure isn''t npx resolving a duplicate @playwright/test — it''s Windows\n  drive-letter casing mismatches corrupting Playwright''s suite registry),\n  records that the k6 load test was actually run (p95 57ms vs. a 500ms\n  budget, 0% errors), and notes New Relic stays pending since it needs a\n  real cluster and license key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"4d7935532c011e7f4ef114c3d0a3dd01216f9c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/4d7935532c011e7f4ef114c3d0a3dd01216f9c2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDE0ZGM0M2Q0ZTUxNzg1M2UzYTI3YjhlMjg5N2FjZWE3ZGVlNDRlYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90","sha":"969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90"}],"sha":"14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/14dc43d4e517853e3a27b8e2897acea7dee44ec9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:53:57Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:53:57Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Fix flaky e2e run by pinning Playwright to a single worker\n\nRunning the 3 e2e specs with the default worker count made the first\nnavigation in the run flaky: two workers hitting the dev servers at once\nmade a cold chunk compile (Native Federation) slower than the default 5s\nexpect timeout, occasionally failing home-and-shop''s initial hero\nassertion. Confirmed 7/7 passing consistently with workers: 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"d7a827d47fc59e17c04e8bacb42954289d9f8f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/d7a827d47fc59e17c04e8bacb42954289d9f8f1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDk2OWU2MmFmM2E4MjgyN2ZlMTBhMTRiNDVmNmZhMzIwNTBiMDRhOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9","sha":"8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9"}],"sha":"969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/969e62af3a82827fe10a14b45f6fa32050b04a90"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:38:32Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:38:32Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add test strategy for microservices: unit, TDD, BDD, e2e and load tests\n\n109 xUnit tests across 5 new *.Core.Tests projects (SharedKernel, Orders,\nCatalog, Identity, Backoffice), a Reqnroll BDD feature for order\ncancellation, Playwright e2e specs, and a k6 load test script against the\nGateway. Also fixes Coupon.Create to reject codes with spaces/symbols\n(TDD red-green example documented in the README), and rewrites\nmicroservices/README.md with domain storytelling, event storming, and a\nfull requirements/testing-strategy writeup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WFiDtt2dHcmRqBPfS5vvXG","tree":{"sha":"76825ec6e705d54cc839ecd532f93d88f2e86692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/76825ec6e705d54cc839ecd532f93d88f2e86692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDhjNzE5ZTRkNmM4MTAxMGRlOTU0MWZkNGExNmM1YTk2MTlkNjQ5ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348","sha":"7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348"}],"sha":"8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/8c719e4d6c81010de9541fd4a16c5a9619d649e9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:25:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:25:34Z","email":"paulofranciscofeltranalves@gmail.com","name":"pauloffalves1"},"message":"Add homepage testimonials section using approved reviews\n\nNew GET /api/products/reviews/featured (public) returns the best\napproved reviews that have a comment, ordered by rating then recency,\njoined with product name/slug for the link-back. Reuses the Gateway''s\nexisting catalog-products-route catch-all, no new route needed.\n\nHome page shows up to 6 as star-rated testimonial cards linking to\ntheir product — hidden entirely when there are none yet, same \"no fake\nplaceholders\" rule as the existing showcase-photos section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PKxn8pdh6q1dCAFsnqkDpD","tree":{"sha":"63def8356c9a5eada78ac15e2e5ca890a0243596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/trees/63def8356c9a5eada78ac15e2e5ca890a0243596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/git/commits/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348","node_id":"C_kwDOUVPEINoAKDdkNjc4MDg5MDMzYmQ3MDZiZmJkZGE5Mzc0MjZlNjU2NTJhZDEzNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commit/7ec4e286ff3b504ccefb514571cd045ebea3d62b","sha":"7ec4e286ff3b504ccefb514571cd045ebea3d62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7ec4e286ff3b504ccefb514571cd045ebea3d62b"}],"sha":"7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits/7d678089033bd706bfbdda937426e65652ad1348"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/pauloffalves1/atelie-layette-baby-microservicos/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=aba128b644d9a06596f8cca7962a99477a5107cc&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A44%3A21.324Z"}');
