"name":"David Wang"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-10T16:58:33Z","committedDate":"2026-09-10T17:01:03Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"dwang-CXDO","providerType":"User"},"email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:36:45.264Z","repositoryId":1364645446,"sha":"691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:36:45.264Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/2505abd72e914702d4aa2ff99d2ba7d529a18ae1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:36:25Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:36:25Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"message":"Fix stale artwork when switching Pokemon with the detail panel open\n\nThe detail panel held its image URL in state initialised from props. A\nuseState initializer runs once, and the panel stays mounted when the selection\nchanges, so every text field re-rendered from the new props while the image kept\nthe URL captured when the panel first opened — the previous Pokemon''s artwork\nbeside the next one''s name and stats.\n\nThe URL is now derived from props on every render, and state remembers only\nwhich id''s artwork 404''d, so the sprite fallback stays attached to the Pokemon\nit belongs to. Same treatment in the card, which is keyed by id and so was not\naffected today, but carries the identical shape.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JnPtsHsXzbApqMpY6k4Pm9","tree":{"sha":"bf9255a7fdea68c7931525dce511bfd0873bd031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/trees/bf9255a7fdea68c7931525dce511bfd0873bd031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/commits/2505abd72e914702d4aa2ff99d2ba7d529a18ae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commit/2505abd72e914702d4aa2ff99d2ba7d529a18ae1","node_id":"C_kwDOUVbWRtoAKDI1MDVhYmQ3MmU5MTQ3MDJkNGFhMmZmOTlkMmJhN2Q1MjlhMThhZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commit/88be361e15973f1bb05b16fc153e93fb4211ce72","sha":"88be361e15973f1bb05b16fc153e93fb4211ce72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/88be361e15973f1bb05b16fc153e93fb4211ce72"}],"sha":"2505abd72e914702d4aa2ff99d2ba7d529a18ae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/2505abd72e914702d4aa2ff99d2ba7d529a18ae1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/88be361e15973f1bb05b16fc153e93fb4211ce72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:16:02Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:16:02Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"message":"Correct the registration docs to the endpoints this platform actually serves\n\nINSTALL.md described POST /ui-extensions and a /versions submission, taken from\nthe SDK scaffold docs. netsapiens-api-v2''s HorizonExtensionsController serves\nPOST /ui-extensions/registry to register and POST /ui-extensions/registry/{id}\n/deploy to fetch, verify, hash and promote in one call — the old /versions verb\nanswers 405 pointing at /deploy.\n\nAlso documents what the deploy response means (approved vs flagged vs rejected,\nunchanged, promoted/landed), that the id is derived server-side from\nwebpack_module, and how to check approved_cdn_origins when a deploy is refused\nbefore any fetch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JnPtsHsXzbApqMpY6k4Pm9","tree":{"sha":"9608f1677c8b9b1a77305da6cb56de6906dce2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/trees/9608f1677c8b9b1a77305da6cb56de6906dce2a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/commits/88be361e15973f1bb05b16fc153e93fb4211ce72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","typ