mail":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"message":"deploy.sh: default to the ~/toOci1 identity for core1-phx\n\nSame user, host and key David already SSHes with, with SSH_KEY/SSH_OPTS as the\noverrides and a readable-key check so a missing key says so rather than failing\nthree commands later.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JnPtsHsXzbApqMpY6k4Pm9","tree":{"sha":"b62f04d6d381027f3678167de006ed16f02c0ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/trees/b62f04d6d381027f3678167de006ed16f02c0ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/commits/49b1f5698b8fa3dbb15916848458ae51df6881e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commit/49b1f5698b8fa3dbb15916848458ae51df6881e5","node_id":"C_kwDOUVbWRtoAKDQ5YjFmNTY5OGI4ZmEzZGJiMTU5MTY4NDg0NThhZTUxZGY2ODgxZTU","