on stay manual — they\nare one-time per instance, and doing them from a deploy script would hide an\nAPI write behind a routine command.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JnPtsHsXzbApqMpY6k4Pm9","tree":{"sha":"3a5f0c4e678232e82d0db39f7a79b0c0f9e92536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/trees/3a5f0c4e678232e82d0db39f7a79b0c0f9e92536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/commits/552f5eb5fba6730203f0433037ca1ad3f6c7085e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commit/552f5eb5fba6730203f0433037ca1ad3f6c7085e","node_id":"C_kwDOUVbWRtoAKDU1MmY1ZWI1ZmJhNjczMDIwM2YwNDMzMDM3Y2ExYWQzZjZjNzA4NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commit/691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02","sha":"691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02"}],"sha":"552f5eb5fba6730203f0433037ca1ad3f6c7085e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/552f5eb5fba6730203f0433037ca1ad3f6c7085e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/commits/691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:58:33Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:01:03Z","email":"dwang@crexendo.com","name":"David Wang"},"message":"Pokemon: standalone Horizon app for a Pokedex page under Apps\n\nA Module Federation remote in the shape of horizon-vcon-app, registered into\nthe /apps menu alongside horizon-sdk-demo''s Example CRM. Search over the whole\ndex index (fetched once), a card grid that pages in 60 at a time, and a detail\npanel with official artwork, the English Pokedex entry, types and base stats.\n\nData comes from the public PokeAPI over HTTPS, so unlike the vCon app there is\nno Apache proxy and no server-side token — static files plus a registration row\nare the whole install. Card artwork is addressed on the sprite CDN by dex\nnumber, so a full grid costs no API calls.\n\nSDK 0.2.x conventions throughout: chunk SRI, source maps with sourcesContent,\nthe SDK kept out of webpack `shared`, a single-sourced federation name, the\ncontextRef page wrapper, and every visible element from horizonContext.ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JnPtsHsXzbApqMpY6k4Pm9","tree":{"sha":"28ca3fdc2c85a891ee935828713cc55864ebe730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/trees/28ca3fdc2c85a891ee935828713cc55864ebe730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwang-CXDO/horizon-pokemon-app/git/commits/691385fbd3f1b7d686b0bf3699eda6c9d740ba02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8418101?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwang-CXDO","id":8418101,"login":"dwang-CXDO","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTgxMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwang-CXDO","user_view_t