ecía que el motor de BD estaba por definir y mandaba a la\ncarpeta equivocada del microfrontend. Ahora explica la estructura, los\nrequisitos, cómo guardar el secreto de Auth0, arrancar backend y\nfrontend, jugar desde el Shell, correr las pruebas de integración en\nlocal (MEMORY_TEST_CONNECTION) y la configuración de appsettings.json.","tree":{"sha":"07de3587f16f1254e482af660a865e5effc0838a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/07de3587f16f1254e482af660a865e5effc0838a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/f062a8b190ae35bf114f0a301a38124c2df64719","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/f062a8b190ae35bf114f0a301a38124c2df64719","node_id":"C_kwDOUVnb-toAKGYwNjJhOGIxOTBhZTM1YmYxMTRmMGEzMDFhMzgxMjRjMmRmNjQ3MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773","sha":"83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773"}],"sha":"f062a8b190ae35bf114f0a301a38124c2df64719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/f062a8b190ae35bf114f0a301a38124c2df64719"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:20:01Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:20:01Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"refactor(integracion): formatear y documentar el código de la integración\n\nSin cambios de comportamiento: se reordena y comenta en español el código\nde la entrega del Equipo 3 para que el equipo pueda explicarlo.\n\n- MemoryHub: JoinMatch, previsualización (ahora en su propio método),\n  reconexión y FlipCard comentados paso a paso.\n- Program, MemoryAuth, MatchmakingGateway, FinishWorker,\n  ResultRetryWorker y FinishNotification formateados y documentados.\n- Comentarios en las partes nuevas de MemoryGameService,\n  TurnTimerService, GameSession.Snapshot, GameResultService y los\n  controladores.\n- Frontend: servicio del hub, orquestador, GameModule y servicio HTTP.\n- Los logs de advertencia incluyen la excepción para poder diagnosticar.","tree":{"sha":"feea5d48d0fb6bd55ad7a3643e374b0d427d3c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/feea5d48d0fb6bd55ad7a3643e374b0d427d3c29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773","node_id":"C_kwDOUVnb-toAKDgzODQyYzg1ZDM4ZjdkODk0YWRlNTQzMzBlNDVlNGJhOGE2MmE3NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/75fc49a1cb577bb04541bf4ab5204d1c9683d804","sha":"75fc49a1cb577bb04541bf4ab5204d1c9683d804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/75fc49a1cb577bb04541bf4ab5204d1c9683d804"}],"sha":"83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/83842c85d38f7d894ade54330e45e4ba8a62a773"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/75fc49a1cb577bb04541bf4ab5204d1c9683d804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:42:02Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:42:02Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"feat(integracion): validar tokens de Auth0 y avisar a Matchmaking al terminar\n\nIncorpora la entrega de integración preparada por el Equipo 3 (Shell)\nsobre c2ac891.\n\n- La API y el hub validan el JWT de Auth0 (RS256, audiencia de Memory);\n  la identidad del jugador sale de \"sub\" y no del navegador.\n- JoinMatch valida la sala en Matchmaking (juego memory, estado Started,\n  dos participantes y membresía del jugador). FlipCard ya no recibe\n  userId.\n- Al terminar, el resultado y el aviso se guardan juntos; una cola\n  persistente llama a POST /api/matches/{id}/finish con un token M2M\n  (matches.finish) y reintenta los fallos temporales (ADR-004).\n- Reconexión: StateSnapshot devuelve cartas, marcador, turno y\n  vencimiento sin repetir la previsualización.\n- Historial y estadísticas solo para el mismo usuario; resultados solo\n  para participantes. CORS desde Cors:Origins.\n- Migración AgregarAvisosMatchmaking (tabla FinishNotifications).\n- Pruebas de integración de API, JWT, SignalR, SQL y Matchmaking\n  (contrato 05).\n- GameContext requiere getAccessToken y getMatchmakingAccessToken del\n  Shell; pendiente de que el Equipo 3 publique ese soporte.\n- Scripts para guardar el Client Secret con user-secrets y arrancar con\n  migraciones. El secreto no se versiona.","tree":{"sha":"9f9867b087dbe0898d3b05d573e12f949b406cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/9f9867b087dbe0898d3b05d573e12f949b406cb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/75fc49a1cb577bb04541bf4ab5204d1c9683d804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"