tps://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/64b85580cc9add63fcaa834f39dbe982c19b8f5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:27:08Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:27:08Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"feat(frontend): migrar el microfrontend a Aurelia 2\n\nEl Shell exige Aurelia 2.0.0-rc.2 exacta, Node 24 y Webpack 5 (ADR-003)\ny comparte Aurelia como singleton con strictVersion: un microfrontend en\nAurelia 1 no puede cargarse dentro del Shell.\n\n- Herramientas: webpack con @aurelia/webpack-loader y Module Federation\n  (remoteEntry.js, dependencias compartidas copiadas del Shell en\n  mf-shared.js), Node 24 en .nvmrc. Se quitan aurelia-cli y\n  aurelia_project.\n- Componentes y servicios con resolve() y @singleton de Aurelia 2;\n  plantillas con <import> en vez de <require>.\n- memory-standalone es la raíz del modo independiente (desarrollo local\n  con código de partida) y game-view agrupa tablero y resultado.\n- Jest con @aurelia/ts-jest y jsdom, igual que el Shell, con pruebas del\n  orquestador. Se reemplaza la prueba de ejemplo de la plantilla.\n- ESLint: tsconfigRootDir absoluto, como pide typescript-eslint actual.","tree":{"sha":"fb3473e904cf0dc49db4d18f1ee33e6e27fea446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/fb3473e904cf0dc49db4d18f1ee33e6e27fea446"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/64b85580cc9add63fcaa834f39dbe982c19b8f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu