500); si la\n  partida no terminó, 400. La hora de inicio ya no viene del cliente.\n- GET /api/games/memory/results/{matchId}: resultado con sus jugadores.\n- GET /api/games/memory/players/{userId}/history reemplaza a\n  /history/{userId}.\n- GET /api/games/memory/players/{userId}/stats: partidas jugadas,\n  ganadas, perdidas, empatadas, total de parejas, mejor puntaje y\n  promedio (GameHistoryService.GetStatsByPlayerAsync).\n- BattleHub.Memory.Api.http con requests de los endpoints reales.","tree":{"sha":"eaa077f92aba17058655068309559d0851077b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/eaa077f92aba17058655068309559d0851077b41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/1600bb12bcf74e798b2dcc0e5a411db971049767","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/1600bb12bcf74e798b2dcc0e5a411db971049767","node_id":"C_kwDOUVnb-toAKDE2MDBiYjEyYmNmNzRlNzk4YjJkY2MwZTVhNDExZGI5NzEwNDk3Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/9d556377530e5568ba2d85a3ef27eb639f4f3c8a","sha":"9d556377530e5568ba2d85a3ef27eb639f4f3c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/9d556377530e5568ba2d85a3ef27eb639f4f3c8a"}],"sha":"1600bb12bcf74e798b2dcc0e5a411db971049767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/1600bb12bcf74e798b2dcc0e5a411db971049767"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/9d556377530e5568ba2d85a3ef27eb639f4f3c8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:38:18Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:38:18Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"fix(data): guardar el resultado una sola vez desde el backend\n\nLos dos navegadores llamaban a POST /results al terminar y la partida se\nguardaba dos veces. Además, el contrato 04 indica que el resultado lo\nguarda el backend del juego, no el microfrontend.\n\n- GameResultService.SaveResultAsync es idempotente: si ya existe un\n  resultado con ese MatchId, devuelve su Id sin insertar otro.\n- Se agrega GetByMatchIdAsync (con jugadores y AsNoTracking).\n- MatchResultRecorder (singleton) serializa el guardado por partida con\n  un SemaphoreSlim y usa la hora de inicio registrada por el servidor.\n- MemoryHub.FlipCard detiene el temporizador y guarda el resultado al\n  terminar la partida, después de enviar CardFlipped; si la BD falla se\n  registra en el log sin romper la jugada.","tree":{"sha":"ace4069d01cbe4b426b2e566fafb75ae3f751936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/ace4069d01cbe4b426b2e566fafb75ae3f751936"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/9d556377530e5568ba2d85a3ef27eb639f4f3c8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User",