te":"2026-10-04T02:38:01Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"fix(hub): informar el turno en CardFlipped y no repetir la previsualización\n\n- CardFlipped incluye CurrentPlayerId e IsFinished, así el cliente no\n  tiene que adivinar de quién es el turno después de una jugada.\n- FlipCard lanza HubException si la partida no existe (antes salía una\n  InvalidOperationException sin manejar).\n- MemoryGameService agrega TryGetSession y protege con el lock las\n  lecturas de sesiones.\n- AddPlayer informa con sessionCreated si la llamada creó la partida:\n  JoinMatch solo inicia la previsualización en ese caso, para que no se\n  repita cuando alguien vuelve a unirse (por ejemplo, al reconectarse).","tree":{"sha":"a76b38c04b853ebb134aca782af4c47581e9e8d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/a76b38c04b853ebb134aca782af4c47581e9e8d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/1d94c324e59f0dde61b7dc1055b8180d5a76c7d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/1d94c324e59f0dde61b7dc1055b8180d5a76c7d1","node_id":"C_kwDOUVnb-toAKDFkOTRjMzI0ZTU5ZjBkZGU2MWI3ZGMxMDU1YjgxODBkNWE3NmM3ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commit/7d919507b4f12449ae6baf2752f40cf4e0a42194","sha":"7d919507b4f12449ae6baf2752f40cf4e0a42194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/7d919507b4f12449ae6baf2752f40cf4e0a42194"}],"sha":"1d94c324e59f0dde61b7dc1055b8180d5a76c7d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/1d94c324e59f0dde61b7dc1055b8180d5a76c7d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/commits/7d919507b4f12449ae6baf2752f40cf4e0a42194/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:37:45Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:37:45Z","email":"pablodavidgomezv@gmail.com","name":"PabloD6003"},"message":"fix(hub): mover el temporizador de turno a TurnTimerService\n\nEl Hub es transient: el diccionario _turnTimers arrancaba vacío en cada\nllamada (los timers viejos nunca se cancelaban) y RunTurnTimer usaba\nClients después de que terminó la llamada, así que TurnTimeout nunca\nllegaba a los clientes aunque el servidor sí cambiaba el turno.\n\nTurnTimerService es singleton, usa IHubContext<MemoryHub> y un timer por\npartida. Start reemplaza y cancela el timer anterior, guarda el número de\nturno y usa TryForfeitTurnByTimeout para no quitar un turno ya jugado.\nLas excepciones se registran con ILogger porque corre fuera de un request.","tree":{"sha":"0dbcb2682300fae867fc6903573ffb058653c134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/trees/0dbcb2682300fae867fc6903573ffb058653c134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulapgarciazzz/battlehub-game-memory/git/commits/7d919507b4f12449ae6baf2752f40cf4e0a42194","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102834899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloD6003","id":102834899,"login":"PabloD6003","node_id":"U_kgDOBiEi0w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloD6003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su