b.com/users/yaaqin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yaaqin","id":122687581,"login":"yaaqin","node_id":"U_kgDOB1AQXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yaaqin/shell-mfe/commits/a09a7689b411e79ea35db5520b36f35c1df9e68d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T02:20:50Z","email":"yaqin.me@gmail.com","name":"Yaaqin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T02:20:50Z","email":"yaqin.me@gmail.com","name":"Yaaqin"},"message":"Add Dockerfiles + docker-compose for all 4 services\n\n- backend/Dockerfile: multi-stage (deps -> prisma generate + nest build ->\n  prod-only runner), openssl added for Prisma''s musl query engine on alpine\n- web-csr/Dockerfile, web-ssr/Dockerfile: multi-stage using Next''s\n  output: \"standalone\" for a minimal runner image; NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\n  passed as a build ARG for web-csr since it''s inlined into the browser\n  bundle at build time, not readable at container start\n- gateway/Dockerfile: plain node:20-alpine, no build step\n- docker-compose.yml: all 4 services on one internal bridge network,\n  reaching each other by service name; gateway (9760) and backend (9761)\n  published to the host, web-csr/web-ssr internal-only\n- *.env.docker.example templates per service (Docker-networking values\n  differ from the local-dev .env.example files) + root .env.docker.example\n  for the NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL build arg\n- .dockerignore per service\n- next.config.js: output: \"standalone\" in both frontends\n\nVerified end to end: built and ran all 4 images individually, then the\nfull docker-compose stack — gateway correctly proxies to web-csr/web-ssr\nby service name, both reach backend by service name, backend connects to\nthe real Postgres DB from inside its container, and the full\nlogin-error/handoff/redirect flow was re-run against the composed stack\nwith the same Playwright checks used for the non-Docker setup.\n\nREADME: added a \"Running with Docker\" section\nDEPLOY-CONTEXT.md: updated to reflect Docker is already built and tested","tree":{"sha":"88740fa12bea11726766e61e59349cdbee47ceae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yaaqin/shell-mfe/git/trees/88740fa12bea11726766e61e59349cdbee47ceae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yaaqin/shell-mfe/git/commits/a09a7689b411e79ea35db5520b36f35c1df9e68d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122687581?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yaaqin","id":122687581,"login":"yaaqin","node_id":"U_kgDOB1AQXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yaaqin","user_view_type":"public"},"htm