abinsaud"},"message":"Run CI on pull requests too, and stop tracking results.json\n\nThe workflow only triggered on push - opening or updating a pull request\nnever ran anything new, since push and pull_request are separate GitHub\nActions events. Added pull_request (targeting main) alongside the\nexisting push trigger.\n\nAlso untracks results.json (Playwright''s JSON reporter output) - it''s\nalready in .gitignore but was added to git before that rule existed, so\nevery test run kept modifying a tracked file that should just be a local\nartifact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8581ea109cecbb6cbfad87884b9cd1281a83be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/trees/f8581ea109cecbb6cbfad87884b9cd1281a83be8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/commits/046874ffec54ac108becaac50b1def6aff3aa636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256758147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babinsaud-del","id":256758147,"login":"babinsaud-del","node_id":"U_kgDOD03Rgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del","user_view_type":"pu