instance, but stays\ndisplay:none until that instance''s actual join window - all scheduled\ninstances were in the future at time of writing, so the full join flow\n(opens Zoom in a new tab) couldn''t be observed live. Rather than assert\non unverified behavior, the test checks for a currently-joinable instance\nand skips with a clear reason if none is in its join window, same pattern\nas the expiredFreeTrial fixture''s one-time survey.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"214e0a7bb4f1b6210489d455c5f64f296821b22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/trees/214e0a7bb4f1b6210489d455c5f64f296821b22e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/commits/27d19d7965c17a61c2dce1dd50203b3ed363ab0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256758147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babinsaud-del","id":256758147,"login":"babinsaud-del","node_id":"U_kgDOD03Rgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/commit/27d19d7965c17a61c2dce1dd50203b3ed363ab0c","n