te. They check UI rendering that\nnothing in the final 74-case sheet covers at that granularity (menu-item\nvisibility per tier, widget panel/label rendering, modal open/close) -\nnot a duplicate of any case in it, just a different testing angle the\nsheet''s authors didn''t include. TC-STU-097/104''s content was already\nrepointed to TC-E2E-053 in Phase 1, closing out the other open item from\nthat phase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18e5c9f7410c3813e410815d119c60b2d382f02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/trees/18e5c9f7410c3813e410815d119c60b2d382f02e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/commits/0680e81fa16b2538181a6af4e58e46fb81fb7a47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256758147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/babinsaud-del","id":256758147,"login":"babinsaud-del","node_id":"U_kgDOD03Rgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/commit/0680e81fa16b2538181a6af4e58e46fb81fb7a47","node_id":"C_kwDOUV91ctoAKDA2ODBl