he new reference, superseding the earlier v12 draft. Renumbers every\nautomated spec whose TC ID changed when the sheet was finalized:\n  TC-STU-065/066 -> TC-STU-060/061 (Writing Task 1 submission/AI score)\n  TC-STU-069     -> TC-STU-064     (recorded class watched)\n  TC-STU-072     -> TC-STU-067     (Score Calculator V2)\n  TC-STU-075/076 -> TC-STU-070/071 (Study Pathway practice item)\n  TC-STU-097/104 -> retired, folded into TC-E2E-053 (was TC-E2E-003)\n  (no ID before) -> TC-STU-058 (My Account Change Password dialog)\nTC-STU-081/091/092/093 aren''t in the final 74-case list at all (cut\ngap-analysis additions from an earlier draft) - kept as flagged\nsupplementary coverage pending a keep/remove call.\n\nEvery test() now carries Playwright''s native { tag: ''@smoke'' } or\n{ tag: ''@regression'' } per the sheet''s own Type column, so `npm run\ntest:smoke` / `test:regression` (or `--grep @smoke`) run just one set.\nCI''s PAYMENT_SPECS_GREP/KNOWN_ISSUES_SPECS_GREP updated to the new IDs so\nrenamed specs still route to the right job. README''s coverage table\nrebuilt (it had drifted - several already-automated TC IDs were missing\nfrom it) with a Type column, plus old->new ID notes wherever \"Known\nfindings\" or the historical gap-analysis section names an old ID.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81c0c482602196f58cb86b587b1801a1656d2edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/trees/81c0c482602196f58cb86b587b1801a1656d2edd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bsaud-e2e/E2E_automation/git/commits/69eedee4bb2a6ca4068674de82b672b00249c085","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256758147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babinsaud-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.