ons.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(e2e): the status probe waits as long as /health actually takes\n\n/health probes six model engines and answers in about three seconds when\nthey are idle, longer while a video is being analysed, so a three-second\ntimeout reported a healthy stack as a dead one — which is exactly the\nclass of mistake this whole branch is about.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f08c967e664f4fdeb77a81285c1f7d3a6d92aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/9f08c967e664f4fdeb77a81285c1f7d3a6d92aa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/99f500f275b99c29866c7ddc2dce41b1715f69d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/99f500f275b99c29866c7ddc2dce41b1715f69d5","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDk5ZjUwMGYyNzViOTljMjk4NjZjN2RkYzJkY2U0MWIxNzE1ZjY5ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0","sha":"2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0"}],"sha":"99f500f275b99c29866c7ddc2dce41b1715f69d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/99f500f275b99c29866c7ddc2dce41b1715f69d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:22:03Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:22:03Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"test(reliability): the QA matrix, run end to end on an isolated stack\n\nAn isolated copy of the application tier — its own database, volumes and\nloopback ports, sharing only the stateless model engines — so the matrix\nruns against real bytes and real analyses without touching production,\nwhich is still serving 1ded7fd at schema 28 throughout.\n\nscripts/e2e-stack.sh brings it up from the branch''s own images and refuses\nto act on anything whose name is not its own. scripts/qa_upload_matrix.py\ndrives the scenarios a mocked test cannot prove, producing interruptions\nby actually dropping a connection: a part is cut by declaring a\nContent-Length over a raw socket and then closing, because an HTTP client\nwill not send that. scripts/recovery-tests/restart_drill.py restarts the\norchestrator mid-flight.\n\nResults: 11/11 at the orchestrator, 11/11 through the Next.js proxies,\n12/12 with the 20 MB + 200 MB pairing. The restart drill is the one that\nmatters — the orchestrator comes back in 6.3 s, the send is found\ninterrupted and resumable, re-attaching resumes it under attempt 2, and\nexactly one answer is stored. An intermediate run inspected in the\ndatabase before resuming showed zero assistant rows where the old code\nleft a blank one.\n\nTwo notes recorded honestly in EVIDENCE.md. The stage detail now reads\n\"26/30 frames had readable text\" because the OCR engine looped on four\nframes and the new detector caught it; the old code recorded those frames\nas an empty screen and cached it against those bytes for ever. And the\nbefore/after timings are not a like-for-like latency comparison — different\ndatabase, cold caches, different content — they show only that the\nreliability work cost no step change: 20 MB still answers in about a\nminute, 200 MB in under three.\n\nThe QA matrix now names the test that actually exists for every row, and\nsays plainly what was not run: the heavy pairing through the proxies, the\npublic Cloudflare path, a real browser engine, and concurrency at scale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5815d38ef02b9bcffe8b7efbd5bc6d00998bbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/e5815d38ef02b9bcffe8b7efbd5bc6d00998bbb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDJjMTM5ZGE0NWYxMzYzNDNmYzk3NGM3MDc1YzI0MGE2NGQ4YzBlZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c","sha":"c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c"}],"sha":"2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/2c139da45f136343fc974c7075c240a64d8c0ed0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T23:25:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T23:25:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(reliability): the frontend tells the truth, the media pipeline is honest, and a deploy stops gracefully\n\nThe second half of the upload-reliability programme, on top of the durable\nV29 state that landed in de46510.\n\nFRONTEND — uploads. The upload client is resumable: init declares size,\nparts and part size, every part carries its sha256, a transient failure\nretries with bounded backoff and jitter (never a 4xx), an interrupted run\nasks the server what arrived and sends only the rest, and complete is\nreplayed rather than repeated. Each attachment gets an identity at\nSELECTION and keeps it; nothing is matched by position any more, so a\nsibling that lands late can no longer write its id onto another file''s\nentry. Removing a chip aborts the transfer and hands the session back\ninstead of leaving parts and a queued analysis to the 24-hour sweep. A\nvideo attached in one conversation and sent from another is uploaded\nwhere it is being sent.\n\nFRONTEND — the chat. A send mints an intent; the turn carries it, and what\nthe row may say is decided from the intent, the server''s answer and this\ntab''s own work — never from \"there is no stream in this tab\". The poll no\nlonger force-loads over a turn whose upload is still running here, which\nis what killed the progress indicator and stranded the turn that started\nthis work. A failed status call is status unknown, not \"nothing running\":\nthe active proxy passes failures through instead of answering an empty\nlist. An interrupted stream keeps the words, stores no blank assistant\nrow, and reconnects with bounded backoff; a completed one is loaded from\nhistory. The whole-thread push is conditional on the version the tab last\nread, and a 409 reconciles instead of overwriting.\n\nMEDIA. A clip that meets a busy or unavailable engine retries within\nbounds instead of failing the stage while its siblings run on; a cancelled\nor timed-out stage kills its ffmpeg child rather than leaking it. OCR now\nreports per frame whether it read, found nothing, failed or returned\ndegenerate output — and the fusion text says which stage was unavailable\ninstead of implying the screen was blank. Measured against the live\nengine, the prompt this code has been sending returns looping garbage on\n4 of 6 real frames and on a real PDF page, and 34% of the stored frame\ntranscripts in production are loops; the video path now sends the prompt\nthat works, behind VIDEO_OCR_PROMPT.\n\nOPS. The frontend gets a stop grace period, so a deploy stops cutting\nin-flight part uploads and proxied streams; uvicorn gets a graceful\nshutdown timeout that leaves the lifespan room to mark open requests\ninterrupted; the deploy and rollback paths drain finalising uploads first.\nThe workspace sweep judges each upload directory on its own age and size\ninstead of deleting the whole uploads tree, and never touches a live\nsession. /health reports the work in flight, and there are alerts for a\nstalled analysis, interrupted requests and upload-session churn.\n\nAlso here: an isolated end-to-end stack (scripts/e2e-stack.sh) with its\nown database, volumes and ports, and the QA matrix driver that runs the\nscenarios only a real stack can prove.\n\nThree defects found by running the suites together that the isolated runs\nhad missed: a new exception shadowed the truncate guard''s ConversationChanged\nand turned its 409 into a 500; the metrics allow-list folded every new\nlabel value to \"other\"; and a test drain helper bounded by iterations\nrather than real time hung under load.\n\nBackend 3115 passed / 5 skipped. Frontend 1920 passed, three consecutive\nruns. tsc clean, lint 0 errors, production build clean, ruff gate and\narm64 gate clean. Migration verified fresh, from V20 and from production''s\nV28, structurally identical and idempotent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d064044e5e5dd4ab5213b4f0dca8f877e7ab69b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/d064044e5e5dd4ab5213b4f0dca8f877e7ab69b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKGM1NTgxYTY2MTgwOGQ4ZGIxZTRlNDQxYzgyNGFhOTZjOWZmNDM2NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d","sha":"de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d"}],"sha":"c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/c5581a661808d8db1e4e441c824aa96c9ff4364c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:16:32Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:16:32Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(reliability): resumable uploads, durable chat intents, analysis leases (backend)\n\nChunked uploads now rest on the V29 session row: init records the\nexpectation, every part is written to a temporary file and renamed only\nafter a clean end (a cut body leaves no part), an optional sha256 per part\nis verified, a missing FINAL part is a 409 that names it, complete is one\nwinner and replays its stored result to any later caller, cancel and\ndiscovery exist, expired sessions are swept without touching live ones,\nand the running-total cap is per purpose (video up to VIDEO_MAX_UPLOAD_MB,\neverything else UPLOAD_MAX_MB).\n\nChat requests carry an intent_id the browser mints on Send. The server\nrecords acceptance, attaches a repeated intent to the live generation,\nreplays a completed one, and resumes an interrupted one under a new\nattempt; the first SSE frame names the generation; the answer is persisted\nserver-side before `done` regardless of viewers, deduped by generation_id;\na failed generation is logged with ids and persisted as a failure record\nthe client can render; a replaced generation tells its followers so.\nStartup and shutdown mark open requests interrupted; a stale finalising\nupload session goes back to uploading; a 10-minute sweep expires sessions.\n\nA video analysis run holds a lease with a heartbeat; startup requeues\nonly lapsed leases, so a second process or a rolling recreate cannot run\none video twice. The history replace is conditional on the updated_at the\nclient last saw (409 with the server''s value otherwise), so an older tab\ncan no longer overwrite an answer the server persisted after it loaded.\n\nTests: 29 (uploads), 25 (chat requests), 9 (schema and conditional\nreplace); the neighbouring suites unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78a5ee8ef5fc182fded44693003015ae01cff25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/78a5ee8ef5fc182fded44693003015ae01cff25d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKGRlNDY1MTA0YmJjNGU0ZGZkOWI2MzIxZDNhYjAzN2U2MzJkNWE3NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8","sha":"845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8"}],"sha":"de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/de465104bbc4e4dfd9b6321d3ab037e632d5a76d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:38:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:38:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(reliability): the durable state uploads, send intents and analysis runs rest on (V29)\n\nContracts first, so the upload rail, the chat endpoint and the browser can\nbe built against one shape at once. Additive: `upload_sessions` (a chunked\nsession the server remembers — owner, expectation, accepted parts, expiry,\nand the finalisation result to replay), `chat_requests` (one row per send\nintent — what was asked, under which generation, resumable after the\nprocess that accepted it is gone), and a lease on `video_analyses` so\nstartup reconciliation requeues only runs whose owner stopped\nheartbeating. Frontend types gain a browser-minted attachment_id, an\nupload state per attachment, a send intent with its state, and a\npersisted error so an interrupted answer can never again be saved as a\nblank assistant turn. docs/upload-reliability/ carries the lifecycle\ncontract, the API contract and the root-cause timeline of 2026-09-09.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"872355a5ccfb24befef0a0487d6734f1010a9f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/872355a5ccfb24befef0a0487d6734f1010a9f21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDg0NTQwOGQ3MjJiMWM5YzJiZTBmZWQ5YmIyNTQyMjI2ZDU4N2FlYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877","sha":"1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877"}],"sha":"845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/845408d722b1c9c2be0fed9bb2542226d587aeb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:09:30Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:09:30Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(chat): a turn saved while its files upload can no longer pose as sent\n\nSeen 2026-09-09: a turn with two videos showed two \"sent\" chips, no answer\nand no error, while the server had already analysed the 20 MB one. The\nturn is saved before its uploads finish (so a reload keeps the words and\nthe chips) and the chat request waits for every upload; the 400 MB video\nwas still uploading when the page was reloaded, so the request never went\nout and nothing said so.\n\nThree changes. Each file''s server id is linked and saved the moment that\nfile lands, so a slow sibling no longer costs a finished upload its\nidentity. The turn carries meta.send_state (''uploading'', then ''failed'' if\nan upload is refused) from the save until the request actually starts,\nwhen it is removed. And the row reads it: a user turn that ends the thread\nwith the marker still on it, nothing streaming, gets a notice naming the\nfile that did not make it — \"attach it again to send; small.mp4 stayed\nattached to this chat, so you can ask about it now\" — or a Send now button\nwhen every file it names is on the server (the existing regenerate path,\nby reference). The failure path keeps the cards of files that did land\ninstead of dropping all of them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b565c15be32ce5f93b9c30af17562631fc197e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/4b565c15be32ce5f93b9c30af17562631fc197e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDFkZWQ3ZmQyOThlYjA4M2U1N2JjYTk2ZDhkNjRhYTFlY2JlY2Q4Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/1cea52a01899fddf4941762233a6164e638efeb5","sha":"1cea52a01899fddf4941762233a6164e638efeb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1cea52a01899fddf4941762233a6164e638efeb5"}],"sha":"1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1ded7fd298eb083e57bca96d8d64aa1ecbecd877"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1cea52a01899fddf4941762233a6164e638efeb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:14:27Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:14:27Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"test(asr): the retired-engine guard meets whisper-large-v3\n\ndp-bugfix/l-6 was cut on the morning of 2026-09-08, when both voice\nengines had been removed and nothing was installed; openai/whisper-large-v3\nlanded on both Sparks later that day. Merged onto today''s main, seven of its\ntwenty-one tests asserted that earlier world: no ASR_BACKEND/ASR_MODEL\nsettings, no default engine address, provider() raising with the live fleet\nconfigured — and three of them posted 8 KB of zeros at the production\nwhisper engine and read its 422 as a failure.\n\nWhat survives, narrowed to what is still true: nothing rejected comes back\n(Qwen3-ASR, TheWhisper, CrisperWhisper by every name), Qwen''s wire-format\nparser is gone, and a deployment with NO engine fails honestly — the\nno-engine tests now empty ASR_BASE_URLS instead of hitting the fleet.\n`VLLMAudioProvider`, `normalise_language`, `SUPPORTED_LANGUAGES` and\n`language_code` come off the forbidden lists: they are the generic\nOpenAI-audio client and whisper''s own language table. The backend-selector\ntest and the closed-port test are gone with their premise; the latter is\nreplaced by a check that no default names Qwen''s retired port 30006.\n\nOne code change the branch''s intent needs: provider() raises\nASRUnavailable(\"no speech engine is configured\") when ASR_BASE_URLS is\nempty, instead of RoutedProvider''s ValueError, so the transcribe route\nanswers 503 and /audio/health (the branch''s own fix) can say why. The corpus\nREADME''s \"no engine is installed\" paragraph is brought up to date; two\nunused imports in evaluate.py dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e35b3ee0915d961fc1e4d42a390da91aa656ae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/1e35b3ee0915d961fc1e4d42a390da91aa656ae1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/1cea52a01899fddf4941762233a6164e638efeb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","nod