ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/d6aacec3027ec55f6c1f63eee2a1e4f905e79692","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKGQ2YWFjZWMzMDI3ZWM1NWY2YzFmNjNlZWUyYTFlNGY5MDVlNzk2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/a5fb0f2a7cc8834175941019836191c78571b32c","sha":"a5fb0f2a7cc8834175941019836191c78571b32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/a5fb0f2a7cc8834175941019836191c78571b32c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311","sha":"1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311"}],"sha":"d6aacec3027ec55f6c1f63eee2a1e4f905e79692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/d6aacec3027ec55f6c1f63eee2a1e4f905e79692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:08:01Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:08:01Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(ops): the OCR engine runs on the worker Spark — scripts/ocr.sh\n\nThe head held 108 of 121 GB with every sidecar on it, while the worker had\n68 GB free and an idle GPU outside transcription. On a unified-memory Spark\nthe sidecars'' KV caches are sized as fractions of the whole 121 GB, so the\nOCR engine held 17.4 GB for a 6.4 GB model — on the node that is also the\nchat model''s rank 0.\n\nscripts/ocr.sh (the shape of scripts/whisper.sh) brings the same engine,\nsame image digest, up on the worker under its own compose project\n(compose/compose.ocr.yaml: management address, explicit 3 GiB KV budget,\neight sequences), waits for it, and records OCR_REMOTE_BASE_URL in .env.\nThe orchestrator''s compose entry prefers that key over the generated head\naddress; the launcher validates it, drops the head''s `ocr` profile and\nretires its container while the key is set, so a later `techsara up`\ndoes not start the engine again on the node being emptied. `down` clears\nthe key and everything goes back.\n\nMeasured after the move: head 86 GB used (34 available), worker 72 GB\n(49 available); the worker''s engine holds 11.6 GB; a silent 90-second\nscreen recording took 28 s end to end with its OCR answered from the\nworker at ~5 s a frame. The router stays on the head on purpose — every\nchat message''s classification goes through it.\n\nLauncher: 470 tests, 512 subtests. docs/ocr-on-the-worker.md is the\noperator page; DECISIONS §11 the reasoning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a72602085947edf7719e495a5832bdb0aded28a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/9a72602085947edf7719e495a5832bdb0aded28a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDFkZTBkNGQxNGY0ODk2Yzk4YWVmODdiZjdhNmUwNmMwY2RhMDUzMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626","sha":"15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626"}],"sha":"1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1de0d4d14f4896c98aef87bf7a6e06c0cda05311"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:47:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:47:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(video): import Sequence — the annotations are lazy, the gate is not\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0b54367d2bfcf8c8e19c3e45f82e84af8f473d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/f0b54367d2bfcf8c8e19c3e45f82e84af8f473d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDE1YjZjNDE3NWQ4YmU2OWRiZTVjNDE2ZjAxZTVjYzBiOTU0ZGQ2MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c","sha":"985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c"}],"sha":"15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/15b6c4175d8be69dbe5c416f01e5cc0b954dd626"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:44:14Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:44:14Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"perf(video): speech and screen are analysed at the same time, on both Sparks\n\nThe stages ran one after another, and only one transcription clip was ever\nin flight, so a 10-minute meeting took 4:02 with the worker''s GPU idle for\nmost of it and the head''s idle during transcription. Speech (audio →\ntranscript) and screen (frames → OCR → captions) never read each other''s\noutput and use different engines, so they now run as two branches under\none runner, with fusion the first stage that waits for both. Transcription\nclips go out two at a time — one per Spark, spread by the speech router''s\nleast-active order. OCR is four-wide, captions three, ffmpeg decodes with\neight threads.\n\nMeasured on the same video, fresh bytes, quiet box: 4:02 → 1:55, same\ntranscript and frames. The head GPU was busy in 49 of 50 two-second\nsamples and the worker''s in 27, where before the worker only carried\nwhisper and the head sat idle while it did.\n\nThe status line above the steps names every stage in flight\n(\"Transcribing 40% · Reading on-screen text 30%…\") rather than flipping\nbetween branches, and the transcript step reports clips done / in the\nengine / waiting so it moves from the first second.\n\nTrade recorded in DECISIONS §5: a person dictating during a video''s\ntranscription may now wait for one clip (~15 s) — both GPUs were asked for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbae607aaa5f0d3e9e487c4e532e8ad8e060ce38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/cbae607aaa5f0d3e9e487c4e532e8ad8e060ce38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDk4NTc2M2I4NmQ3YzMzMDBlMjY3ZTc5MGUyYzgwMjgxOTE5MTgwN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95","sha":"e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95"}],"sha":"985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/985763b86d7c3300e267e790e2c802819191807c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T06:21:46Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T06:21:46Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chore(frontend): Next 16.3.3 — CVE-2026-75604 / GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 blocked the deploy\n\nTrivy failed the security job on the video feature''s push with two CRITICAL\nadvisories against next 16.3.1 (unauthenticated RCE via the image\noptimisation API), fixed upstream in 16.3.3. Nothing else changes: tsc,\nlint, the 1,794 frontend tests and the production build are green on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fad8e0ca118e4e93ac0eae96f0f90b4c5cc92814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/fad8e0ca118e4e93ac0eae96f0f90b4c5cc92814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKGUwMWFmY2I5MmIyYTU3MjFhZGMyZjE0OGJjNDEyODE0YTQyZjVmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67","sha":"2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67"}],"sha":"e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e01afcb92b2a5721adc2f148bc412814a42f5f95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T06:09:39Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T06:09:39Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(video): a video attached in chat is transcribed, read, understood and answerable\n\nA person attaches a video; the platform transcribes it with timestamps\n(whisper-large-v3 on both Sparks, VAD windows through a separate batch\npool), reads what was on screen (scene-detected, hash-deduped frames →\nUnlimited-OCR) and what was shown (router captions), fuses the three with\nthe main model into a summary, chapters, key points, decisions, action\nitems, entities and \"not covered\", indexes the evidence in its own LanceDB\ndirectory, and answers follow-ups with [m:ss] citations — saying so when\nthe video does not cover the question. Transcript files (.txt/.srt/.vtt/\n.json), on-screen text and the summary come back attached to the message.\n\nBuilt WITH vision, measured: the main model reads a frame verbatim, so a\nvisual question or one naming a time hands it the exact frame.\n\nThe analysis is a detached, sha256-keyed, resumable job started at upload\ntime; progress rides the existing `step` event with fixed ids; every stage\npersists its file and stamps the row, and the row carries the pipeline\nversion so a fixed pipeline re-runs a cached analysis instead of serving\nit. Multiple videos in one chat are scoped by the video_attachments join\non every query.\n\nResource policy: one job at a time, one batch ASR slot, and the job PACES\nitself against live chat — before every GPU unit it yields (≤20 s) while a\nreal generation is in flight. Unpaced, chat fell 75 → 20 tok/s during OCR;\npaced, a person chatting through two back-to-back analyses saw a median\n61 tok/s. ASR windows are 90 s so the longest un-yieldable unit is ~15 s.\n\nWhole surface behind VIDEO_ANALYSIS_ENABLED (folded into /auth/me and a\nper-member feature); nothing on the chat, streaming, context-meter or\nSalesforce paths changes when it is off. ffmpeg via apt in all three\norchestrator images; webrtcvad-wheels (aarch64 wheels).\n\nFound on the way and fixed: the composer''s upload toast crashed on a\nvideo-only send; Whisper''s first-30-s silence gate dropped a 12-second clip\nof real speech (the pipeline now says it ran its own VAD).\n\nDecisions and measurements: docs/video-understanding/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"407e74aed4d9ff4672cecace31a43a075bc97daf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/407e74aed4d9ff4672cecace31a43a075bc97daf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/2c51487b9a1f3aad99e2eddb77d9fd0979123b67","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDJjNTE0ODdiOWExZjNhYWQ5OWUyZWRkYjc3ZDlmZDA5NzkxMjNiNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/ce027c8545aec9467cf9aa51d425bdfa3e08687b","sha":"ce027c8545aec9467cf9aa51d425bdfa3e08687b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM