rl":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/0e0b7a7614a6b1430e7cee01ce10d1491b310aa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:12:46Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:12:46Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"feat(frontend): redesign context compact control\n\n- replace large context popover with circular compact indicator\n- show context percentage only on hover and keyboard focus\n- remove permanent percentage label and separate Compact Now button\n- trigger manual compaction by clicking the context ring\n- remove raw token counts and context-limit details from the UI\n- preserve frontend verification for unverified compaction results\n- improve compaction error messaging\n- keep known-zero foldable state from sending unnecessary compact requests\n- preserve keyboard accessibility and compacting announcements\n- add regression coverage for circular context meter behavior","tree":{"sha":"1c2bbaddfdc8e285504f5fd4de43598689daa8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/1c2bbaddfdc8e285504f5fd4de43598689daa8d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/0e0b7a7614a6b1430e7cee01ce10d1491b310aa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/0e0b7a7614a6b1430e7cee01ce10d1491b310aa7","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDBlMGI3YTc2MTRhNmIxNDMwZTdjZWUwMWNlMTBkMTQ5MWIzMTBhYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","sha":"23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480"}],"sha":"0e0b7a7614a6b1430e7cee01ce10d1491b310aa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/0e0b7a7614a6b1430e7cee01ce10d1491b310aa7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/a4fe5dc77bb736a510d7184d091796af9469d400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:26:15Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:26:15Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(uploads): document downloads looked in the dataset''s directory\n\n\"This upload has expired and is no longer stored\" -- answered 410 for every\ndocument while the bytes sat intact on disk. The download endpoint resolves\nunder extracted/, the shape the DATASET rail leaves behind; documents keep\ntheir file in _original/, the directory it never looked in. Found by the\nowner minutes after document cards became openable at all: the ladder finally\nreached the server, and died on the last step.\n\nresolve_upload_file grows a subdir parameter (\"extracted\" | \"_original\",\nanything else refused), so every guard -- traversal, hidden files, the\nownership-before-existence order -- applies to both homes identically. The\nendpoint tries extracted first (datasets, archive members) and falls back to\n_original (documents). A genuinely swept upload still gets its honest 410,\nand a dataset download is provably byte-identical to before.\n\nTests: a document round-trips its exact bytes with the right content type;\na swept document still 410s; datasets unchanged. 24/24 on the file; the\npipeline runs the full suite before this can deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"548d20897b50f41b969f16ca59cf6dc03187ed9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/548d20897b50f41b969f16ca59cf6dc03187ed9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/a4fe5dc77bb736a510d7184d091796af9469d400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/a4fe5dc77bb736a510d7184d091796af9469d400","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKGE0ZmU1ZGM3N2JiNzM2YTUxMGQ3MTg0ZDA5MTc5NmFmOTQ2OWQ0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","sha":"23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480"}],"sha":"a4fe5dc77bb736a510d7184d091796af9469d400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/a4fe5dc77bb736a510d7184d091796af9469d400"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:11:01Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:11:01Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(attachments): durable re-open, a chip per document, images beside files\n\nThree owner reports within minutes of using the multi-document release, all\nthree sharing one root and a design decision.\n\nThe root: the sent message''s metadata recorded ONE attachment -- {name, kind},\nno id -- however many were attached. From that single omission: the bubble\nshowed one chip for five files; only the first document could ever receive its\ndurable server id; and the open-after-refresh ladder, whose server tier keys\noff that id, ended at \"no longer available in this browser session\" for every\ndocument -- despite the bytes sitting on the server and the retrieval proxy\nbuilt precisely to serve them.\n\nMetadata now carries every document in attach order. Streamed documents link\ntheir ids as each upload lands. And the single small INLINE document -- the\nfast path that never uploaded at all -- now uploads quietly in the background\nafter the answer starts streaming: the answer''s latency is untouched (a test\nfails if the inline wire changes by a byte), the send costs nothing extra to\nthe user, and the card becomes re-openable from any browser, any time. A\nfailed background upload costs only the re-open, never the answer. Messages\nsent BEFORE ids existed cannot be revived -- their bytes were never stored.\n\nThe bubble renders one chip per document, each opening, previewing and\nre-attaching ITS file at its own index; single-document and legacy messages\nrender byte-identically through the old block.\n\nThe design decision: images and documents no longer displace each other. The\ndocument engine grew image inputs for archive members two commits ago, so\nattached images take the same door -- extra_images, normalised exactly as the\nvision engine normalises them -- and \"compare the chart to the report\" is one\nmessage with both halves visible to the model. Caps stay 5 + 5. Only a\ndataset still stands alone, deliberately: it answers through the SQL engine,\nand pretending it can mix would produce worse answers, not better ones.\n\nfrontend 1154/1154 (80 files), backend full suite green, tsc clean -- run\nLAST this time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c35b025d6f8f614061f4120f2a4fe69205eb15a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/8c35b025d6f8f614061f4120f2a4fe69205eb15a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","node_id":"C_kwDOUWBCP9oAKDIzNDM1NzMxYTEzN2QzMGMxNGJjYjAwNDRiMmVhNTFkODVkMWI0ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/bfe1ff7492c11083e2ce41b1198df5a25f255c42","sha":"bfe1ff7492c11083e2ce41b1198df5a25f255c42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/bfe1ff7492c11083e2ce41b1198df5a25f255c42"}],"sha":"23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/23435731a137d30c14bcb0044b2ea51d85d1b480"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/bfe1ff7492c11083e2ce41b1198df5a25f255c42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:34:59Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:34:59Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"fix(frontend): a tuple annotation tsc rejects, in the multi-document suite\n\nCI''s Type check refused `([u]: [unknown])` as a filter callback annotation —\nvitest transpiles without checking types, and the local tsc pass ran before\nthis file existed, so the error travelled. Plain indexing instead. The gap\nin the process, not just the code: type-check LAST, after every file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65a5d3c43ecbf2cd0ba22b87a7eb1ca27dc134c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jayeshpra/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/65a5d3c43ecbf2cd0b