il.com","name":"devMirai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T17:15:26Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"fix: reconcile agent_roles against SKILL-ROUTING and AGENT-MODEL, add check-agent-roles validator\n\nReconciliacion aditiva: agent_roles = roles actuales UNION agente del routing (si la skill tiene nivel Nxx) UNION agentes de AGENT-MODEL (owner/consulta/stack). 29 skills corregidas (p.ej. playwright +control-agent, error-handling +delivery-agent, framework-security +delivery-agent). Nuevo validador check-agent-roles (15/15): FAIL si la skill con nivel no tiene su agente de routing; WARN para skills demand-driven sin fuente (37, conservan su agent_roles). Semantica documentada en SKILL-TEMPLATE.md y skill-creator. Corregido bug CRLF en la reescritura (duplicacion de bloques).","tree":{"sha":"922067f66860384a162f4aa60d37064e4ba29994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/trees/922067f66860384a162f4aa60d37064e4ba29994"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/commits/9a2343ee9a4d56bf567f9a1663de0edbb2fde79e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http