501cb9d0fe80abce37a9a6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T17:09:13Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T17:09:13Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"feat: add framework scripts and reconcile broken script references across skills\n\nCrea .opencode/scripts/ con 5 scripts reales y verificables: validate-adrs.py (valida ADRs en docs/adr/), validate-service-ids.mjs (IDs unicos de servicio, node --check OK), drift-detect.sh (terraform plan -detailed-exitcode), emergency-rollback.sh (kubectl rollout undo con fallback git), init-db.sh (espera PostgreSQL). Honestiza 12 skills: los scripts embebidos (i18n, api-catalog, disaster-recovery) se marcan como ejemplos a copiar al proyecto; las referencias a scripts inexistentes del proyecto (react-upgrade, angular-upgrade, postgresql-backup, pull-request, repo-structure) se reemplazan por el procedimiento de la skill. Corrige ademas el cierre prematuro de comentario */ en el mjs.","tree":{"sha":"93cc39b3e0fae7c9ec03a4621ead264dd40ce0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/trees/93cc39b3e0fae7c9ec03a4621ead264dd40ce0d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/commits/5870b544a9dcf0e50501cb9d0fe80abce37a9a6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.git