ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commits/0dfc3d633d6b579345bd8478d2325f6332f27089/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:42:42Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:42:42Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"fix: correct fabricated/broken tool commands found via parallel empirical audit\n\nVerified every external CLI tool/flag/action claimed across security-testing,\nci-cd, load-testing, performance, a11y-testing, accesibilidad, openapi-docs,\napi-contracts, microfrontend, playwright, react-upgrade, design-system,\ndocumentation, and integration-testing by actually running the real tools\n(--help, npm view, live docker pulls) instead of trusting the prose. Three\nreal defects found and fixed:\n\n- security-testing: docker-compose ZAP service had `command:zap-baseline.py`\n  (missing space -- invalid YAML, would fail to parse). Also replaced\n  returntocorp/semgrep-action@v1, which is deprecated by its own maintainer,\n  with the current recommended `semgrep ci` container pattern\n- load-testing: grafana/k6-action@v0.3.1 is archived by its maintainer,\n  replaced with the current grafana/setup-k6-action + grafana/run-k6-action\n- openapi-docs: `@redocly/cli lint --config .spectral.yaml` was tried against\n  a real Spectral ruleset and errors out -- Redocly CLI only understands its\n  own redocly.yaml format, not Spectral rulesets; split into the two real,\n  independent validation paths\n\nEverything else audited (axe-core/Playwright API shape, openapi-typescript/\norval/spectral-cli flags, k6 script API, react-upgrade codemods, shadcn/antd/\nprimeng packages, testcontainers) checked out accurate against the real\ntools -- left untouched.","tree":{"sha":"ddaaa0d4ae2f627f8c4b1d0bbb949c7363127390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/trees/ddaaa0d4ae2f627f8c4b1d0bbb949c7363127390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/commits/0dfc3d633d6b579345bd8478d2325f6332f27089","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commit/0dfc3d633d6b579345bd8478d2325f6332f27089","node_id":"C_kwDOUWHxpNoAKDBkZmMzZDYzM2Q2YjU3OTM0NWJkODQ3OGQyMzI1ZjYzMzJmMjcwODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commit/38ccfc6ff9d4493df431fa6bb3a270410752fd6c","sha":"38ccfc6ff9d4493df431fa6bb3a270410752fd6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commits/38ccfc6ff9d4493df431fa6bb3a270410752fd6c"}],"sha":"0dfc3d633d6b579345bd8478d2325f6332f27089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commits/0dfc3d633d6b579345bd8478d2325f6332f27089"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commits/38ccfc6ff9d4493df431fa6bb3a270410752fd6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:33:36Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:33:36Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"fix: use official Docker MCP gateway, implement --namespace for real\n\n- opencode.json/mcp-metadata.json: @modelcontextprotocol/server-docker never\n  existed on npm. Docker''s actual official MCP integration is the docker CLI\n  plugin docker/mcp-gateway (`docker mcp gateway run`), not an npx package --\n  switched the docker MCP entry to invoke it correctly and noted the Docker\n  Desktop/Engine + MCP Toolkit prerequisite that the other 9 npx-based\n  entries don''t share\n- scaffold/generate.py: --namespace was parsed and computed into the template\n  context but never consumed anywhere, so it silently did nothing. Now, when\n  passed explicitly, it nests the generated python backend under\n  backend/<namespace parts>/ with __init__.py at every level, producing a\n  real importable package (verified by actually importing the generated\n  module). Omitting the flag keeps the previous flat backend/ output\n  unchanged, so existing usage isn''t affected","tree":{"sha":"d8e9726ff91f671d38c63e10b5f9ed448d99d8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/trees/d8e9726ff91f671d38c63e10b5f9ed448d99d8be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/commits/38ccfc6ff9d4493df431fa6bb3a270410752fd6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai","user_view_type":"public"},