ail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"fix: correct react-doctor/angular-doctor CLI docs against real tool output, update support contact\n\n- react-doctor: reverts an earlier incorrect claim that it has no score --\n  verified by running the real CLI: it does have a 0-100 score (shown as the\n  primary console gauge, plus --score/--json flags and ci install\n  --commit-status). Also fixed fabricated flags (--path, --install-skill,\n  --format github-pr-comment) with the real ones (positional directory,\n  `install`, `ci install`)\n- angular-doctor: same treatment -- verified --install-skill and --min-score\n  don''t exist; real install is a curl script, real CI score gating is via the\n  official GitHub Action''s score-threshold input, not a CLI flag\n- README.md: add Matías Méndez as the framework/skills contact, keep Manuel\n  Aliaga as the architecture/design contact","tree":{"sha":"d19898f87739923c4e350383fca19bd3e56c33b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/trees/d19898f87739923c4e350383fca19bd3e56c33b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/git/commits/be30fbcaa353a1c9af00d55a1a79e9d4a379aa8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68173129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devmirai","id":68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devm