68173129,"login":"devmirai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTczMTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devmirai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LopeviaTivit/ai-software-development-framework-/commits/c258e5e0419d7a86bc17b9233dfc323ad6d79881/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T21:25:54Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T21:25:54Z","email":"mencabrejos@gmail.com","name":"devMirai"},"message":"feat: restore Angular as coexisting frontend option, add react-doctor/angular-doctor gates, harden 3 stub validators\n\nAngular now lives alongside React (dev chooses per project via --frontend\nreact|angular in the scaffold generator). 19+6 transversal skills got full\nparallel Angular sections mirroring the existing Python/React/Bun inline\nduplication pattern; lighter-mention skills just note both options. New\nangular/angular-services/angular-upgrade skills, Angular scaffold templates,\nand ADR-005 documenting the coexistence decision (ADR-001 marked vigente\nin parallel with ADR-004).\n\nAdded react-doctor and angular-doctor skills wrapping the real npx CLIs as\nan automated pre-review gate, wired into code-review and the control agent''s\nQA gate template.\n\ncheck-consumed-by-cycles.py, check-bundle-consistency.py, and\ncheck-version-bumps.py were stub implementations that always passed\nregardless of actual state; rewrote all three to do real analysis\n(cycle detection, manifest cross-check, git-diff-based version drift).\n\nAll 14 framework validators pass.","tree":{"sha":"694d12