ttps://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/0553899102c9d856cbc3857ac13a674e3b1dee17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:42:12Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:42:12Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"message":"ABDM Records tab on the Encounter (ADR-013 D5)\n\nencounterTabs.abdm: the care-context header, the records table (label, type,\nstatus, attempts, next attempt, failure text, select), Link selected / Link\nall staged, Exclude / Include. The EncounterActions slot becomes a row that\nopens the tab and shows the number of records waiting. The host already owns\nthe tab label ENCOUNTER_TAB__abdm.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"372df6be970c3926322ef6c67269dd027d7a4109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/372df6be970c3926322ef6c67269dd027d7a4109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/0553899102c9d856cbc3857ac13a674e3b1dee17","verification":{"payload":"tree 372df6be970c3926322ef6c67269dd027d7a4109\nparent 114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789735332 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789735332 +0530\n\nABDM Records tab on the Encounter (ADR-013 D5)\n\nencounterTabs.abdm: the care-context header, the records table (label, type,\nstatus, attempts, next attempt, failure text, select), Link selected / Link\nall staged, Exclude / Include. The EncounterActions slot becomes a row that\nopens the tab and shows the number of records waiting. The host already owns\nthe tab label ENCOUNTER_TAB__abdm.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNOKwA4eb8BQqbXwrWeWXypBd67qNeOznQFA1Au0wkB0SIlKWRFBcPjouEhgJGNhGR\nn6nyCSD3he+n+elRnUNA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T13:19:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/0553899102c9d856cbc3857ac13a674e3b1dee17","node_id":"C_kwDOUWObBdoAKDA1NTM4OTkxMDJjOWQ4NTZjYmMzODU3YWMxM2E2NzRlM2IxZGVlMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828","sha":"114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828"}],"sha":"0553899102c9d856cbc3857ac13a674e3b1dee17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/0553899102c9d856cbc3857ac13a674e3b1dee17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:37:26Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:37:26Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"message":"ADR-013 staged sharing: stage records, link on selection or Encounter close, hourly retries\n\n- AbdmShareItem: 1 row per shareable record in a care context (staged, queued,\n  linked, failed, excluded). AbdmCareContext.hi_types is derived from the\n  linked items. Migration 0002 keeps the sandbox history as linked items.\n- post_save stages MedicationRequestPrescription (status != draft),\n  DiagnosticReport (final) and ReportUpload(discharge_summary); an outpatient\n  OPConsultation item is created with the first clinical record. Nothing is\n  sent to ABDM at staging time.\n- The desk links selected items (POST care-context/link {items|all}) or\n  excludes/includes a staged item. Encounter completed/discharged queues every\n  staged item and links. 1 link call carries every linked + queued type (F7).\n- Retries: LINK_RETRY_INTERVAL_MINUTES (60) x LINK_MAX_RETRIES (3) via the\n  periodic task abdm.tasks.retry_share_items; then the item is failed and the\n  desk can select it again.\n- Sharing after completion is gated on can_write_encounter without Care''s\n  closed-encounter rule.\n- FHIR: HealthDocumentRecord removed; DischargeSummaryRecord added around the\n  generated PDF (validate_fhir: 0 findings); Prescription reads only requests\n  that belong to a prescription; OPConsultation is outpatient only; transfer\n  builds from the linked items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"518112cc048c088442b9d4e81f3b6de482a2ed69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/518112cc048c088442b9d4e81f3b6de482a2ed69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828","verification":{"payload":"tree 518112cc048c088442b9d4e81f3b6de482a2ed69\nparent f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789735046 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789735046 +0530\n\nADR-013 staged sharing: stage records, link on selection or Encounter close, hourly retries\n\n- AbdmShareItem: 1 row per shareable record in a care context (staged, queued,\n  linked, failed, excluded). AbdmCareContext.hi_types is derived from the\n  linked items. Migration 0002 keeps the sandbox history as linked items.\n- post_save stages MedicationRequestPrescription (status != draft),\n  DiagnosticReport (final) and ReportUpload(discharge_summary); an outpatient\n  OPConsultation item is created with the first clinical record. Nothing is\n  sent to ABDM at staging time.\n- The desk links selected items (POST care-context/link {items|all}) or\n  excludes/includes a staged item. Encounter completed/discharged queues every\n  staged item and links. 1 link call carries every linked + queued type (F7).\n- Retries: LINK_RETRY_INTERVAL_MINUTES (60) x LINK_MAX_RETRIES (3) via the\n  periodic task abdm.tasks.retry_share_items; then the item is failed and the\n  desk can select it again.\n- Sharing after completion is gated on can_write_encounter without Care''s\n  closed-encounter rule.\n- FHIR: HealthDocumentRecord removed; DischargeSummaryRecord added around the\n  generated PDF (validate_fhir: 0 findings); Prescription reads only requests\n  that belong to a prescription; OPConsultation is outpatient only; transfer\n  builds from the linked items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLw2c0BHpW/lNQfRiXPZYkSUkswjiI8hc1xMNFfp0qNoFbGM04qf3K9VIAFigbc4ON\ndF5qPX435tLMLG3612CA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T13:19:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828","node_id":"C_kwDOUWObBdoAKDExNGViN2IwOGNiZDYzMWQ3MjQxZWY5YTA4OWZhNDAzZDMyNWU4Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2","sha":"f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2"}],"sha":"114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/114eb7b08cbd631d7241ef9a089fa403d325e828"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:21:25Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T12:21:25Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"message":"M2 wire fixes measured on the sandbox: hiType string, notify patientReference, notify delay\n\n- m2-hip-link-care-context takes hiType as a string, 1 patient block per HI\n  type in 1 call (findings E11 root cause, F7).\n- m2-link-care-context-notify needs the HIP''s patient reference in\n  careContext.patientReference, not the ABHA address (F8), and is accepted\n  only after ABDM indexes the link: the notify runs as a delayed Celery task\n  with backoff (F9, NOTIFY_DELAY_SECONDS).\n- A notify success clears the error of an earlier attempt.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"06fc8459394dc02588d5e03ecb965bd2ee5c8084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/06fc8459394dc02588d5e03ecb965bd2ee5c8084"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2","verification":{"payload":"tree 06fc8459394dc02588d5e03ecb965bd2ee5c8084\nparent a94088c791fe7fc8a4a37725f49cc5232e2493d9\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789734085 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789734085 +0530\n\nM2 wire fixes measured on the sandbox: hiType string, notify patientReference, notify delay\n\n- m2-hip-link-care-context takes hiType as a string, 1 patient block per HI\n  type in 1 call (findings E11 root cause, F7).\n- m2-link-care-context-notify needs the HIP''s patient reference in\n  careContext.patientReference, not the ABHA address (F8), and is accepted\n  only after ABDM indexes the link: the notify runs as a delayed Celery task\n  with backoff (F9, NOTIFY_DELAY_SECONDS).\n- A notify success clears the error of an earlier attempt.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHtD0a1pDcbE4yvSMQdcieDUlNodZFvKyw2zeh7i9syN6coIZ7vTBuI95D6MmE7fLx\n44lGnd74oovjBtK4BcIQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T13:19:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/f7c7df7ec51ca4589130a9e8089f519258da4fa2","node_id":"C_kwDOUWObBdoAKGY3YzdkZjdlYzUxY2E0NTg5MTMwYTllODA4OWY1MTkyNThkYTRmYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/a94088c791fe7fc8a4a37725f49cc5232e2493d9","sha":"a94088c791fe7fc8a4a37725f49cc5232e2493d9","url":"http