ree":{"sha":"fdebe04a7f22e295d70cc4b77c52972877a220c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/fdebe04a7f22e295d70cc4b77c52972877a220c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/e19ac6e88f3bb6629d8c10a009f1f1eea711c3c0","verification":{"payload":"tree fdebe04a7f22e295d70cc4b77c52972877a220c7\nparent ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789469804 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789469804 +0530\n\nRead the sandbox bridge-service shape; store callbacks to unnamed paths\n\n- Admin dashboard: the gateway returns services as {id, name, types[], active},\n  not the documented {serviceId, isHip, isHiu}. Read both (findings B18).\n- urls.py: a catch-all POST route stores a gateway callback to any path the\n  docs did not name as an AbdmCallback row (unhandled) instead of a Care 404.\n- Roadmap: first real m2-generate-link-token accepted (202) with no callback\n  within 120 s; next checks recorded. Dev setup: MFE port and hash note.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP8qzHsayvhmkH8OdyDxLhonU/Q2FWDDPbssVfvQ+da4zOO60p0Ybqd3uQy3OkbL+2\nA2rdsTATBJntDwy/ihFQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T06:39:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"logi