rl":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:20:03Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:20:03Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"message":"Move the bridge to an instance dashboard at /admin/abdm\n\nThe bridge is 1 per clientId, so its UI belongs at the instance level, not\non a facility page. Add GET /api/abdm/admin/overview (superuser): gateway\nsession status, live bridge state and services, and the Care facilities that\ncarry an HFR facility ID. The dashboard also lists the last 20 callbacks.\nThe facility setup page keeps a 1-line bridge status that links to the\ndashboard. No snapshot table: every value is read live (ADR-011).\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"54803d32bc41f7c36ec8c199b8530a65a47af21d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/54803d32bc41f7c36ec8c199b8530a65a47af21d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 54803d32bc41f7c36ec8c199b8530a65a47af21d\nparent e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789456803 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789456803 +0530\n\nMove the bridge to an instance dashboard at /admin/abdm\n\nThe bridge is 1 per clientId, so its UI belongs at the instance level, not\non a facility page. Add GET /api/abdm/admin/overview (superuser): gateway\nsession status, live bridge state and services, and the Care facilities that\ncarry an HFR facility ID. The dashboard also lists the last 20 callbacks.\nThe facility setup page keeps a 1-line bridge status that links to the\ndashboard. No snapshot table: every value is read live (ADR-011).\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLp+gylcm38fb6LrlNwLhd979KC7QAsuq01xPJW96d/UUmXaS6H8klvZV1FL+IlI52\nvrdPLA5K4vPOxF/J66awY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T06:39:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3","node_id":"C_kwDOUWObBdoAKGNhMDJmOWQwYjg4NWU1ZjM1OGMzMjU3ZjIzNzA2OTY5MTc5OTg4ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commit/e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce","sha":"e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce"}],"sha":"ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/ca02f9d0b885e5f358c3257f23706969179988e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rithviknishad","id":25143503,"login":"rithviknishad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQzNTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rithviknishad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/commits/e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:48:59Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:48:59Z","email":"mail@rithviknishad.dev","name":"rithviknishad"},"message":"M2 rebuild (ADR-011): lean HIP linking, discovery, consent and encrypted transfer\n\nBackend\n- Remove AbdmBridge, abdm/instance, the admin routes and gateway/hrp.py. The\n  bridge id is read live from the gateway and cached (gateway/bridge.py).\n- Add abdm/hip: link token, care context, HIP-initiated link and notify, SMS\n  deep link, discovery with verified-ABHA match, user-initiated link with an\n  OTP over Care SMS, consent GRANTED/REVOKED/EXPIRED, health-information request\n  with ECDH X25519 + HKDF + AES-GCM push and data-flow notify.\n- Add abdm/fhir: OPConsultation, Prescription and HealthDocumentRecord bundles\n  (MCP validate_fhir: 0 findings).\n- 5 new tables; migrations restart at 0001_initial. R-token sent bare first.\n- Encounter post_save queues tasks.sync_encounter after commit.\n\nFrontend\n- Remove the admin bridge page and nav. Setup page has 3 cards.\n- Add EncounterActions and EncounterOverviewTop slots; careApi mirrors urls.py.\n\nRepo hygiene\n- Remove 2 Care JWTs from bruno/environments/local.bru; make the token vars\n  secret. Fix 7 Bruno files that carried a pasted redacted header. Untrack\n  backend/.idea and uv.lock. Bruno covers every route in urls.py.\n\nDocs\n- findings.md is a status register (duplicates merged, 3 entries corrected,\n  12 resolved, 20 new). ADR-011; roadmap, codebase map, dev setup,\n  verification and sources updated. The false ''optional M1 features built''\n  claim is removed.\n\nVerified: manage.py check, makemigrations --check, ruff, 41 unit tests,\nin-process M2 smoke (15 stages incl. HIU-side decrypt), npm run build,\neslint 0 errors, i18n complete.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"858d44e5620594525b18a474549bf7b13a9bca4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/trees/858d44e5620594525b18a474549bf7b13a9bca4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care-abdm/git/commits/e8de6b3fc8f32f512d6bc4769b543274b088a3ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 858d44e5620594525b18a474549bf7b13a9bca4e\nparent 15828adf33adc48d4bb4955627317a714cbf6dfc\nauthor rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789454939 +0530\ncommitter rithviknishad <mail@rithviknishad.dev> 1789454939 +0530\n\nM2 rebuild (ADR-011): lean HIP linking, discovery, consent and encrypted transfer\n\nBackend\n- Remove AbdmBridge, abdm/instance, the admin routes and gateway/hrp.py. The\n  bridge id is read live from the gateway and cached (gateway/bridge.py).\n- Add abdm/hip: link token, care context, HIP-initiated link and notify, SMS\n  deep link, discovery with verified-ABHA match, user-initiated link with an\n  OTP over Care SMS, consent GRANTED/REVOKED/EXPIRED, health-information request\n  with ECDH X25519 + HKDF + AES-GCM push and data-flow notify.\n- Add abdm/fhir: OPConsultation, Prescription and HealthDocumentRecord bundles\n  (MCP validate_fhir: 0 findings).\n- 5 new tables; migrations restart at 0001_initial. R-token sent bare first.\n- Encounter post_save queues tasks.sync_encounter after commit.\n\nFrontend\n- Remove the admin bridge page and nav. Setup page has 3 cards.\n- Add EncounterActions and EncounterOverviewTop slots; careApi mirrors urls.py.\n\nRepo hygiene\n- Remove 2 Care JWTs from bruno/environments/local.bru; make the token vars\n  secret. Fix 7 Bruno files that carried a pasted redacted header. Untrack\n  backend/.idea and uv.lock. Bruno covers every route in urls.py.\n\nDocs\n- findings.md is a status register (duplicates merged, 3 entries corrected,\n  12 resolved, 20 new). ADR-011; roadmap, codebase map, dev setup,\n  verification and sources updated. The false ''optional M1 features built''\n  claim is removed.\n\nVerified: manage.py check, makemigrations --check, ruff, 41 unit tests,\nin-process M2 smoke (15 stages incl. HIU-side decrypt), npm run build,\neslint 0 errors, i18n complete.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg30eU2UMky9anGXaQczEYchldVb\nxPExUW+z5pey88fGEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFmcVR4SXEx+SwLBey8klqhA6q+crdfFdN41PyAyDaGgWSUoZsZalC06waub17Is9h\nUfoHmfnHMUJnIKc5Ar3A8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T06:39:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25143503?v=4","ev