 rule built by an expression factory.\n\n- An own, non-generic interface call without a direct DI registration is followed to its only concrete implementing class (dispatches-sole-implementation, labelled inferred); zero or several implementations are refused and listed as unresolved dead-ends under Important unknowns.\n- Mapping-profile member rules (ForMember/MapFrom with an inline lambda or an Expression<Func<>> factory) become mapped-field rules: every && conjunct with its developer comment, plus the factory''s XML summary as labelled developer documentation, linked to callables that project into the destination type.\n- Members assigned from && conjunctions become boolean gates, with local operands resolved and static string setting keys named.\n- Static guard helpers (Against<TException>(condition, message) and similar) become rejection rules.\n- Repository-specific *Authorize attributes are recorded as permissions.\n- The answer contract requires all conditions of a result-field rule and lets the code condition win over comments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"9f00e2a72c141927d38527c3ba0ddc9fd4bdf426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/9f00e2a72c141927d38527c3ba0ddc9fd4bdf426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/48ce2f10c1e506b28e37aa3ff15ba5e241a3da0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/48ce2f10c1e506b28e37aa3ff15ba5e241a3da0c","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKDQ4Y2UyZjEwYzFlNTA2YjI4ZTM3YWEzZmYxNWJhNWUyNDFhM2RhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/926c4913647537fa513fc7f7d8422f33d0c8b819","sha":"926c4913647537fa513fc7f7d8422f33d0c8b819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/926c4913647537fa513fc7f7d8422f33d0c8b819"}],"sha":"48ce2f10c1e506b28e37aa3ff15ba5e241a3da0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/48ce2f10c1e506b28e37aa3ff15ba5e241a3da0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/926c4913647537fa513fc7f7d8