r":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:59:37Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"feat: run semantic scanners inside the scan plan scope\n\npkc run now executes the C# and frontend scanners inside a plan-derived SemanticSourceScope: safely excluded, generated/light-indexed, runtime-dependency and test-evidence files never reach deep scanners, while DEEP_SCAN and UNKNOWN stay visible. Accepted scanner name scopes remain an additional filter; planned files they withhold are reported per stage. scan and build keep their whole-root scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"7f4e796d68de31ac7afa762cb719a93c9d4a19ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/7f4e796d68de31ac7afa762cb719a93c9d4a19ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/280450cdaa77491b8a5ab6a45ae7f0cb8f0caa0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/280450cdaa77491b8a5ab6a45ae7f0cb8f0caa0d","node_id