","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/047326e9341580df026f7b64fd297f8ad6e4326e","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKDA0NzMyNmU5MzQxNTgwZGYwMjZmN2I2NGZkMjk3ZjhhZDZlNDMyNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578","sha":"ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578"}],"sha":"047326e9341580df026f7b64fd297f8ad6e4326e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/047326e9341580df026f7b64fd297f8ad6e4326e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:17:12Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:17:12Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"feat: classify vendor and generated frontend files in discovery\n\nRD3 vendor/custom frontend classification for V0.4.7-E0.\n\nProfile schema 0.3.0-discovery adds THIRD_PARTY_RUNTIME,\nTHIRD_PARTY_MODIFIED and THIRD_PARTY_UNKNOWN roles, the\nRUNTIME_DEPENDENCY_INDEX scan mode, generated artifacts with input\nprovenance, and the list of files compared byte-wise.\n\nVendor authority comes only from restore manifests with checkable\nfile sets:\n- packages.config packages restored under an RD1-proven package folder:\n  project files at a declared Content path are THIRD_PARTY_RUNTIME when\n  byte-identical, THIRD_PARTY_MODIFIED (file-level deep-scan carve-out)\n  when different; package transforms are never compared.\n- libman.json libraries with a files list: the destination is indexed\n  as runtime dependency and undeclared files inside it are carved out\n  for deep scan; destinations without a files list stay included as\n  THIRD_PARTY_UNKNOWN.\n\nGenerated authority comes only from bundleconfig.json outputs and from\nsource maps whose sources resolve to repository files; both become\nlight-indexed with recorded inputs. Declared vendor classification\noutranks generated classification, and bundle membership never promotes\nvendor internals into deep scan.\n\nNames, license/version banners and byte-identical copies at undeclared\npaths never create vendor authority. Unrestored packages and LibMan\nlibraries without a destination are reported as unresolved. Scanner\nsemantic scope remains unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"9214f64ba87acb20e9589e6b09159261354903a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/9214f64ba87acb20e9589e6b09159261354903a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKGFjM2VmZDlmMmIzZjI2YmQ5OWFiNmNmMTQxYjg3MTYzMjUxNjU1Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6","sha":"2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6"}],"sha":"ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/ac3efd9f2b3f26bd99ab6cf141b8716325165578"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:05:14Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:05:14Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"docs: record RD2 local pass and activate RD3 [skip ci]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"394c46bbf98ff2983be4b405b1a58bbdd1dc6f41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/394c46bbf98ff2983be4b405b1a58bbdd1dc6f41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKDJlYmNlNDJiMDQyMmJkNmUwZDhlM2M3ZjJmNWRmMGYzY2M5MmJhZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47","sha":"05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47"}],"sha":"2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/2ebce42b0422bd6e0d8e3c7f2f5df0f3cc92bae6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:58:22Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T03:04:28Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"feat: model application boundaries in repository discovery\n\nRD2 application boundaries + ownership for V0.4.7-E0.\n\nThe repository profile now carries manifest-derived components, project\nreference edges and unresolved references (schema 0.2.0-discovery).\n\nComponent identity comes only from a project''s own manifest: web and\nworker SDKs, OutputType, legacy web/WCF project type GUIDs, test\nevidence, Angular projectType, or an official Angular build builder\nwhen projectType is absent. OutputType inherited from an unevaluated\nDirectory.Build file, conflicting/property-based OutputType, custom\nbuilders and undeclared project types stay UNKNOWN.\n\nOwnership flows from production hosts through unconditional, resolved\nProjectReference edges to non-test components, so a shared module lists\nevery owning host. Conditional references are reported with UNKNOWN\nconfidence and do not prove ownership. Test projects are TEST_ONLY:\nthey appear as test references on what they reference and never own or\npropagate ownership. Similar names never create edges. Property-based,\nwildcard, out-of-repository and missing references are reported as\nunresolved instead of guessed. Solution (.sln/.slnx) membership is\nrecorded per project.\n\nDiscovery still reads only bounded manifests; solutions are added to the\nread set. Scanner semantic scope remains unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"edefc60b95dd65dbf7fb3b164b8a472758ee2088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/edefc60b95dd65dbf7fb3b164b8a472758ee2088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKDA1ZWFkYjFlNDQxNTJmMjNiY2YwNjEzNGFkZmM4OWFlNzA1NzJlNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5","sha":"26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5"}],"sha":"05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/05eadb1e44152f23bcf06134adfc89ae70572e47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:42:18Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:42:18Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"docs: record RD1 local pass and activate RD2 [skip ci]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"495b45e068e16243f55aa2905860c4b388394852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/495b45e068e16243f55aa2905860c4b388394852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5","node_id":"C_kwDOUWQ-p9oAKDI2YTdmNTlhOTRjZjRhZWFhYjQ4YjFlNTVkMDMwODZhNDhkYmY5ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den/pkc/commit/fd3428f06bae7089a749f59b3d802d5a4e36b160","sha":"fd3428f06bae7089a749f59b3d802d5a4e36b160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/fd3428f06bae7089a749f59b3d802d5a4e36b160"}],"sha":"26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/26a7f59a94cf4aeaab48b1e55d03086a48dbf9d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26972759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rua-den","id":26972759,"login":"rua-den","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTcyNzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rua-den","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/commits/fd3428f06bae7089a749f59b3d802d5a4e36b160/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:39:35Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:39:35Z","email":"nhkhuy241@gmail.com","name":"turtle"},"message":"feat: discover repository shape before semantic scans\n\nRD1 inventory + safe exclusion for V0.4.7-E0.\n\npkc scan/build/run now performs deterministic shallow repository\ndiscovery and persists .pkc/discovery/repository-profile.json before\nthe C# or frontend semantic scanners start. Scanners run only as\nstages of DiscoveryFirstScanPipeline; if discovery fails, no stage runs.\n\nDiscovery lives in Pkc.Core (no Roslyn/MSBuild dependency), walks the\nfilesystem once, and reads only bounded MSBuild/Angular/TypeScript\nmanifests. It never reads source bodies or runtime configuration.\n\nSAFE_AUTO_EXCLUDE requires structural proof other than the directory\nname: sibling MSBuild project with an unredirected default output\nlayout (bin/obj), sibling package.json (node_modules), sibling\nangular.json (.angular), a declared Angular build outputPath, or a\nrestored .nupkg archive. Excluded areas are not walked. Names such as\nlegacy, vendor, plugins, themes, Scripts, Content, old, packages, dist,\nbuild and bin never create exclusion authority; unproven areas stay\nincluded with UNKNOWN role.\n\nTest evidence comes from test framework packages/references,\nIsTestProject, test project type GUIDs, and Angular test-target\ntsconfig includes, not from folder or project names.\n\nExisting semantic scanner scope is unchanged in RD1; sample run\nartifacts are byte-identical to the previous CLI apart from the new\ndiscovery profile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Bifrost <bifrost@upheads.no>","tree":{"sha":"74c573a7c7471e2c54dcfad011c35065bce700b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/trees/74c573a7c7471e2c54dcfad011c35065bce700b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rua-den/pkc/git/commits/fd3428f06bae7089a749f59b3d802d5a4e36b160","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifie