//api.github.com/users/luka2049/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luka2049","id":38855876,"login":"luka2049","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODU1ODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luka2049","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luka2049/keystone-agent/commits/36ba59d609fae8e9e5b01535b26531abaca30b2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T10:46:54Z","email":"clbigdata@163.com","name":"chenlong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T10:46:54Z","email":"clbigdata@163.com","name":"chenlong"},"message":"M1: 实现 Agent Runtime 核心\n\n核心实现:\n- internal/types: 与 OpenAPI 契约对齐的领域类型 (Agent/Tool/Model/Session/Run/Trace)\n- internal/tool: Tool 接口 + 注册中心 + HTTP/Code 执行器 + 从 ToolSpec 自动选择执行器\n- internal/model: ModelAdapter 接口 + OpenAI 兼容适配器 + Ollama 适配器 + Mock 测试适配器\n- internal/agent: 执行引擎 (LLM↔工具循环) + 并发调度 (goroutine + semaphore) + 三重防护 (maxIterations/timeout/maxConcurrency) + Trace 收集器\n- internal/store: 内存存储 (Agent/Session/Run/Trace) + 版本快照\n- internal/api: 全量 HTTP Handler (遵循 OpenAPI 契约的 20+ 端点)\n\n验证:\n- 单元测试: LLM↔工具循环 + maxIterations 防失控 ✅\n- 端到端 API: 创建 Agent → 注册工具 → 创建会话 → 发送消息 → Agent 执行 → Trace 回放 ✅","tree":{"sha":"19b51fa13d321a17eb2935da9e7cef3649ff33b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luka2049/keystone-agent/git/trees/19b51fa13d321a17eb2935da9e7cef3649ff33b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luka2049/keystone-agent/git/commits/36ba59d609fae8e9e5b01535b26531abaca30b2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu