hjarrar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Radd-HQ/Radd/commits/eb46583ce739a061beb4c89f9639d4321cf0e549/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:51:49Z","email":"hussein@hjarrar.com","name":"Hussein Jarrar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T07:54:23Z","email":"hussein@hjarrar.com","name":"Hussein Jarrar"},"message":"[RADD-1411] Docs and research say what the tree does now; run evidence, per-issue notes and dated reviews leave docs/\n\nRemoved: the scale audit''s 17 JSON evidence files (its five harness scripts\nstay; the READMEs name the evidence as kept locally), the review''s three\ndefect-asserting probes, research/issues-2026-09-25/, the page-comments note,\nand docs/pilot-readiness-fixes.md, importer-attribution-fixes.md and\nimport-mapping-usability.md (their one live operator procedure, the Jira\ncomment-audience report, is now a docs/deploy.md section).\n\nMoved under research/ with a dated point-in-time header: the module-boundary\nreview, the large-view review + performance-safety audit\n(research/large-views-2026-09/), roadmap-ideas and docs/codebase-scan.\n\ndocs/modules.md 684 KB -> 479 KB: the per-issue changelog above the map, the\nkernel/assembly restatement of plugin-platform, the worklog-SLQ section, a\nsuperseded state-group row and a duplicate search row go; the remediation,\nlarge-view and ownership narratives move to their research records; Known\nsimplifications is cut to the bullets still true; stale present-tense claims\nare fixed (settings sections, release keys, jiraimport''s spec-90 internals,\nldap, linktypes, views, auth, cycles, reporting, notify, ai, attachments, the\nspine paragraph), and the automations and web rows are rewritten short and\nverified. The reference checker''s live stale names in modules.md: 72 -> 16,\nall 16 false positives or removal sentences.\n\nplugin-platform.md 81 KB -> 47 KB: the finished migration plan, the unbuilt\nsockets and the per-plugin Alembic design become \"as built\" lines; the\nper-issue RADD-1354..1366 subsections leave, their SDK 1.5-1.12 contracts\nmoving to plugin-ui.md. plugin-ui.md loses its dead slots and stale\nboundaries. deploy.md marks every seed-only variable with its Settings page.\n21 specs gain a \"superseded in part\" line; 93/94/115 get true status lines;\nthe plugin specs 124/125 become 126/127 (no more number collisions).\nresearch/bloat-audit-2026-09-27/README.md records the audit and every FLAG.\n\ndocs/ + research/ tracked bytes: 5,846,131 -> 4,851,226.\n87 files changed, 2021 insertions(+), 18530 deletions(-)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017KNVMcLr1XqtEqBK2LheXQ\n(cherry picked from commit 66a386aea30d165a52581f16375537c94ea8b599)","tree":{"sha":"69c8e6419b571bda8e7aafa30f45c51aac29ce02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Radd-HQ/Radd/git/trees/69c8e6419b571bda8e7aafa30f45c51aac29ce02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Radd-HQ/Radd/git/commits/eb46583ce739a061beb4c89f9639d4321cf0e549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116394085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjarrar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hjarrar","id":116394085,"login":"hjarrar",