ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131","id":78937597,"login":"Misterwill3131","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTM3NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/commits/34654b7a32e1d09a36bcaaa0e88fa21e9bd8597d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:53:51Z","email":"78937597+Misterwill3131@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:53:51Z","email":"78937597+Misterwill3131@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"message":"perf(render): fix full canvas redraw per hover frame + coalesce wheel zoom (v0.7.2)\n\nRoot cause of the /account/levels FPS loss, proven with a clearRect counter\non the live page: 60 pointer moves caused 60 full redraws of the MAIN\ncanvas (candles + grid + price lines). Chain: the default \\\theme = {}\\\ncreated a new object every render, invalidating the mergedColors memo\n(dep [theme]), and mergedColors sits in the main render effect''s deps — so\nevery hover-driven re-render repainted everything at frame rate.\n\n- mergedColors now depends on theme.colors with a module-level\n  EMPTY_COLORS fallback, keeping a stable identity when no theme is passed\n  (applied to VortexCandleChart, VortexRangeChart and VortexConeChart)\n- Wheel zoom is coalesced through requestAnimationFrame: trackpads fire\n  several events per frame and each previously triggered a synchronous\n  zoom step (full redraw); the pending step is now applied once per frame\n  and chained into the live viewport ref, fixing the stale-ref zoom skip","tree":{"sha":"afbed115f61680434bb5e008d6aa76729546c512","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/trees/afbed115f61680434bb5e008d6aa76729546c512"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/commits/34654b7a32e1d09a36bcaaa0e88fa21e9bd8597d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78937597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131","id":78937597,"login":"Misterwill3131","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTM3NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/commit/34654b7a32e1d09a36bcaaa0e88fa21e9bd8597d","node_id":"C_kwDOUXBE_toAKDM0NjU0YjdhMzJlMWQwOWEzNmJjYWFhMGU4OGZhMjFlOWJkODU5N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131/v