s;\n  anchors clamp to the plot edge when panned out of view\n- VortexCandleChart: new zones, timeZone, viewportMode and\n  initialVisibleBars props; viewportMode=follow keeps the user''s zoom span\n  and slides to the newest bars on live (SSE) data growth instead of\n  resetting to full view\n- viewport.ts: createTailViewport (open on the last N bars) and\n  followViewport (pure resync helper) — replaces the lightweight-charts\n  series-primitive hack used by the site''s FvgChart\n- formatCandleTime accepts an optional IANA timezone (America/New_York)\n  for market-hours axis labels\n- 15 new unit tests (zone rect mapping/clamping, color parsing, tail and\n  follow viewport behaviors)","tree":{"sha":"cab55fe9f6cb40d2ec1acc3d4384098f39d83acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/trees/cab55fe9f6cb40d2ec1acc3d4384098f39d83acc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/commits/70e65ff76802d418b55a3d4c99f35cd534fb7b16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78937597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131","id":78937597,"login":"Misterwill3131","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTM3NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwil