ly.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T01:17:42Z","email":"78937597+Misterwill3131@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"message":"feat(bars): VortexBarChart — native histogram engine replacing recharts GEX charts (v0.6.0)\n\n- New engine/bars.ts: sign-based gradient histogram (pos/neg), optional\n  grouped second series, net-curve line overlay with dots, vertical\n  reference lines (SPOT / FLIP / MAX PAIN) anchored to the nearest datum,\n  thinned bottom category labels, symmetric or zero-clamped value domain\n  supporting negative values, hover highlight band on the overlay canvas\n- New VortexBarChart component: dual-canvas architecture (data layer +\n  hover overlay), rAF-coalesced pointer updates, cursor-following\n  glassmorphism tooltip with custom content prop, devicePixelRatio-aware\n- 10 new unit tests (domain computation with negative / non-finite values,\n  label thinning, nearest-datum mapping)","tree":{"sha":"037093774221d7fee0d858379071264dd1f956a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/trees/037093774221d7fee0d858379071264dd1f956a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/commits/c30c969d2adea0be94155d3f097cfe3c1729816d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78937597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Misterwill3131","id":78937597,"login":"Misterwill3131","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTM3NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131/orgs","received_events_u