api.github.com/users/Misterwill3131","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/commits/3371ffa849b40a99cefdd4eb29d516f5c71c584c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:40:15Z","email":"78937597+Misterwill3131@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:40:15Z","email":"78937597+Misterwill3131@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Misterwill3131"},"message":"feat(engine): gap-aware time scale, multi-chart crosshair sync, measureText cache (v0.5.0)\n\n- Optional timeScale mode on VortexCandleChart: X maps to real timestamps\n  (timeToX/xToTime) so weekends and market pauses render as proportional\n  empty space instead of false equidistant bars; candle body width derives\n  from the smallest mapped gap; time-based hit-testing via nearestTimeIndex\n  binary search\n- Multi-chart crosshair synchronization: crosshairSyncGroup prop on\n  VortexCandleChart and VortexRangeChart, backed by a lightweight group\n  pub/sub bus (engine/crosshair-sync.ts) and the useCrosshairSync hook;\n  subscriber charts draw a ghost cyan crosshair at their nearest bar with\n  one-average-gap tolerance\n- Memoized measureText (engine/text-cache.ts) keyed by font+text with a\n  bounded cache, applied to grid badges, session boxes, crosshair,\n  price-lines, ruler and watermark\n- 17 new unit tests: time mapping round-trips, proportional gap ratios,\n  nearestTimeIndex edge cases, crosshair-sync bus isolation/unsubscribe,\n  measureText cache behavior","tree":{"sha":"251a8aff3851789011e1063d135d2d9f1f9b8a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/trees/251a8aff3851789011e1063d135d2d9f1f9b8a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Misterwill3131/vortex-charts/git/commits/3371ffa849b40a99cefdd4eb29d516f5c71c584c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"