":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christoph-jerolimov/backstage-plugins/commits/3f911d77ba82e47fa523ecb10654bd48bcbcbb8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:55:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:55:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add community Backstage plugin catalog: 1080 entities from 133 repos\n\nClones and scans ~140 community repositories for Backstage plugin/module\npackages (filtered to package.json entries with a plugin backstage.role,\nor a plugin-shaped name/keyword), generating one catalog-info.yaml\nComponent entity per package under entities/<owner>/<repo>/<name>/.\n\n- One-sentence descriptions come from package.json when meaningful,\n  otherwise summarized from each package''s README by subagents.\n- Role (spec.type) comes from package.json''s backstage.role field, or a\n  heuristic fallback when absent.\n- scripts/fetch-stats.mjs fetches GitHub star counts per repo (capped to\n  repos contributing <=30 cataloged plugins), cached in\n  data/stars-cache.json; data/stars-cache.json here was bootstrapped via\n  web scraping since this sandbox blocks direct GitHub API calls to\n  unattached repos.\n- scripts/generate-csv.mjs produces data/plugins.csv and\n  scripts/update-readme.mjs renders the same data as a markdown table in\n  README.md.\n\nSee README.md for layout, script usage, and a list of source repos that\ncould not be cataloged (404s, empty repos, non-npm projects, plugins\nsuperseded by or merged into other cataloged repos).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01StoFk9tiDzaDCHzCpvgp9t","tree":{"sha":"d58f1155aba9d074653fb6510988cc8431ccc8ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christoph-jerolimov/backstage-plugins/git/trees/d58f1155aba9d074653fb6510988cc8431ccc8ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christoph-jerolimov/backstage-plugins/git/commits/3f911d77ba82e47fa523ecb10654bd48bcbcbb8d","verification":{"payload":"tree d58f1155aba9d074653fb6510988cc8431ccc8ba\nparent e3397abda61abe7dcfd13605abb4d3fccf9df7bc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789142102 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789142102 +0000\n\nAdd community Backstage plugin catalog: 1080 entities from 133 repos\n\nClones and scans ~140 community repositories for Backstage plugin/module\npackages (filtered to package.json entries with a plugin backstage.role,\nor a plugin-shaped name/keyword), generating one catalog-info.yaml\nComponent entity per package under entities/<owner>/<repo>/<name>/.\n\n- One-sentence descriptions come from package.json when meaningful,\n  otherwise summarized from each package''s README by subagents.\n- Role (spec.type) comes from package.json''s backstage.role field, or a\n  heuristic fallback when absent.\n- scripts/fetch-stats.mjs fetches GitHub star counts per repo (capped to\n  repos contributing <=30 cataloged plugins), cached in\n  data/stars-cache.json; data/stars-cache.json here was bootstrapped via\n  web scraping since this sandbox blocks direct GitHub API calls to\n  unattached repos.\n- scripts/generate-csv.mjs produces data/plugins.csv and\n  scripts/update-readme.mjs renders the same data as a markdown table in\n  README.md.\n\nSee README.md for layout, script usage, and a list of source repos that\ncould not be cataloged (404s, empty repos, non-npm projects, plugins\nsuperseded by or merged into other cataloged repos).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01StoFk9tiDzaDCHzCpvgp9t\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI/0MXhi\nuNmpdWLdDJ3o6otqJAzEWjYpd0/7Tv0iEbV6I