":"rachelwalliswork@gmail.com","name":"Rachel Wallis"},"message":"Publish a sanitised snapshot of rgwplumbing.co.uk\n\nA public source snapshot of the RGW Heating & Plumbing site, prepared\nfrom the private deploy repo for external review. Internal process\ndocs, ops runbooks, agent tooling config and commercial material are\nexcluded; DECISIONS.md is included with two commercial entries\nredacted. See README.md for what''s here and why.\n\nSwept for internal vocabulary that leaked through the initial pass\n(Trello board/list IDs in a since-removed workflow, a ticket reference\nin .env.example): reworded five code comments that named internal\ntooling or referenced an excluded repo, and noted at the top of\nDECISIONS.md that some entries reference files not in this snapshot.\nTicket-number references in comments (RGW-/QD-) and \"tracked in\nTrello\" mentions are left as-is — normal practice, not a leak.","tree":{"sha":"df3b416e5e3b7a92886f33cc2e4a67f1f32e3bde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RachelWallis/rgw-website-snapshot/git/trees/df3b416e5e3b7a92886f33cc2e4a67f1f32e3bde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RachelWallis/rgw-website-snapshot/git/commits/f22009353a7154721a692775e04b90759fcd7b1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113624474?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RachelWallis","id":113624474,"login":"RachelWallis","node_id":"U_kgDOBsXFmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RachelWallis/received_events","repos_url":"ht