2225e0d807f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:44:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:44:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"ci: split the tests across four shards\n\n- Build and run `vp check` in a `check` job.\n- Run `vp test` in four `test` jobs, one shard each, writing a blob\n  report with the coverage thresholds at zero.\n- Merge the four reports in a `coverage` job, which applies the 100%\n  thresholds to the merged coverage.\n- Pass the required `ci` check only when `check` and `coverage`\n  succeeded.\n\nOne run of every test took 24 minutes on the runner and did not finish\ninside the 30-minute limit. Locally the four shards take 157 to 167 s\neach, and the merge reports 3,049 files, 24,421 tests and 100% on all\nfour measures. A merge of three shards fails at 96.96% of statements.","tree":{"sha":"1e0d6f3c7cbd1f88d102027916b3c1cad0c2a5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/1e0d6f3c7cbd1f88d102027916b3c1cad0c2a5fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/b12e23c03bcc6f46915b5fa2025b72225e0d807f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1e0d6f3c7cbd1f88d102027916b3c1cad0c2a5fb\nparent 5327ab06ba9ec2a53ef37d60db14641ae53fe402\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790973882 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790973882 +0200\n\nci: split the tests across four shards\n\n- Build and run `vp check` in a `check` job.\n- Run `vp test` in four `test` jobs, one shard each, writing a blob\n  report with the coverage thresholds at zero.\n- Merge the four reports in a `coverage` job, which applies the 100%\n  thresholds to the merged coverage.\n- Pass the required `ci` check only when `check` and `coverage`\n  succeeded.\n\nOne run of every test took 24 minutes on the runner and did not finish\ninside the 30-minute limit. Locally the four shards take 157 to 167 s\neach, and the merge reports 3,049 files, 24,421 tests and 100% on all\nfour measures. A merge of three shards fails at 96.96% of statements.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAspUFMy23czjO6F\nIrcZpwnly6001q8iE1ilZ9CZZ1DUPteW4ckmDfSClG+gW+BCRg0YWF7NCclTZTYjiTjZcJ\nCAUAAF2W\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T20:44:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/b12e23c03bcc6f46915b5fa2025b72225e0d807f","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKGIxMmUyM2MwM2JjYzZmNDY5MTViNWZhMjAyNWI3MjIyNWUwZDgwN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/5327ab06ba9ec2a53ef37d60db14641ae53fe402","sha":"5327ab06ba9ec2a53ef37d60db14641ae53fe402","url":"https://a