pper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/66e031cf56a3f1eb88d5df515dd864ff97f210f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:26Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:26Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(vite-plugin-product): add the package\n\n- Compose a product from its definition while it builds, with\n  `product()`.\n- Find each installed plugin''s web package and contract package among\n  the modules the definition loaded.\n- Check every key against the words `vite-plugin-i18n` found, and each\n  command''s keys with `@tanstack/hotkeys`.\n- Serve `virtual:product`, and declare it in `./client`.\n- Fail a build on a problem, and print each warning.\n- Build each plugin''s lazy modules into a chunk named `plugin-<id>`.\n- Write `.product/access.json`, `.product/flags.json` and\n  `.product/operations.json` in a client build.\n- Compose again after a change, one composition at a time through one\n  environment, and reload the page or show the problems.\n- Serve a plugin''s standalone page under the `standalone` option.\n\nA composition after a change takes 18 ms at 30 plugins and 45 ms at\n100. 9 spec files, 146 tests, 100% on all four measures.","tree":{"sha":"0d1a80fe646a21df80b9e908de4882be453757ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/0d1a80fe646a21df80b9e908de4882be453757ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/66e031cf56a3f1eb88d5df515dd864ff97f210f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d1a80fe646a21df80b9e908de4882be453757ef\nparent c5a1a711924e51e88c48e7cc2e099abf3ccb038b\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968946 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968946 +0200\n\nfeat(vite-plugin-product): add the package\n\n- Compose a product from its definition while it builds, with\n  `product()`.\n- Find each installed plugin''s web package and contract package among\n  the modules the definition loaded.\n- Check every key against the words `vite-plugin-i18n` found, and each\n  command''s keys with `@tanstack/hotkeys`.\n- Serve `virtual:product`, and declare it in `./client`.\n- Fail a build on a problem, and print each warning.\n- Build each plugin''s lazy modules into a chunk named `plugin-<id>`.\n- Write `.product/access.json`, `.product/flags.json` and\n  `.product/operations.json` in a client build.\n- Compose again after a change, one composition at a time through one\n  environment, and reload the page or show the problems.\n- Serve a plugin''s standalone page under the `standalone` option.\n\nA composition after a change takes 18 ms at 30 plugins and 45 ms at\n100. 9 spec files, 146 tests, 100% on all four measures.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAnIuvUyoWn1qD3p\npH52VYlWQXC/55VpOoR0TfgiNOQBcWDyA/87GZiff253D5AJUNY+9syOw7nKcOn+w+7ASO\nCwUAAF17\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T19:23:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","n