iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/c5a1a711924e51e88c48e7cc2e099abf3ccb038b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:21Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:21Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(sdk-host): add the package\n\n- Create a host with `createHost` over a product, a session source\n  and a setting store, with optional access, data and flag sources.\n- Compile the plugins'' routes, the settings route and a route per\n  settings page with `createHostRoutes`.\n- Render the frame''s regions, the command palette, the toasts, the\n  not-found page and the settings pages through `HostProvider`,\n  `HostRoot`, `HostContent` and `HostNotFound`.\n- Reload a page once per build version after a plugin''s module fails\n  to import, and measure each plugin''s first import.\n- Match a browser''s first render to a server render''s flags and\n  decisions with `setupHostIntegration`.\n- Add `openFeatureFlags` in `./openfeature`.\n- Build a plugin''s standalone product with `standaloneProduct`,\n  `standaloneFrom` and `standaloneSources` in `./standalone`.\n- Render the standalone page and its development panel with\n  `renderStandalone` in `./standalone/app`.\n- Peer on `sdk-plugin`, the providers and component packages it\n  renders and `@tanstack/react-router-ssr-query`, and optionally on\n  `@openfeature/web-sdk`, `provider-color-mode`, `provider-locale` and\n  `provider-shell`.\n\n89 spec files, 744 tests, 100% on all four measures. `./standalone`\npacks to 8.52 kB and imports `sdk-core` alone.","tree":{"sha":"ea371c6d93d4dd9208b6e82ee00f95a6c3d30733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/ea371c6d93d4dd