ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/d0bcfd28b399e30b08d21d834834eecf5c22b852/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:07Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:22:07Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(component-forms): add the schema form binding in ./form\n\n- Add the `./form` entry: `useSchemaForm`, `useAppForm`, `withForm`\n  and `withFieldGroup` over `provider-form`''s `createSchemaForm`.\n- Add `Form`, `Submit`, `Frame`, `useBoundField`, the five layouts\n  and the renderers.\n- Add nineteen field components, from `TextField` to\n  `CheckboxCardsField`, and the `iban` and `phone` formats.\n- Add `size`, `orientation`, `mark`, `glyphs` and `headingLevel` to\n  `Form`.\n- Register the `form` recipe, with `staticCss` for its three sizes.\n- Add `Field.OptionalIndicator`, in the muted ink at the body weight.\n- Float a field''s label over a text box inside an input group, hide a\n  box''s placeholder until it has focus, and start the label where\n  typed text starts.\n- Set a switch''s label in the body role, and lay a radio group''s\n  label and its mark in a row.\n- Paint a checked checkbox `Highlight` under forced colors at rest,\n  hovered and pressed, and invert it inside a selected row.\n- Clear a fieldset''s border, margin and padding on `Checkbox.Group`.\n- Peer on `provider-form` optionally, and depend on\n  `component-disclosure` and `component-feedback`.\n- Add the form''s specimen with sixteen examples.\n\n486 spec files, 3,634 tests, 100% on all four measures.","tree":{"sha":"fae483086c6d14fffdf42d48e203f31fd16176e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/fae483086c6d14fffdf42d48e203f31fd16176e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/d0bcfd28b399e30b08d21d834834eecf5c22b852","verification":{"payload":"tree fae483086c6d14fffdf42d48e203f31fd16176e3\nparent ae187134e9aeef24401180390bc9fb4942b8e4ad\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968927 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968927 +0200\n\nfeat(component-forms): add the schema form binding in ./form\n\n- Add the `./form` entry: `useSchemaForm`, `useAppForm`, `withForm`\n  and `withFieldGroup` over `provider-form`''s `createSchemaForm`.\n- Add `Form`, `Submit`, `Frame`, `useBoundField`, the five layouts\n  and the renderers.\n- Add nineteen field components, from `TextField` to\n  `CheckboxCardsField`, and the `iban` and `phone` formats.\n- Add `size`, `orientation`, `mark`, `glyphs` and `headingLevel` to\n  `Form`.\n- Register the `form` recipe, with `staticCss` for its three sizes.\n- Add `Field.OptionalIndicator`, in the muted ink at the body weight.\n- Float a field''s label over a text box inside an input group, hide a\n  box''s placeholder until it has focus, and start the label where\n  typed text starts.\n- Set a switch''s label in the body role, and lay a radio group''s\n  label and its mark in a row.\n- Paint a checked checkbox `Highlight` under forced colors at rest,\n  hovered and pressed, and invert it inside a selected row.\n- Clear a fieldset''s border, margin and padding on `Checkbox.Group`.\n- Peer on `provider-form` optionally, and depend on\n  `component-disclosure` and `component-feedback`.\n- Add the form''s specimen with sixteen examples.\n\n486 spec files, 3,634 tests, 100% on all four measures.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABASs1WdtfweOjDFi\nmYTz6wm3EW31T