-base): list evaluated modules and invalidate files\n\n- Add `Imported.loaded`: every module an import evaluated, with its\n  namespace, each after the modules it imports.\n- Add `Importer.invalidate(files)`, which drops the transforms of the\n  files given and every module the runner evaluated.\n- Do nothing in `invalidate` over a dev server''s runner.\n- Document both members in the README.\n\n12 spec files, 163 tests, 100% on all four measures.","tree":{"sha":"f7a9f91c0b69459caa62bd5dc888265ad8236e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/f7a9f91c0b69459caa62bd5dc888265ad8236e6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/de5b3ae52059e6ca75fce90cb30611dc861ad795","verification":{"payload":"tree f7a9f91c0b69459caa62bd5dc888265ad8236e6e\nparent 02dda131a19849e9d7ea4018c1c973525ce47014\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968921 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790968921 +0200\n\nfeat(vite-plugin-base): list evaluated modules and invalidate files\n\n- Add `Imported.loaded`: every module an import evaluated, with its\n  namespace, each after the modules it imports.\n- Add `Importer.invalidate(files)`, which drops the transforms of the\n  files given and every module the runner evaluated.\n- Do nothing in `invalidate` over a dev server''s runner.\n- Document both members in the README.\n\n12 spec files, 163 tests, 100% on all four measures.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAiJs649CMz7Gsi4\nlRw5xfn7ziMkXkqTRgAZPxHHLH6NHYbjobXeujsXanUkbIVseUwxdaeFwYRo1iyqw3Q5QA\nBgUAAF1p\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T19:23:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":