//github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/d2d381a609e7e739580f1ea9dc7e84e52b43446f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:05:08Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:05:08Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"docs(rfc): correct the plugin RFCs to sdk-core and sdk-plugin\n\n- RFC-0009: list `provider-hotkeys` and `settings` among the\n  dependencies of `sdk-plugin`, and add `sdk/inspector/*` at step 8.\n- RFC-0010: state the references, markers, contracts, manifests, the\n  host''s contract and the version rule as `sdk-core` builds them, with\n  `qualify`, `pluginOf` and the keyed slot''s overloads.\n- RFC-0011: state the options of `resolveProduct`, the shapes checked\n  first, the path each problem names, and the regions.\n- RFC-0012: define `MountedSlot`, the nine named report interfaces and\n  the status types, state the stores each hook reads, and name the\n  switch''s event `host/pluginChanged`.\n- RFC-0013: state the order of a slot''s tests and wrappers, a\n  `Suspense` boundary per extension, `useSlot`, `Into`, the title and\n  a route''s `loads`.\n- RFC-0014: define the access catalogue''s types and the context\n  `conditionContextOf` builds.\n- RFC-0015: define the flag marker, reference and catalogue, the kill\n  switch''s description key, the optional override value, and the\n  value of a flag no installed plugin declares.\n- RFC-0016: define `CommandStatus`, `isCommandEnabled` and\n  `HostApi.navigate`, refuse the palette''s three chords, and deliver\n  events through `EventTarget`, depth first, with at most 16 nested\n  deliveries.\n- RFC-0017: state the section''s `schemaVersion`, the eight regions,\n  and the read and write rules of `useSettings`.\n- RFC-0020: define the operation catalogue and `RouteData`, read a\n  data variable from a parent''s path, and add `scope` to `useChange`.","tree":{"sha":"f61056b5d97f2bde4509fe0a48861365d7008ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/f61056b5d97f2bde4509fe0a48861365d7008ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/d2d381a609e7e739580f1ea9dc7e84e52b43446f","verification":{"payload":"tree f61056b5d97f2bde4509fe0a48861365d7008ed4\nparent 841534c29a34be92766169d0742e6e6412d8890d\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852708 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852708 +0200\n\ndocs(rfc): correct the plugin RFCs to sdk-core and sdk-plugin\n\n- RFC-0009: list `provider-hotkeys` and `settings` among the\n  dependencies of `sdk-plugin`, and add `sdk/inspector/*` at step 8.\n- RFC-0010: state the references, markers, contracts, manifests, the\n  host''s contract and the version rule as `sdk-core` builds them, with\n  `qualify`, `pluginOf` and the keyed slot''s overloads.\n- RFC-0011: state the options of `resolveProduct`, the shapes checked\n  first, the path each problem names, and the regions.\n- RFC-0012: define `MountedSlot`, the nine named report interfaces and\n  the status types, state the stores each hook reads, and name the\n  switch''s event `host/pluginChanged`.\n- RFC-0013: state the order of a slot''s tests and wrappers, a\n  `Suspense` boundary per extension, `useSlot`, `Into`, the title and\n  a route''s `loads`.\n- RFC-0014: define the access catalogue''s types and the context\n  `conditionContextOf` builds.\n- RFC-0015: define the flag marker, reference and catalogue, the kill\n  switch''s description key, the optional override value, and the\n  value of a flag no installed plugin declares.\n- RFC-0016: define `CommandStatus`, `isCommandEnabled` and\n  `HostApi.navigate`, refuse the palette''s three chords, and deliver\n  events through `EventTarget`, depth first, with at most 16 nested\n  deliveries.\n- RFC-0017: state the section''s `schemaVersion`, the eight regions,\n  and the read and write rules of `useSettings`.\n- RFC-0020: define the operation catalogue and `RouteData`, read a\n  data variable from a parent''s path, and add `scope` to `useChange`.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAS7EF89DSqm1NeF\nrsMmVuK5mWp3uYIkPisWPZp2GNBzl3ADIqsq8054BMGmxrLF+6E8qG7NbHEgBfgQMe6/j3\nDgUAAFvV\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap