","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:05:04Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:05:04Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(sdk-plugin): add the package\n\n- Define the runtime a host provides: `HostContext`, `HostRuntime`,\n  `HostStores` and the `HostReport` entries.\n- Read the plugin''s scope, the session, access decisions, flags and\n  conditions in a component.\n- Read and run commands, and subscribe to events and emit them as the\n  component''s plugin.\n- List a menu''s entries, and title the document from the deepest\n  matched page.\n- Render a slot with `Slot`, and contribute to one from a page with\n  `Into`.\n- Report where each extension is with `useExtensionStatuses`.\n- Read and write settings sections and placements.\n- Read declared queries and run declared mutations.\n- Read each plugin''s status and the host''s reports.\n- Peer on `provider-data`, `provider-hotkeys`, `provider-i18n`,\n  `provider-router`, `settings` and React.\n\n38 spec files, 283 tests, 100% on all four measures. The entry packs\nto 80.10 kB, 20.84 kB gzipped.","tree":{"sha":"068991e2cbf2c09e198e31b5676e30a7873d6011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/068991e2cbf2c09e198e31b5676e30a7873d6011"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/841534c29a34be92766169d0742e6e6412d8890d","verification":{"payload":"tree 068991e2cbf2c09e198e31b5676e30a7873d6011\nparent 61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852704 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852704 +0200\n\nfeat(sdk-plugin): add the package\n\n- Define the runtime a host provides: `HostContext`, `HostRuntime`,\n  `HostStores` and the `HostReport` entries.\n- Read the plugin''s scope, the session, access decisions, flags and\n  conditions in a component.\n- Read and run commands, and subscribe to events and emit them as the\n  component''s plugin.\n- List a menu''s entries, and title the document from the deepest\n  matched page.\n- Render a slot with `Slot`, and contribute to one from a page with\n  `Into`.\n- Report where each extension is with `useExtensionStatuses`.\n- Read and write settings sections and placements.\n- Read declared queries and run declared mutations.\n- Read each plugin''s status and the host''s reports.\n- Peer on `provider-data`, `provider-hotkeys`, `provider-i18n`,\n  `provider-router`, `settings` and React.\n\n38 spec files, 283 tests, 100% on all four measures. The entry packs\nto 80.10 kB, 20.84 kB gzipped.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAS/5EYfq9IYEfx4\nri9cronfO0VNnltJiM19lnDUqxLoQnzLEwHFHJpG9NwzIO+dug0W9NdG8zh1731OykIgUg\nBAUAAFvS\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/841534c29a34be92766169d0742e6e6412d8890d","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKDg0MTUzNGMyOWEzNGJlOTI3NjYxNjlkMDc0MmU2ZTY0MTJkODg5MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406","sha":"61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406"}],"sha":"841534c29a34be92766169d0742e6e6412d8890d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/841534c29a34be92766169d0742e6e6412d8890d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:04:59Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:04:59Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(sdk-core): add the package\n\n- Check plugin ids and names, and build qualified ids with `qualify`\n  and `pluginOf`.\n- Add a marker and a reference for each kind a contract declares:\n  routes, slots, extensions, commands, events, access, flags, queries,\n  mutations, settings and configuration.\n- Type a keyed slot''s references by the two `slot()` overloads.\n- Evaluate conditions with `evaluateWhen` against a `ConditionContext`.\n- Compare contract versions with caret ranges in `compatible`, `below`\n  and `needs`.\n- Define a contract with `defineContract` and `self`, and the host''s\n  contract with its regions, slots, menus and events.\n- Map a contract''s names to lazy code with `definePlugin`.\n- State a product with `defineProduct` and `installed`.\n- Resolve a product with `resolveProduct`, which checks every plugin\n  against the others and reports each problem and warning with its\n  path.\n- Declare the types of the access, flag and operation catalogues.\n\n41 spec files, 502 tests, 100% on all four measures. The entry packs\nto 120.71 kB, 28.21 kB gzipped.","tree":{"sha":"7b7be4229fcc3e5bff8f04b9aa10ba8dbc3270b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/7b7be4229fcc3e5bff8f04b9aa10ba8dbc3270b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/61bde17f9d1b3605d50885cf30b1ca0cde267406","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b7be4229fcc3e5bff8f04b9aa10ba8dbc3270b6\nparent 9994a7b16a9bee421c62eb073f91988f985d0748\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852699 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790852699 +0200\n\nfeat(sdk-core): add the package\n\n- Check plugin ids and names, and build qualified ids with `qualify`\n  and `pluginOf`.\n- Add a marker and a reference for each kind a contract declares:\n  routes, slots, extensions, commands, events, access, flags, queries,\n  mutations, settings and configuration.\n- Type a keyed slot''s references by the two `slot()` overloads.\n- Evaluate conditions with `evaluateWhen` against a `ConditionContext`.\n- Compare contract versions with caret ranges in `compatible`, `below`\n  and `needs`.\n- Define a contract with `defineContract` and `self`, and the host''s\n  contract with its regions, slots, menus and events.\n- Map a contract''s names to lazy code with `definePlugin`.\n- State a product with `defineProduct` and `installed`.\n- Resolve a product with `resolveProduct`, which checks every plugin\n  against the others and reports each problem and warning with its\n  path.\n- Declare the types of the access, flag and operation catalogues.\n\n41 spec files, 502 tests, 100% on all four measures. The entry packs\nto 120.71 kB, 28.21 kB gzipped.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAjZw5Aa+05zRZfX\n2HqWOUDzQD+6PA4GYkvTESj1Mx+XL3VmYjhhXwXLVQ68bv2L7hWmv2fCB2RHqxWGK1MInQ\nDQUAAFvQ\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-