iteQuery` to future\n  work.\n- RFC-0009 and RFC-0013: give `RouteLink` alone the `search` prop, and\n  describe `AppShell.Status` as built.\n- RFC-0009: limit delivery step 1 to `provider-router` and\n  `component-screen`, and move the `sdk` globs and chunk patterns to\n  step 3.\n- RFC-0020: type the router''s search validator by Standard Schema, and\n  run a query without a data variable the route lacks.\n- Update the line citations of `compile.ts`, `declaration.ts` and\n  `declared.ts` in RFC-0010, RFC-0012 and RFC-0013.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAKQn9L8+wSQuB5v\nTR0VRkNX25ObszHfbQYgyIAq9UXFFWE+mSdXr8UISwE7OXOzNew4LDrpqu6+iLxLqHx9Ev\nAQUAAFro\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_typ