lopper"},"message":"feat(provider-data): add the package\n\n- Define operations by persisted id with `defineQuery`,\n  `defineMutation` and `defineSubscription`.\n- Add `gatewayTransport`, which posts `{ documentId, variables }` with\n  a bearer token, renews the token once after a `401`, sends a\n  mutation''s `Idempotency-Key`, reads a subscription''s events through\n  `fetch` and fails a request as `network` after 30 s.\n- Add `DataError` with seven kinds, read from the GraphQL error code or\n  the status, and `fieldErrorsOf` for a form''s submit validator.\n- Add `createDataClient` with the operation fetcher, retries by kind,\n  a 30 s fresh time, a dehydrate rule that leaves out failed queries,\n  `onUnauthenticated`, and `onData` from the query cache''s events.\n- Add `DataProvider`, which runs the changes stream and reconnects\n  after 1 s, doubling up to 30 s.\n- Add `operationQuery`, `operationKey`, `invalidateChanges` and the\n  resource selectors it reads.\n- Add `useOperationMutation` with an idempotency key per call,\n  optimistic patches, a scope, and the mutation key\n  `[\"operation\", id]`.\n- Add `useNetwork` and `resetData`.\n- Add `loadNeeds` and `setupDataIntegration` in `./router`, and\n  `sampledTransport` and `createTestDataClient` in `./testing`.\n\n18 spec files, 269 tests, 100% on all four measures. The entries gzip\nto 5.1 kB, 0.74 kB and 1.2 kB with every peer external.","tree":{"sha":"dea095a7b6c4fff0fcd7ab5554c159e9ab67763a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/dea095a7b6c4fff0fcd7ab5554c159e9ab67763a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/c2b043d8920079147cff49708eded5d946972096","verification":{"payload":"tree dea095a7b6c4fff0fcd7ab5554c159e9ab67763a\nparent ebb458bb570f265951b68cdce9dbe8415a12379b\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790814627 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790814627 +0200\n\nfeat(provider-data): add the package\n\