s://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/530676cefc76642e7207d76c9071560210923265/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:30:17Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:30:17Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(provider-router): add route loaders and typed search\n\n- Pass `Evaluate` the route''s context as its second argument. An\n  evaluator that reads the condition alone still compiles.\n- Add `loader` to `RouteDeclaration`. The compiler runs it with\n  `loaderDeps` over the search, and passes it the context, the\n  parameters, `preload`, the search and the navigation''s signal.\n- Type the search in `RouteRef`, and read it with `useRouteSearch`,\n  which refuses a page that is not the reference''s route.\n- Add `search` to `RouteLink`, typed by the reference, and pass it to\n  the library''s `Link` beside the path.\n- Type `SearchValidator` as Standard Schema''s `StandardSchemaV1`, and\n  depend on `@standard-schema/spec` for its types.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the docblocks and error messages of\n  the files changed.\n\n14 spec files, 141 tests, 100% on all four measures.","tree":{"sha":"88e45d915d3b1193f730253c57b8d8cd37b557ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/88e45d915d3b1193f730253c57b8d8cd37b557ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/530676cefc76642e7207d76c9071560210923265","verification":{"payload":"tree 88e45d915d3b1193f730253c57b8d8cd37b557ba\nparent f3e06976a14aba6027c9cd14c5862177d01f0bcf\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790814617 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790814617 +0200\n\nfeat(provider-router): add route loaders and typed search\n\n- Pass `Evaluate` the route''s context as its second argument. An\n  evaluator that reads the condition alone still compiles.\n- Add `loader` to `RouteDeclaration`. The compiler runs it with\n  `loaderDeps` over the search, and passes it the context, the\n  parameters, `preload`, the search and the navigation''s signal.\n- Type the search in `RouteRef`, and read it with `useRouteSearch`,\n  which refuses a page that is not the reference''s route.\n- Add `search` to `RouteLink`, typed by the reference, and pass it to\n  the library''s `Link` beside the path.\n- Type `SearchValidator` as Standard Schema''s `StandardSchemaV1`, and\n  depend on `@standard-schema/spec` for its types.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the docblocks and error messages of\n  the files changed.\n\n14 spec files, 141 tests, 100% on all four measures.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAlbYcc0UMtm4MFr\nFneljo02Qnnk1ZYydoPwzs0AU9ak+mVzRpHmDcNMITwv/kkkgVa8vTBrVAEFP5itJFWHdY\nCgUAAFrd\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_