i.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/028e22c77e76727c2672c3731b96e76cf54809ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:41:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:41:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"fix(vite-plugin-i18n): push catalogue changes under a bundled dev server\n\n- Send the changed pair from `watchChange` as the `i18n:catalogue`\n  event under a server that bundles, which does not call `hotUpdate`,\n  and skip a payload equal to the last one sent.\n- Reload the page there when a language or a namespace appears or\n  disappears.\n- Rewrite the stamp when a catalogue file appears or disappears.\n- Watch each package''s `locales` directory, where the watcher had\n  `locales/en` for a nested namespace, so a new language is found.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in ten docblocks.\n\nUnder Vite+ 1.0''s bundled dev server the page receives an edit to a\ncatalogue as one event without a reload, and a new `locales/nl`\ndirectory reloads the page with `nl` among its languages.","tree":{"sha":"e16ac65e058050e6594259efe13ae75422b813e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/e16ac65e058050e6594259efe13ae75422b813e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/028e22c77e76727c2672c3731b96e76cf54809ed","verification":{"payload":"tree e16ac65e058050e6594259efe13ae75422b813e3\nparent 3cf756cf3ef323f57f1cb2bffbbefa0b37b22451\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790804502 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790804502 +0200\n\nfix(vite-plugin-i18n): push catalogue changes under a bundled dev server\n\n- Send the changed pair from `watchChange` as the `i18n:catalogue`\n  event under a server that bundles, which does not call `hotUpdate`,\n  and skip a payload equal to the last one sent.\n- Reload the page there when a language or a namespace appears or\n  disappears.\n- Rewrite the stamp when a catalogue file appears or disappears.\n- Watch each package''s `locales` directory, where the watcher had\n  `locales/en` for a nested namespace, so a new language is found.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in ten docblocks.\n\nUnder Vite+ 1.0''s bundled dev server the page receives an edit to a\ncatalogue as one event without a reload, and a new `locales/nl`\ndirectory reloads the page with `nl` among its languages.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABA413SaaHEUHIasf\nMAQuvN9MsprO+YijKCpiMForofcZ4pLCp3VmHccc8yVrYYv7dfc3xiZxS/TxjsT8FOEnhG\nBwUAAFqr\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealt