n\n- Add `SwipeActions`: `Root`, `Content`, `Actions`, `Action` and\n  `settleSwipe`. A touch, pen or trackpad swipe reveals a row''s actions\n  at its inline end, and Tab reaches them with no gesture.\n- Add a `variant` axis to `Sortable`: `card`, the default, and `plain`,\n  rows with a transparent edge and no fill, for a list inside a panel.\n- Paint a table row''s stripe, hover and selected fills from\n  `--table-row-fill`, which a sticky row header paints over the panel.\n- Read a table cell''s rule ink from `--table-rule`, its rule width from\n  `--table-rule-width` and its inline inset from `--table-cell-inset`.\n- Leave a selected row out of a striped table''s stripe.\n- Write a selected row''s cells and rules in `HighlightText` under\n  forced colors, and keep its `Highlight` under the pointer.\n- Add `viewportRef` to `Table.Scroller`.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAv+MxTmRnz79FMa\n/P0YEFkKcLPz2hXbk/BOMiVbSFcweL3/IWoAtdulxyjgk8mSt8OTeeOYP8EitVaVQD6Dpr\nDwUAAFqj\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_u