sure): add closable tabs\n\n- Add `closable` to `Tabs.Trigger`. Delete on the focused tab, a\n  middle click or a press on its close control closes it, and the tab\n  states `aria-keyshortcuts=\"Delete\"`.\n- Add `Tabs.CloseTrigger`, `Tabs.Root onClose` with `CloseDetails`,\n  and `Tabs.selectionAfterClose`.\n- Move the selection and the focus of a closed tab to the next enabled\n  tab, else the previous one.\n- Measure the indicator again when a tab enters or leaves the list.\n- Set the value `SET_VALUE` sends under `deselectable`, which Zag''s\n  action cleared while the selected tab had focus.\n- Scroll the selected tab into view inside a sideways scroller through\n  `revealSideways`.\n- Mark the selected tab in `Highlight` under forced colors in the line,\n  plain and subtle looks.\n- Size an `svg` in a tab to one text size, and start a vertical tab''s\n  words at its inline start.\n- Add the files, drafts, reader and preferences examples, and scroll\n  the account example''s list.\n- Set `Popover.Title` in the body text of the panel''s size, semibold.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAqpSwRb5vjFLYH5\ndRIdSDNwCxabVqT5wNnTMneXCe3f5Jl0JczxoaDpT0g6SnI/rrFgYAS8jE6Uoc6yo+wxm6\nCwUAAFqh\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"lo