le/scale/commits/ba40d956e5760aab1223da6ab7dc8783de7176a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:40:36Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:40:36Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"feat(theme): add the chart role and the series family\n\n- Add a `chart` role to every palette: on a light page the solid\n  moved towards the page until it keeps the boundary ratio plus 0.05,\n  after dark the solid, and a grey solid after dark moved to the text\n  ratio.\n- Add the `series` family, `series.1` to `series.8`, from the primary,\n  the secondary, the accent and the stated hues, then the foundation''s\n  hues furthest from them. `colors.series` states the list. Export\n  `SERIES`.\n- Paint the edges of the outline, surface and flat looks in the\n  palette''s `muted` role, through `layerStyles.outline.muted`.\n- Read a field look''s read-only state from `:read-only` on `input` and\n  `textarea` alone, and from `data-readonly` and `aria-readonly`.\n- Add the `sheet` motions for each edge of the window, the `slide-up`\n  motion, and the `marquee-x` and `marquee-y` keyframes and motions.\n- Read a scale motion''s distance from `--scale-distance`, 0.04 unless\n  a recipe sets it.\n- Add the `connect`, `drag`, `dragging`, `pan` and `resizeColumn`\n  cursors.\n- Reword the errors about a compound matched on a value that cannot\n  be part of a class name.\n- Rewrite the changeset as a list of changes.","tree":{"sha":"de6ce9f6b58fdba0589c22fb29621f736b5b203b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/de6ce9f6b58fdba0589c22fb29621f736b5b203b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/ba40d956e5760aab1223da6ab7dc8783de7176a3","verification":{"payload":"tree de6ce9f6b58fdba0589c22fb29621f736b5b203b\nparent 9d2dd1b6a573174fca3711d63465dbdd0605fc0f\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790804436 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790804436 +0200\n\nfeat(theme): add the chart role and the series family\n\n- Add a `chart` role to every palette: on a light page the solid\n  moved towards the page until it keeps the boundary ratio plus 0.05,\n  after dark the solid, and a grey solid after dark moved to the text\n  ratio.\n- Add the `series` family, `series.1` to `series.8`, from the primary,\n  the secondary, the accent and the stated hues, then the foundation''s\n  hues furthest from them. `colors.series` states the list. Export\n  `SERIES`.\n- Paint the edges of the outline, surface and flat looks in the\n  palette''s `muted` role, through `layerStyles.outline.muted`.\n- Read a field look''s read-only state from `:read-only` on `input` and\n  `textarea` alone, and from `data-readonly` and `aria-readonly`.\n- Add the `sheet` motions for each edge of the window, the `slide-up`\n  motion, and the `marquee-x` and `marquee-y` keyframes and motions.\n- Read a scale motion''s distance from `--scale-distance`, 0.04 unless\n  a recipe sets it.\n- Add the `connect`, `drag`, `dragging`, `pan` and `resizeColumn`\n  cursors.\n- Reword the errors about a compound matched on a value that cannot\n  be part of a class name.\n- Rewrite the changeset as a list of changes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAcBVcUvbhnPzkyU\ngFC/KUNh1yBlti3nlGr1JlQXz57SnaW8ivuuCPM6WT6lrSjNQjgPDz4kapOEhO+WSVxCAF\nBgUAAFqX\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"