 RFC index.","tree":{"sha":"3573423ace54d824822d42993759e2df7b91a4ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/3573423ace54d824822d42993759e2df7b91a4ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/f600630c6d3f5da976b1c02f121725ebf9cf5add","verification":{"payload":"tree 3573423ace54d824822d42993759e2df7b91a4ed\nparent b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802208 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802208 +0200\n\ndocs(rfc): propose the plugin system and the data foundation\n\n- Add RFC-0005, the data foundation over TanStack Query.\n- Add RFC-0009 to RFC-0020, the plugin system: contracts and\n  manifests, composing a product at build, the host, pages and\n  contributions, access, feature flags, commands and events,\n  settings, words and styles, testing and tools, and plugin data.\n- List all thirteen as Draft in the RFC index.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAvXDUrXDnsw0rRu\niZjsX201vUNKMCX5UzxTdcA36DSpML2o57FQ7PWhbE9i4lydnIzcGTUmo2dp3mJHc/ixIl\nAAUAAFqE\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/f600630c6d3f5da976b1c02f121725ebf9cf5add","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKGY2MDA2MzBjNmQzZjVkYTk3NmIxYzAyZjEyMTcyNWViZjljZjVhZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716","sha":"b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716"}],"sha":"f600630c6d3f5da976b1c02f121725ebf9cf5add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/f600630c6d3f5da976b1c02f121725ebf9cf5add"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:03:16Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:03:16Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"fix(provider-router): interpolate paths with router-core''s segments\n\n- Depend on `@tanstack/router-core` 1.171.33, the core that\n  `@tanstack/react-router` 1.170.40 depends on.\n- Parse a route''s path with `getRouteSegments`, check it with\n  `hasMissingPathParams` and fill it with `interpolatePath`, the\n  segment helpers of core 1.171.33, in `routeHref`.\n- Return a path without parameters unchanged.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the module''s docblocks.","tree":{"sha":"3c175021773642bf7450322722a2cba9adda620c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/3c175021773642bf7450322722a2cba9adda620c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/b51868fbfc2f443b677a2be8579f995080bf0716","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c175021773642bf7450322722a2cba9adda620c\nparent 489f102bdb8ac96ce8f69bbe203669084d6fc895\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802196 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802196 +0200\n\nfix(provider-router): interpolate paths with router-core''s segments\n\n- Depend on `@tanstack/router-core` 1.171.33, the core that\n  `@tanstack/react-router` 1.170.40 depends on.\n- Parse a route''s path with `getRouteSegments`, check it with\n  `hasMissingPathParams` and fill it with `interpolatePath`, the\n  segment helpers of core 1.171.33, in `routeHref`.\n- Return a path without parameters unchanged.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the module''s docblocks.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATU