to a typed file.\n- Stop a dev server''s compiler 60 seconds after its last read.\n- Read each module a specimen and its examples import once.\n- Classify each declaration''s file once per package, and read a\n  package''s dependencies once per compiler.\n- Ask the compiler for no call signature of a literal or an intrinsic\n  type.\n- Keep the part of the module beside the specimen when two modules\n  export one name.\n- Leave a class''s `__#` private members out of `shapes`.\n\nReading the catalogue''s 179 pages takes 5.5s cold where it took 12.2s,\nand the TypeScript process peaks at 1.4 GB where it peaked at 2.6 GB.\nA docs build with every page stored takes 4.3s and does not start the\ncompiler.","tree":{"sha":"af628000fb688bc1c9c0b5eefbd81d4841e41648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/af628000fb688bc1c9c0b5eefbd81d4841e41648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/489f102bdb8ac96ce8f69bbe203669084d6fc895","verification":{"payload":"tree af628000fb688bc1c9c0b5eefbd81d4841e41648\nparent afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802188 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802188 +0200\n\nperf(vite-plugin-specimen): store page props and share programs\n\n- Group the pages by the compiler options their tsconfig parses to,\n  and open one program per group, with the pages as its files, from a\n  configuration written under `cacheDir/specimen`.\n- Keep each page''s anatomy in `cacheDir/specimen/props`, keyed by the\n  page''s package, the workspace packages it builds on or develops\n  against, the lockfile, the reader''s files and the `Reading`.\n- Serve a page from the store before the compiler starts, and drop\n  the store''s hashes on a change to a typed file.\n- Stop a dev server''s compiler 60 seconds after its last read.\n- Read each module a specimen and its examples import once.\n- Classify each declaration''s file once per package, and read a\n  package''s dependencies once per compiler.\n- Ask the compiler for no call signature of a literal or an intrinsic\n  type.\n- Keep the part of the module beside the specimen when two modules\n  export one name.\n- Leave a class''s `__#` private members out of `shapes`.\n\nReading the catalogue''s 179 pages takes 5.5s cold where it took 12.2s,\nand the TypeScript process peaks at 1.4 GB where it peaked at 2.6 GB.\nA docs build with every page stored takes 4.3s and does not start the\ncompiler.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABApvp14VOPjliuW3\n+ihlHH9+J8e73NgF43UrSFWJxEhInaj2QrraQEB6FvTbX9PhWCD1h+nFzbvDNMLBM2eYR3\nBAUAAFp8\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/489f102bdb8ac96ce8f69bbe203669084d6fc895","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKDQ4OWYxMDJiZGI4YWM5NmNlOGY2OWJiZTIwMzY2OTA4NGQ2ZmM4OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02","sha":"afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02"}],"sha":"489f102bdb8ac96ce8f69bbe203669084d6fc895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/489f102bdb8ac96ce8f69bbe203669084d6fc895"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:03:01Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:03:01Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"perf(vite-config-react): run the React Compiler through oxc\n\n- Replace the `@rolldown/plugin-babel` bridge with a transform of\n  this package''s own over `oxc-transform-react`, which leaves JSX in\n  place and raises `critical_errors`.\n- Filter the transform by id, which leaves out `node_modules` and\n  declaration files, and by the React plugin''s component and hook\n  expression.\n- Strip a dev server''s query from the id before the compiler reads\n  the extension.\n- Apply the transform to client environments alone, and pre-bundle\n  the runtime a memo cache imports.\n- Stop the build with each diagnostic and its code frame when the\n  compiler fails.\n- Write a source map unless the build writes none.\n- Resolve the compiler when the configuration is composed, and name\n  the package to install when it is missing.\n- Drop the Babel peers and dev dependencies.\n- Describe the transform in the README.\n\nThe docs build falls from 23.25s to 11.41s. Across 3,398 docs sources\noxc writes 1,933 memo caches where Babel wrote 1,931, and no file\nloses a cache.","tree":{"sha":"f864452ae0398a72bc5dba5dcab0ae30609d94d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/f864452ae0398a72bc5dba5dcab0ae30609d94d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02","verification":{"payload":"tree f864452ae0398a72bc5dba5dcab0ae30609d94d9\nparent 39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802181 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802181 +0200\n\nperf(vite-config-react): run the React Compiler through oxc\n\n- Replace the `@rolldown/plugin-babel` bridge with a transform of\n  this package''s own over `oxc-transform-react`, which leaves JSX in\n  place and raises `critical_errors`.\n- Filter the transform by id, which leaves out `node_modules` and\n  declaration files, and by the React plugin''s component and hook\n  expression.\n- Strip a dev server''s query from the id before the compiler reads\n  the extension.\n- Apply the transform to client environments alone, and pre-bundle\n  the runtime a memo cache imports.\n- Stop the build with each diagnostic and its code frame when the\n  compiler fails.\n- Write a source map unless the build writes none.\n- Resolve the compiler when the configuration is composed, and name\n  the package to install when it is missing.\n- Drop the Babel peers and dev dependencies.\n- Describe the transform in the README.\n\nThe docs build falls from 23.25s to 11.41s. Across 3,398 docs sources\noxc writes 1,933 memo caches where Babel wrote 1,931, and no file\nloses a cache.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABARnVEjJw5ZtE2n7\nhEvn5w8M1kevPcjebNpiArC6QLaWg8fB3G2w6j5VG6fmZSt1v41R5nR7nvghD7aa3ataAu\nDgUAAFp5\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKGFmZTVmMjM1YmFiNTRkMjYxYmIwMGY3MWMwNTAwOGQzNDdjZjhiMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2","sha":"39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2"}],"sha":"afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/afe5f235bab54d261bb00f71c05008d347cf8b02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:02:53Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:02:53Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"refactor: hoist test helpers and cast prebuilt entries\n\n- Build the entries of seven casts into a variable first, so each\n  `no-unsafe-type-assertion` directive is on the `as` line that the\n  type-aware linter of Vite+ 1.0 reports.\n- Move helpers that capture only module names out of their `it` and\n  `describe` blocks in six specs, for oxlint 1.84''s\n  `consistent-function-scoping`.\n- Keep the cookie store''s change listener in its subscription with a\n  directive, because each subscription removes the function it adds.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the docblocks and test names of the\n  files touched.","tree":{"sha":"15632df55a3666da4ccbb1b2f7a0150f0eec9979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/15632df55a3666da4ccbb1b2f7a0150f0eec9979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/39825cc481840ea023e524f340626c883428e7e2","verification":{"payload":"tree 15632df55a3666da4ccbb1b2f7a0150f0eec9979\nparent d2275340a1208d93578bd9d6d9193350de3a72a9\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802173 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802173 +0200\n\nrefactor: hoist test helpers and cast prebuilt entries\n\n- Build the entries of seven casts into a variable first, so each\n  `no-unsafe-type-assertion` directive is on the `as` line that the\n  type-aware linter of Vite+ 1.0 reports.\n- Move helpers that capture only module names out of their `it` and\n  `describe` blocks in six specs, for oxlint 1.84''s\n  `consistent-function-scoping`.\n- Keep the cookie store''s change listener in its subscription with a\n  directive, because each subscription removes the function it adds.\n- Replace the figurative verbs in the docblocks and test names of the\n  files touched.\n","reason":"valid"