absolute glob over a copy excluded the copy''s untested files\nand counted the files a test loaded. The relative glob excludes both.","tree":{"sha":"4981ed407a66e3cb632f6e668515fe4843a6c97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/4981ed407a66e3cb632f6e668515fe4843a6c97a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/d2275340a1208d93578bd9d6d9193350de3a72a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 4981ed407a66e3cb632f6e668515fe4843a6c97a\nparent 3a7fb464548296492dac8fc130818517e7e781f6\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802166 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802166 +0200\n\nfix(vite-config): exclude the copies by globs relative to the root\n\n- Replace `copiesBelow(root)` and `COPY_TESTS` with `IN_COPIES`, one\n  glob per copy relative to the root, in `test.files()` and\n  `test.coverage()`.\n- Build the coverage preset''s config without the root.\n- State attw''s `esm-only` profile in `pack.quality()`.\n- Declare a task''s files under `cache` in the `run.task()` specs, as\n  the task type of Vite+ 1.0 requires.\n\nVitest 5.0.1 matches a coverage glob against the path relative to the\nroot. An absolute glob over a copy excluded the copy''s untested files\nand counted the files a test loaded. The relative glob excludes both.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABARmKU+TNTNd9tSy\nLqsBxe6RqrIecLU1yGSoanzMBC+W1m79f6DJQ6Ck/JM+v0+8NGLEwUPA/E8xJCGh9VhGip\nBwUAAFpy\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklop