s/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/3a7fb464548296492dac8fc130818517e7e781f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:02:40Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:02:40Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"build: upgrade Vite+ to 1.0 and the catalog''s dependencies\n\n- Move `vite-plus` and the `vite` alias to 1.0.0, and `vitest`,\n  `@vitest/browser-playwright` and `@vitest/coverage-v8` to 5.0.1.\n- Raise the peer catalog to `vite` ^8.3, `vite-plus` ^1.0 and\n  `vitest` ^5.0.\n- Write every catalog entry as a caret range on its minor, except the\n  toolchain, `@zag-js/*`, `@module-federation/runtime`,\n  `@tanstack/react-router` and `@tanstack/router-core`. A comment\n  beside each exact entry states why it is exact.\n- Update every dependency to its newest release older than three\n  days, among them `@pandacss/*` 2.0, `@module-federation/vite` 1.22,\n  `@tanstack/react-hotkeys` 0.12, `@tanstack/react-router` 1.170.40,\n  `@cyclonedx/cyclonedx-library` 10.3, `oxc-transform-react` 0.151,\n  `eslint-plugin-jsdoc` 64.5, `eslint-plugin-perfectionist` 5.12 and\n  `lucide-react` 1.48.\n- Add `@tanstack/router-core` 1.171.33 to the catalog.\n- Exclude Vite+ 1.0.0 and the thirteen Panda 2.0.0 packages from\n  `minimumReleaseAge`.\n- Remove `@rolldown/plugin-babel`, `babel-plugin-react-compiler` and\n  `@types/babel__core` from the catalog and from 52 manifests, and\n  drop the `@babel/core` override.\n- Ignore `.vitest/`, where vitest 5 writes its reports and\n  attachments.\n- Update pnpm-lock.yaml.","tree":{"sha":"d713a16bcc9a751efa147601b6138fa49791f3b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/d713a16bcc9a751efa147601b6138fa49791f3b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/3a7fb464548296492dac8fc130818517e7e781f6","verification":{"payload":"tree d713a16bcc9a751efa147601b6138fa49791f3b5\nparent f89c1e80a00abe177c3c3f92d7af299afe4da374\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802160 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790802160 +0200\n\nbuild: upgrade Vite+ to 1.0 and the catalog''s dependencies\n\n- Move `vite-plus` and the `vite` alias to 1.0.0, and `vitest`,\n  `@vitest/browser-playwright` and `@vitest/coverage-v8` to 5.0.1.\n- Raise the peer catalog to `vite` ^8.3, `vite-plus` ^1.0 and\n  `vitest` ^5.0.\n- Write every catalog entry as a caret range on its minor, except the\n  toolchain, `@zag-js/*`, `@module-federation/runtime`,\n  `@tanstack/react-router` and `@tanstack/router-core`. A comment\n  beside each exact entry states why it is exact.\n- Update every dependency to its newest release older than three\n  days, among them `@pandacss/*` 2.0, `@module-federation/vite` 1.22,\n  `@tanstack/react-hotkeys` 0.12, `@tanstack/react-router` 1.170.40,\n  `@cyclonedx/cyclonedx-library` 10.3, `oxc-transform-react` 0.151,\n  `eslint-plugin-jsdoc` 64.5, `eslint-plugin-perfectionist` 5.12 and\n  `lucide-react` 1.48.\n- Add `@tanstack/router-core` 1.171.33 to the catalog.\n- Exclude Vite+ 1.0.0 and the thirteen Panda 2.0.0 packages from\n  `minimumReleaseAge`.\n- Remove `@rolldown/plugin-babel`, `babel-plugin-react-compiler` and\n  `@types/babel__core` from the catalog and from 52 manifests, and\n  drop the `@babel/core` override.\n- Ignore `.vitest/`, where vitest 5 writes its reports and\n  attachments.\n- Update pnpm-lock.yaml.\n","reaso