stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/6efe7f7c650091d2db43e38f78a8badc79fdb5c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:53Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:53Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"docs(component-disclosure): document the menu''s inset and nesting\n\n- Describe the leading icon size, the inset rule and the mirrored\n  indicator in the README''s Menu section.\n- State in the Menu and Popover sections that a press on another\n  overlay''s trigger closes this one and opens the other.\n- State that a submenu''s positioner needs a portal of its own.\n- Add changeset entries for the collapsible trigger, the nesting and\n  the inset.","tree":{"sha":"35c90fb5863db8e7f6728c7204734d0e18c672e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/35c90fb5863db8e7f6728c7204734d0e18c672e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/6efe7f7c650091d2db43e38f78a8badc79fdb5c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 35c90fb5863db8e7f6728c7204734d0e18c672e4\nparent 9aea275aca43b42f0a6b44d830985525f356b5cc\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254913 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254913 +0200\n\ndocs(component-disclosure): document the menu''s inset and nesting\n\n- Describe the leading icon size, the inset rule and the mirrored\n  indicator in the README''s Menu section.\n- State in the Menu and Popover sections that a press on another\n  overlay''s trigger closes this one and opens the other.\n- State that a submenu''s positioner needs a portal of its own.\n- Add changeset entries for the collapsible trigger,