k that its panel renders outside the render container.\n- Rewrite the scenes'' words for closed triggers.\n\nMeasured at 1920: the scenes are 229 to 378px tall. The menu''s\nhighlights scene was 13,965px and the popover''s looks 17,164px.","tree":{"sha":"b8c69a7a41ef7e522695d9919110280d19db8b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/b8c69a7a41ef7e522695d9919110280d19db8b9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/9aea275aca43b42f0a6b44d830985525f356b5cc","verification":{"payload":"tree b8c69a7a41ef7e522695d9919110280d19db8b9d\nparent 089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254909 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254909 +0200\n\nrefactor(component-disclosure): render the overlay scenes live\n\n- Wrap every positioner in the menu, popover and tooltip examples in\n  `Portal`, a submenu''s included.\n- Draw each scene closed, without `Floated`, `STAGED`, `open` or a\n  staged hover. A lone trigger renders in a `Sample`.\n- Add the column example, whose rows mix icon rows and a checkbox row,\n  and draw the gutter scene from it.\n- Audit each menu example open with axe over the document body, and\n  check that its panel renders outside the render container.\n- Rewrite the scenes'' words for closed triggers.\n\nMeasured at 1920: the scenes are 229 to 378px tall. The menu''s\nhighlights scene was 13,965px and the popover''s looks 17,164px.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAFKjrLzKt5Cntjp\neB4tyLHC7NDfYyK/KgWjGr4yaBgE1BoEKBZ0HHj/9is6OMQ/ybzls+haU46Sxic69jY8LX\nDwUAAFOe\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont