tml_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:46Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:46Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"fix(component-disclosure): align inset menu rows with icon rows\n\n- Size an `svg` a row starts with to `sizes.icon` one size smaller than\n  the row, 16px at `md`.\n- Apply `inset` only to a row that starts with neither an `svg` nor a\n  `Menu.ItemMark`, through `:not(:has(...))` on the compiler''s\n  `menu__itemMark` class.\n- Multiply each term of `--menu-gutter` by the density.\n- Mirror `Menu.Indicator` under `_rtl` with `scale: -1 1`.\n- Cover each rule in recipe.spec.ts.\n\nMeasured on the catalogue''s column menu: with `inset`, the text of every\nrow starts 36px from the row''s edge. The checkbox row''s text started at\n12px without it and the icon rows'' at 36px.","tree":{"sha":"75b3e0c85ea408d66a03972f41a7d838a091099d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/75b3e0c85ea408d66a03972f41a7d838a091099d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f","verification":{"payload":"tree 75b3e0c85ea408d66a03972f41a7d838a091099d\nparent 81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254906 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254906 +0200\n\nfix(component-disclosure): align inset menu rows with icon rows\n\n- Size an `svg` a row starts with to `sizes.icon` one size smaller than\n  the row, 16px at `md`.\n- Apply `inset` only to a row that starts with neither an `svg` nor a\n  `Menu.ItemMark`, through `:not(:has(...))` on the compiler''s\n  `menu__itemMark` class.\n- Multiply each term of `--menu-gutter` by the density.\n- Mirror `Menu.Indicator` under `_rtl` with `scale: -1 1`.\n- Cover each rule in recipe.spec.ts.\n\nMeasured on the catalogue''s column menu: with `inset`, the text of every\nrow starts 36px from the row''s edge. The checkbox row''s text started at\n12px without it and the icon rows'' at 36px.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABApgZgXI5q9cW/YP\nQCsHEKCSZiFD7lcMqCx67KCQIBYOjLtdfYKhH6F9jyFD+eTKV2ckhIS6qSq6Lku5EuRJ6Y\nCQUAAFOc\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f","node_id":"C_kwDOUXZuZdoAKDA4OWUyOWYzYTM3YTg1NjFlMDA1ZWYzODA2MmY4OTVmZGIxMjJjNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-scale/scale/commit/81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836","sha":"81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836"}],"sha":"089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/089e29f3a37a8561e005ef38062f895fdb122c5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/commits/81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:42Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"fix(component-disclosure): cancel dismissals cascaded from other overlays\n\n- Add `dismissNested` in `nesting.ts`. It cancels a dismissal unless\n  the removed panel contains the element whose `aria-controls` names\n  the closing panel.\n- Pass it as `onRequestDismiss` from `useMenuMachine` and\n  `usePopoverMachine`, before the caller''s own handler.\n- Cover the four outcomes in nesting.spec.ts, and pressing a second\n  menu''s or popover''s trigger in the machine specs. The specs fire\n  pointerdown, pointerup and click in one task, and fail without the\n  handler.\n\nZag 1.44 closes an overlay a frame after an outside press and dismisses\nevery layer registered after it, so the second menu closed in the frame\nit opened. Measured in Firefox and Chromium on the catalogue: the second\nmenu opens and the first closes, and a submenu still closes with its\nmenu.","tree":{"sha":"c2239983785e7e605e9e5f3b41f2a8d056b35349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/c2239983785e7e605e9e5f3b41f2a8d056b35349"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/81175fc6cc0ae984da0f138a78240527f4778836","verification":{"payload":"tree c2239983785e7e605e9e5f3b41f2a8d056b35349\nparent 330b05e8e6043cd837f8d8de0794776558b2575d\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254902 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254902 +0200\n\nfix(component-disclosure): cancel dismissals cascaded from other overlays\n\n- Add `dismissNested` in `nesting.ts`. It cancels a dismissal unless\n  the removed panel contains the element whose `aria-controls` names\n  the closing panel.\n- Pass it as `onRequestDismiss` from `useMenuMachine` and\n  `usePopoverMachine`, before the caller''s own handler.\n- Cover the four outcomes in nesting.spec.ts, and pressing a second\n  menu''s or popover''s trigger in the machine specs. The specs fire\n  pointerdown, pointerup and click in one task, and fail without the\n  handler.\n\nZag 1.44 closes an overlay a frame after an outside press and dismisses\nevery layer registered after it, so the second menu closed in the frame\nit opened. Measured in Firefox and Chromium on the catalogue: the second\nmenu opens and the first closes, and a submenu still closes with its\nmenu.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAWYf51RU7utE/WK\n8SlaMHZiCEdUjxCkClZ3p9ZYtUq3AForv3zmvr2U0j9ENSDEG+MFGGJrgP3titRkLJHDWM\nBgUAAFOb\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275443162?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stealth-rklopper","id":275443162,"login":"stealth-rklopper","node_id":"U_kgDOEGrt2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stealth-rklopper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a