"name":"Roy Klopper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:01:39Z","email":"roy.klopper@stealthscale.io","name":"Roy Klopper"},"message":"fix(component-disclosure): round the subtle collapsible trigger\n\n- Set `borderRadius: l2` on the subtle look''s trigger, the root''s\n  radius, so the hover fill follows the root''s corners.\n- Square the trigger''s two end corners while the content is open.\n- Cover the radius in recipe.spec.ts.\n\nMeasured on the catalogue: the hovered trigger''s corner is 7.5px, the\nsame as the root''s. The trigger had no radius.","tree":{"sha":"9eac7431f6cc14bf3b3b5fa6f683821e911f5d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/9eac7431f6cc14bf3b3b5fa6f683821e911f5d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/330b05e8e6043cd837f8d8de0794776558b2575d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9eac7431f6cc14bf3b3b5fa6f683821e911f5d37\nparent 693b92300439e68dfeb3709043fae4425ad621f3\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254899 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790254899 +0200\n\nfix(component-disclosure): round the subtle collapsible trigger\n\n- Set `borderRadius: l2` on the subtle look''s trigger, the root''s\n  radius, so the hover fill follows the root''s corners.\n- Square the trigger''s two end corners while the content is open.\n- Cover the radius in recipe.spec.ts.\n\nMeasured on the catalogue: the hovered trigger''s corner is 7.5px, the\nsame as the root''s. The trigger had no radius.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGcAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAABAsT1ibkgE7tpbFi\nOnIV4NlKOoJfKw8IdRnHnqyVLHisHYGSNccLuD/JL1hP9tpzzvkJlnzwn+3zu8rME9txaT\nBAUAAFOY\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"a