/router/link/specimen.components.actions.button, now\n  /components/actions/button.\n- Render the route link page from two examples: one link per route\n  id, and a link inside a sentence.\n- Add src/examples.spec.tsx, which runs axe on each example inside a\n  router with the routes it links to declared. Removing the open\n  example''s text fails it on link-name.\n- Exclude the specimen and the examples from the package''s coverage\n  count with vite-config-specimen''s layers.","tree":{"sha":"ffe7e42ca8cc69cee13271083b2dcae6a4676573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/trees/ffe7e42ca8cc69cee13271083b2dcae6a4676573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stealth-scale/scale/git/commits/3dfa98358d5ed3c1189e878c2d62079b3e920215","verification":{"payload":"tree ffe7e42ca8cc69cee13271083b2dcae6a4676573\nparent fc77d896206d0d8fd5c3a7d382ca93b0228587bc\nauthor Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790249855 +0200\ncommitter Roy Klopper <roy.klopper@stealthscale.io> 1790249855 +0200\n\nfix(provider-router): resolve the sentence link''s route id\n\n- Resolve the route link page''s sentence link with useRouteHref\n  before createLink(Link) links to it. The link passed the route id\n  as a path, which resolved against the current page: measured\n  /foundations/router/link/specimen.components.actions.button, now\n  /components/actions/button.\n- Render the route link page from two examples: one link per route\n  id, and a link inside a sentence.\n- Add src/examples.spec.tsx, which runs axe on each example inside a\n  router with the routes it links to declared. Removing the open\n  example''s text fails it on link-name.\n- Exclude the specimen and the examples from the package''s coverage\n  count with vite-config-specimen''s layers.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAEoAAAAac2stc3NoLWVkMjU1MTlAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAgKxoTEJ\nMITu2V8m0uttSOZ0RQurGtqkkhFhD/879ZBAgAAAAEc3NoOgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNo\nYTUxMgAAAGc