 drafter reads 4x fewer bytes but is accepted less often, 75% -> 63%);\nweights 77.8 -> 73.9 GiB and the KV pool +22% (626k -> 764k tokens at\nGPU_MEM=0.80). Follow-up commit adjusts the docs to those numbers and fixes\nthe missing refs/ directory reported by @techfury90.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0f7d7ecd3d265b6222bb07659d1fbca4a59fc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/e0f7d7ecd3d265b6222bb07659d1fbca4a59fc89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/66f669b5f48f56feee89d201781ef473d329e5d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/66f669b5f48f56feee89d201781ef473d329e5d6","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDY2ZjY2OWI1ZjQ4ZjU2ZmVlZTg5ZDIwMTc4MWVmNDczZDMyOWU1ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654","sha":"0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a","sha":"3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a"}],"sha":"66f669b5f48f56feee89d201781ef473d329e5d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/66f669b5f48f56feee89d201781ef473d329e5d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T03:07:20Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T03:07:20Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"message":"Defaults now follow the tournament: reduced MTP draft vocabulary (patch 10) and MADV_RANDOM on the table, both on by default\n\nRule adopted for this repo: every default in scripts/serve.sh is the setting\nthat scores best on the 17-scenario agentic tournament (3 repeats); anything\nthat only buys tok/s or TTFT is an option.\n\n- src/patch_mtp_draft_vocab.py (Dockerfile patch 10): vLLM shares the target''s\n  lm_head with the MTP draft, so each draft step read 1.27 GiB of head. With\n  VLLM_MTP_DRAFT_VOCAB the draft scores a private 65,536-row slice (+320 MiB)\n  and every other id gets -inf; the target verifies every token, outputs are\n  unchanged. src/draft_vocab_65536.npy is the default id set (corpus\n  frequency + BPE order + all special/added tokens); tools/build_draft_vocab.py\n  rebuilds it. serve.sh: DRAFT_VOCAB=1|0|<ids.npy>, default 1.\n- src/vllm_ple_mmap.py: madvise(MADV_RANDOM) on each PLE shard mmap\n  (VLLM_PLE_MMAP_MADVISE=random|normal, default random): no readahead around\n  160-byte row reads, cold prefill -4..-8%, cleaner page cache. serve.sh: MADVISE.\n\nMeasured on the GX10, one variable per tournament, same day (hybrid, MTP=2,\nprefix caching, YaRN 500k): exact top-k 43/51 @31.4 tok/s; + deterministic\nkernel 44/51 @31.9; + MADV_RANDOM 44.5/51 @33.5; + reduced draft vocabulary\n45/51 @38.5 (new default); same with MTP=3 44/51 @41.2 (stays an option).\nIdeas from MiaAI-Lab''s recipe, reimplemented from scratch (their code is AGPL).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3211345cf217ac7a028f55bcdbcf9144f56179c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/3211345cf217ac7a028f55bcdbcf9144f56179c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDBjNmRmN2VjZjQ0NzQ0OTNhOTlhN2ZmYjA4OTYyZTE0ZmVmYzg2NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9","sha":"2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9"}],"sha":"0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/0c6df7ecf4474493a99a7ffb08962e14fefc8654"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:34:26Z","email":"pfy@smoca.ch","name":"David Gunzinger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:34:26Z","email":"pfy@smoca.ch","name":"David Gunzinger"},"message":"hybrid-mtp: graft the NVFP4 MTP draft experts (Inferact) onto the hybrid snapshot\n\nNew MODE=hybrid-mtp, built by scripts/prepare-mtp-graft.sh on top of the\n-fp8hybrid snapshot: the MTP draft head''s routed experts (fused BF16,\n~4.7 GiB) are replaced by the per-expert NVFP4 donor block (1.4 GiB) from\nInferact/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 (pinned rev 103a7608, donor sha256\n0d44e6d7). fp8 PLE table + NVFP4 draft: the combination neither parent\nships. Method per thavoc''s graft write-up (gist d7083457) and\nPeuqui/mtp-quant-transplant.\n\nMechanics:\n- model-bf16-00011.safetensors rewritten WITHOUT the 2 fused BF16 MTP\n  tensors (the weight iterator walks whole files, so dropping the index\n  keys alone is not enough)\n- +6,144 NVFP4 per-expert tensors via a relative symlink to the donor\n  blob; index 296,775 -> 302,917 entries\n- BOTH quantization exclusion lists fixed (config.json\n  quantization_config.ignore AND hf_quant_config.json\n  quantization.exclude_modules): blanket mtp.*/model.mtp.* replaced by\n  the donor''s 29 explicit non-expert MTP module names (13 -> 40), or the\n  draft loads unquantized and dies on missing scales / shape asserts\n- gated on static verification before the .prepared marker\n\nPre-graft base check: embed_tokens.weight and all 29 shared draft tensors\nhash-identical across the two parents.\n\nMeasured on the GX10 (GB10, 128 GB, TP=1, MTP=2, greedy, default envs):\n\n                         hybrid            hybrid-mtp\nweights on card          77.83 GiB         74.75 GiB (-3.1)\nKV pool @0.80            625,669 tok       734,292 tok (+17%)\nmax concurrency @262k    2.39x             2.80x\ngreedy decode (5-prompt  26.6-33.8 tok/s   34.7-42.5 tok/s (+20-27%)\n  probe, tok/s each)     33.8/32.1/26.6/   42.5/39.8/34.7/\n                         34.2/31.6         41.2/37.8\nmean acceptance length   ~2.73             ~2.58 (same band)\n\nGate: greedy output equivalence vs the BF16-MTP arm PASSES — 5/5 prompts\nbyte-identical at 400 tokens, first-token logprobs identical to 4\ndecimals (every emitted token is the target''s argmax; the draft only\nchanges per-step acceptance). scripts/greedy-probe.sh <label> is the\nharness; diff the two JSON outputs.\n\nKnown non-issue: the smoke-test cold-vs-hit determinism check also fails\non the plain hybrid arm on this build (pre-existing; the graft behaves\nidentically to the baseline there).\n\nCost: ~3.3 GB of real bytes (one rewritten shard); the graft directory is\nsymlinks into BOTH parent snapshots plus the Inferact blob — do not prune\neither parent.","tree":{"sha":"9883f08e412589de257e76487aa5f6c1bb88f119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/9883f08e412589de257e76487aa5f6c1bb88f119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDM4MzBjNTIxY2ZkNTIyZDdjNmM0ZTRhZWFhNGU0NzI3NWYxNTgwMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9","sha":"2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9"}],"sha":"3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/3830c521cfd522d7c6c4e4aeaa4e47275f15802a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/2d9b5b744b8b8e25e0c40120f4a13bcec3554aa9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T01:43:58Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T01:43:58Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"message":"README: multi-agent guidance — keep GPU_MEM unless swapping, swappiness note, field confirmation\n\nWith several long-context agents the KV pool matters more than page cache\nfor the table, so GPU_MEM=0.75 is only for a box that is actually swapping\n(feedback from @techfury90 on issue #9, who confirmed the 1024 threshold\nwith 2-6 parallel agents). Also note the Spark''s default vm.swappiness=60.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c74bd2e865c64c528dbca0fdf0fc6310b26f2e00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/c74bd2e865c64c528dbca0fdf0fc6310b26f2e00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-H