ade explicit in the tuning\ntable (issue #6 feedback).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f6124950b4767e29147f188957333ce0c752292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/6f6124950b4767e29147f188957333ce0c752292"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/9510d4b2013f9f7ba168a99aa938fdcadc6a29de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/9510d4b2013f9f7ba168a99aa938fdcadc6a29de","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDk1MTBkNGIyMDEzZjlmN2JhMTY4YTk5YWE5MzhmZGNhZGM2YTI5ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18","sha":"3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18"}],"sha":"9510d4b2013f9f7ba168a99aa938fdcadc6a29de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/9510d4b2013f9f7ba168a99aa938fdcadc6a29de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:58:42Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T10:58:42Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"message":"docs: exact ring block sizes (8 with MTP=2, 4 without) and the chunk-end evidence\n\nThe QSA raw-key ring block is compress_ratio * cdiv(compress_ratio + num_spec, compress_ratio),\ni.e. 8 tokens with MTP=2 and 4 without — not 16. The traced cold chunk ends (5136 with MTP=2,\n5148 with MTP=0) match those values exactly, which pins the mechanism down.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d6cf67a13f4612b6e4e80f4d1c07cdbaab095e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/2d6cf67a13f4612b6e4e80f4d1c07cdbaab095e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDNlNWFmYTkxNmQyYmEzODBiNzg4M2ZhZThiNTAyYzZkNDFlZjJiMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/b6dae9f598158370d8a833e54d5deb159288ee8b","sha":"b6dae9f598158370d8a833e54d5deb159288ee8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/b6dae9f598158370d8a833e54d5deb159288ee8b"}],"sha":"3e5afa916d2ba380b7883fae8b502c6d41ef2b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Fl