/api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/8347e7cf1cbfd6fc8be2310b8f106ab4dcbbd027/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:42:50Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:44:21Z","email":"vincent.blazutti@protonmail.com","name":"Blazux"},"message":"Two modes (NVFP4 / hybrid), working prefix caching, deterministic top-k\n\n- Prefix caching: root cause found and fixed. EngineCore overwrites\n  cache_config.block_size with the smallest KV-group block (the QSA raw-key\n  ring, 16 tokens) while the Mamba block is 1600; mamba_hybrid.py''s state-slot\n  seed and the scheduler''s aligned split used it as the Mamba block size, so a\n  prefix hit restored an all-zero Mamba state. src/patch_mamba_block_size.py\n  (2 lines). Validated with state checksums and logprobs: cold == hit.\n  Also ships vllm#50729 + @Saren-Arterius''s bounds guard (mamba_utils_guarded.py).\n- Exact, deterministic QSA top-k (VLLM_QSA_EXACT_TOPK=1, default on): the stock\n  persistent_topk is non-deterministic on GB10 and drops candidates\n  (vllm#51782, issue #3 by @k3dani). 4/4 prompts stable, tournament unchanged.\n- Hybrid mode: NVFP4 experts + blockwise-fp8 side layers (MODE=hybrid,\n  scripts/prepare-hybrid.sh, tools/fp8_convert.py by @Saren-Arterius,\n  src/vllm_fp8_hybrid_modelopt.py dispatch shim for ModelOpt-NVFP4 incl. the\n  QSA qkv_proj redirect). +20% decode, +8% KV, same tournament score (45/51).\n- serve.sh: MODE, PREFIX_CACHE, EXACT_TOPK; smoke-test.sh: prefix-cache hit and\n  determinism checks, real-answer decode (no ignore_eos).\n- README / HOW-IT-WORKS: both modes, the prefix-caching investigation, the\n  top-k issue, the NVFP4 / hybrid / Intel comparison, credits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e666b1af026930dc5bed600b357a63b556ecfdad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/e666b1af026930dc5bed600b357a63b556ecfdad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/8347e7cf1cbfd6fc8be2310b8f106ab4dcbbd027","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16634590?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blazux","id":16634590,"login":"blazux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjM0NTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blazux","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/8347e7cf1cbfd6fc8be2310b8f106ab4dcbbd027","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDgzNDdlN2NmMWNiZmQ2ZmM4YmUyMzEwYjhmMTA2YWI0ZGNiYmQwMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7","sha":"1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7"}],"sha":"8347e7cf1cbfd6fc8be2310b8f106ab4dcbbd027","url":"