t-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/78b89fae62443ebd717695d90498c7daaa82a2d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209127?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wawimundo","id":209127,"login":"wawimundo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTEyNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wawimundo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/78b89fae62443ebd717695d90498c7daaa82a2d8","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDc4Yjg5ZmFlNjI0NDNlYmQ3MTc2OTVkOTA0OThjN2RhYWE4MmEyZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","sha":"d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295"}],"sha":"78b89fae62443ebd717695d90498c7daaa82a2d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/78b89fae62443ebd717695d90498c7daaa82a2d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T16:09:08Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T16:09:08Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"message":"Merge GB10 FLA fixes and faster PLE gather from @Saren-Arterius\n\n- FLA shared-memory gate lowered to 99 KiB so the 36 GDN layers use big tiles\n  on sm_121; chunk_delta_h num_warps pinned to 2 (fla#953 Blackwell race)\n- PLE mmap: CPU dedup + pinned staging + async H2D + GPU inverse expansion,\n  inline fast path for decode-sized gathers, bf16/f16 tables,\n  VLLM_PLE_MMAP_DIR, periodic stats line\n- Measured A/B on a GX10 (YaRN 500k, MTP=2, greedy real prompts):\n  decode 21.8 -> 26.2 tok/s median, prefill 8k +12%, 32k +4%\n\nAll three contributed by @Saren-Arterius\n(https://github.com/Saren-Arterius/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX-AutoRound); credited in\nREADME, HOW-IT-WORKS, the Dockerfile and the module docstring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d388f75075a2a37bf1a6d4e65468e0fac7a6387e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/d388f75075a2a37bf1a6d4e65468e0fac7a6387e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDE4MzlkMmJkYTFkMjY0YmYzZWY2NzM2MjhkOTMxZTk3Y2FlYzU4Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","sha":"d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295"}],"sha":"1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/1839d2bda1d264bf3ef673628d931e97caec58c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:33:10Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:33:10Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"message":"Concurrency findings, 500k YaRN context, prod-aligned defaults\n\n- README: independent reproduction on a DGX Spark by @jschmied (issue #1),\n  throughput/concurrency section with their load traces and the max-num-seqs\n  trap, native PLE CPU offload alternative (modelopt_fp4 gate, SYS_PTRACE/yama),\n  updated numbers (25-28 tok/s decode with MTP, 500k context)\n- HOW-IT-WORKS: long-context findings (500k YaRN validated, 800k OOM, fp8 KV\n  refused by QSA, YaRN+MTP draft max_model_len fix)\n- serve.sh: defaults CTX=262144 SEQS=8 GPU_MEM=0.85 MTP=2, new YARN/KV_DTYPE/\n  EXTRA knobs, restart unless-stopped, MTP spec carries max_model_len under YaRN\n\nConcurrency data and native-offload fixes credited to @jschmied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9400436fb8f6a4da5fe6d76e024b2d5ecab1ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/c9400436fb8f6a4da5fe6d76e024b2d5ecab1ad0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKGQyODU0YmZmZjBhMGI2ZjQ2OTg0YjA5NDFlZDFkYjYwMTAwMzEyOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125","sha":"82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125"}],"sha":"d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/d2854bfff0a0b6f46984b0941ed1db6010031295"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:37:11Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:37:11Z","email":"calvados.aeronautics@gmail.com","name":"blazux"},"message":"Serve Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on a single DGX Spark via vLLM\n\nAdds a patch to the official vLLM Flash-Next image that serves the 44 GiB\nn-gram (PLE) table from NVMe via mmap instead of keeping it resident, so the\n122 GiB NVFP4 checkpoint fits next to a real KV cache in the GB10''s 128 GB\nunified pool. ~5x faster prefill than the llama.cpp GGUF, plus MTP.\n\ngit clone -> docker build -> download-weights -> serve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63611312fe25a96b66c8b42d1b4d694fa319108d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/trees/63611312fe25a96b66c8b42d1b4d694fa319108d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/git/commits/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commit/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125","node_id":"C_kwDOUXaI9doAKDgyZWQ0OGQzNzNkOGEyYzAzZDE0MmQyMDNmMDdiY2UwYTZiNjkxMjU","parents":[],"sha":"82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits/82ed48d373d8a2c03d142d203f07bce0a6b69125"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/shinrali/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVIDIA-Hybrid-Single-Spark/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=12c06dc13e18d0f57ca1aaa9189a0008a0d9d347&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A58.051Z"}');
