laude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/a49d89dfd2c020b74e915be11bd6a2fa0096c89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:25:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:25:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"useBusyDelay: 300ms default minimum, Hooks docs section, tecton CLI and skill\n\n- minDuration now defaults to 300ms (delay stays 200ms).\n- The docs page moves to a new top-level Hooks section\n  (/docs/hooks/use-busy-delay); the Tecton index is back to components only.\n- guidelines/use-busy-delay.md and a new `hooks` family put the hook in\n  `tecton search` / `tecton docs`, and its Usage guidelines on the page.\n  guidelines-lib treats `tecton/use-*` as hook modules: a `.ts` source,\n  documented under content/docs/hooks/ (docsPageOf), and sync-guidelines\n  renders into that page.\n- The tecton skill and the rules topic name the hooks under the\n  @tecton/react/tecton namespace; Spinner''s guideline links to the hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HuVYVXu7f1seUJa3qP8jfR","tree":{"sha":"46e76c602bcf77d6603788ee21c220601920f16e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/46e76c602bcf77d6603788ee21c220601920f16e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/a49d89dfd2c020b74e915be11bd6a2fa0096c89c","verification":{"payload":"tree 46e76c602bcf77d6603788ee21c220601920f16e\nparent 6f3a5837f3065896fdaf4abe3fb518131f492817\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791087918 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791087918 +0000\n\nuseBusyDelay: 300ms default minimum, Hooks docs section, tecton CLI and skill\n\n- minDuration now defaults to 300ms (delay stays 200ms).\n- The docs page moves to a new top-level Hooks section\n  (/docs/hooks/use-busy-delay); the Tecton index is back to components only.\n- guidelines/use-busy-delay.md and a new `hooks` family put the hook in\n  `tecton search` / `tecton docs`, and its Usage guidelines on the page.\n  guidelines-lib treats `tecton/use-*` as hook modules: a `.ts` source,\n  documented under content/docs/hooks/ (docsPageOf), and sync-guidelines\n  renders into that page.\n- The tecton skill and the rules topic name the hooks under the\n  @tecton/react/tecton namespace; Spinner''s guideline links to the hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HuVYVXu7f1seUJa3qP8jfR\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPxJIkil\ntwrHzKFtHa4w6ozCMhYsREqh1QL93DntqOQuE3Mu+KXqUpFudlu99yYovPmOH4BaIMGmEruMK7rb\nxAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T04:25:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","use