atars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9e50d3260826cb43ecee9ac405291312fe1746bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:02:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:02:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Revert the Button colour changes, keep the Tabs ones\n\nThe Button differences from Tecton were small (outline border) or added a\npatch hunk and three tokens for little visible gain, so Button goes back to\nmain. Tabs keep the Tecton hover / press surfaces, selected colours and the\ndisabled text colour (`disabled-subtle-foreground`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012FizBN95S7QHZUB82h3Ah2","tree":{"sha":"61ba1f77d9d0ea3c1dc40cb7b4e80c3f512af325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/61ba1f77d9d0ea3c1dc40cb7b4e80c3f512af325"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/9e50d3260826cb43ecee9ac405291312fe1746bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 61ba1f77d9d0ea3c1dc40cb7b4e80c3f512af325\nparent b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791086540 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791086540 +0000\n\nRevert the Button colour changes, keep the Tabs ones\n\nThe Button differences from Tecton were small (outline border) or added a\npatch hunk and three tokens for little visible gain, so Button goes back to\nmain. Tabs keep the Tecton hover / press surfaces, selected colours and the\ndisabled text colour (`disabled-subtle-foreground`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012FizBN95S7QHZUB82h3Ah2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOJWHhrX\nvtsQ/YtrY7s/BIWjO9XF3u3K7NIQJMWWIWAy8Y4wgr0H0f/IqwatPd863NVEb2lu+7MSlibVA+nO\n0gA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T04:02:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9e50d3260826cb43ecee9ac405291312fe1746bd","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDllNTBkMzI2MDgyNmNiNDNlY2VlOWFjNDA1MjkxMzEyZmUxNzQ2YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921","sha":"b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921"}],"sha":"9e50d3260826cb43ecee9ac405291312fe1746bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9e50d3260826cb43ecee9ac405291312fe1746bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1eb3548ef79f390c9facf887d9978eb469ccf15d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:02:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:02:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add useBusyDelay hook to @tecton/react/tecton\n\nuseBusyDelay(isPending, { delay, minDuration }) returns true only once\nisPending has stayed true for `delay` ms (200 by default), then keeps\nreturning true for at least `minDuration` ms (200 by default) so a fast\nresponse cannot make a busy indicator flash. Each change of isPending\nclears the previous timer before scheduling its own, and unmounting\nclears it too, so a stale timer can never flip the result.\n\nThe build and the exports map now pick up top-level .ts modules in\nsrc/tecton, so Tecton hooks ship as @tecton/react/tecton/use-*.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HuVYVXu7f1seUJa3qP8jfR","tree":{"sha":"e01326c2983882a501de90b1bd7e02b3240e2023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/e01326c2983882a501de90b1bd7e02b3240e2023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/1eb3548ef79f390c9facf887d9978eb469ccf15d","verification":{"payload":"tree e01326c2983882a501de90b1bd7e02b3240e2023\nparent c8313864822816f58ee9190a95379660b4a34535\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791086532 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791086532 +0000\n\nAdd useBusyDelay hook to @tecton/react/tecton\n\nuseBusyDelay(isPending, { delay, minDuration }) returns true only once\nisPending has stayed true for `delay` ms (200 by default), then keeps\nreturning true for at least `minDuration` ms (200 by default) so a fast\nresponse cannot make a busy indicator flash. Each change of isPending\nclears the previous timer before scheduling its own, and unmounting\nclears it too, so a stale timer can never flip the result.\n\nThe build and the exports map now pick up top-level .ts modules in\nsrc/tecton, so Tecton hooks ship as @tecton/react/tecton/use-*.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HuVYVXu7f1seUJa3qP8jfR\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAJK+Oc0\n+O/cKYRcKea7U7s6Z83bg6Wa7yxEb2teP52Vg1JX8vH4WHctB8LyvdfS7SVG7FGFVOZrBA7DmtoH\n9gQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T04:02:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/1eb3548ef79f390c9facf887d9978eb469ccf15d","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDFlYjM1NDhlZjc5ZjM5MGM5ZmFjZjg4N2Q5OTc4ZWI0NjljY2YxNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/c8313864822816f58ee9190a95379660b4a34535","sha":"c8313864822816f58ee9190a95379660b4a34535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/c8313864822816f58ee9190a95379660b4a34535"}],"sha":"1eb3548ef79f390c9facf887d9978eb469ccf15d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1eb3548ef79f390c9facf887d9978eb469ccf15d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T03:44:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T03:44:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Match Button and Tabs colours to the Tecton v0.7.0 theme\n\nCompared against the MuiButton / MuiTab / MuiTabs overrides in\n@webframework/tecton v0.7.0:\n\n- Outline button: resting border is action-outlined-border-strong and the\n  hovered border action-outlined-border-hover (was the input border for both).\n- Disabled buttons use Tecton''s disabled colours (disabled-filled bg/text,\n  disabled-outline border, disabled text-only text) instead of half opacity;\n  destructive, which has no Tecton Button, keeps the opacity.\n- Tabs: hover and press draw the tertiary hover / press surface, the selected\n  tab text is action-tertiary-text-active, the selected pill is\n  action-tertiary-bg-active (was the secondary active colour), and a disabled\n  tab uses the disabled text-only colour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012FizBN95S7QHZUB82h3Ah2","tree":{"sha":"7df074c07e85f6edca5e7349b6685ef149be9b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/7df074c07e85f6edca5e7349b6685ef149be9b9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/b95f5f90f1dce884d3ce11c42b1ebe2a82b64921","verification":{"payload":"tree 7df074c07e85f6edca5e7349b6685ef149be9b9b\nparent c8313864822816f58ee9190a95379660b4a34535\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791085457 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791085457 +0000\n\nMatch Button and Tabs colours to the Tecton v0.7.0 theme\n\nCompared against the MuiButton / MuiTab / MuiTabs overrides in\n@webframework/tecton v0.7.0:\n\n- Outline button: resting border is action-outlined-border-strong and the\n  hovered border action-outlined-border-hover (was the input border for both).\n- Disabled buttons use Tecton''s disabled colours (disabled-filled bg/text,\n  disabled-outline border, disabled text-only text) instead of half opacity;\n  destructive, which has no Tecton Button, keeps the opacity.\n- Tabs: hover and press draw the tertiary hover / press surface, the selected\n  tab text is action-tertiary-text-active, the selected pill is\n  action-tertiary-bg-active (was the secondary active colour), and a disabled\n  tab uses the disabled text-only colour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012FizBN95S7QHZUB82h3Ah2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFom8x7e\nLLtPyr4TdjyFRuvE9bZsknyNRQv0fGpmHyoZfhmQZh4QncNHvGc6/SoLAv8ujTl4rim4IdjgmQR3\n8A4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T03:44:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us