lic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/d0d71c2859d3b0cb7633a592238c314c3448a07a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:13:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:13:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Put every floating panel on the paper surface and restore the tree colours\n\nDialogs, popovers (and the date picker inside one), hover cards and\nmenus now share one surface: `popover` maps to bg-paper, the Tecton\nMUI menu surface, and the separate `menu` token goes. Tooltips stay on\nsurface elevation 2. The tree view goes back to its accent hover and\nselection colours.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15","tree":{"sha":"fe826cf37ea94186361275ad9e0918f98b88bd19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/fe826cf37ea94186361275ad9e0918f98b88bd19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/d0d71c2859d3b0cb7633a592238c314c3448a07a","verification":{"payload":"tree fe826cf37ea94186361275ad9e0918f98b88bd19\nparent 446d6f553988fbefa5c66ab806464fc50d35a4b3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790730812 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790730812 +0000\n\nPut every floating panel on the paper surface and restore the tree colours\n\nDialogs, popovers (and the date picker inside one), hover cards and\nmenus now share one surface: `popover` maps to bg-paper, the Tecton\nMUI menu surface, and the separate `menu` token goes. Tooltips stay on\nsurface elevation 2. The tree view goes back to its accent hover and\nselection colours.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFI