nThe backdrop keeps Tecton''s 50% backdrop-fill with the light blur back.\nThe slider thumb matches the lilac range and the rail is the full muted\nlilac, as the Tecton slider looks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBhZilwg\nL+pXUPH9Cbruuze7VU2n1nmCUnuuGvJ5iOhun5b5K4ltiHWuv4S9sTULgaMdtRt9/oCXE+S3spin\nVgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T00:46:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/446d6f553988fbefa5c66ab806464fc50d35a4b3","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDQ0NmQ2ZjU1Mzk4OGZiZWZhNWM2NmFiODA2NDY0ZmM1MGQzNWE0YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/6b71277308d9a3653a6e519c572d2f9498dcc7ef","sha":"6b71277308d9a3653a6e519c572d2f9498dcc7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/6b71277308d9a3653a6e519c572d2f9498dcc7ef"}],"sha":"446d6f553988fbefa5c66ab806464fc50d35a4b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/446d6f553988fbefa5c66ab806464fc50d35a4b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/6b71277308d9a3653a6e519c572d2f9498dcc7ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:01:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:01:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Remap surfaces and controls to Tecton''s MUI theme tokens\n\nFollow the Tecton MUI theme where it uses the new tokens:\n- popover (dialog, popover, hover card) on surface-elevation-2-bg;\n  menus (dropdown, context menu, select, combobox, composer list) on a\n  new `menu` token (bg-paper); sheet and drawer on `card` (paper).\n- modal overlays on a new `backdrop` token (backdrop-fill), no blur.\n- checked checkbox / radio on new `filled*` tokens (action-filled-bg),\n  with hover and pressed steps.\n- slider range on accent-lilac-main with a `slider-rail` (lilac-muted)\n  and a primary thumb; progress on extended-lilac-680 with a\n  `progress-track` (lilac-260).\n- sidebar-accent on content-bg-hover, with new `content-pressed` /\n  `content-active` for pressed and current sidebar items and the tree\n  view''s hover, press and selection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15","tree":{"sha":"b9c2f2694fd6876e53711d2da304217166eb9723","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/b9c2f2694fd6876e53711d2da304217166eb9723"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/6b71277308d9a3653a6e519c572d2f9498dcc7ef","verification":{"payload":"tree b9c2f2694fd6876e53711d2da304217166eb9723\nparent 9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790726517 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790726517 +0000\n\nRemap surfaces and controls to Tecton''s MUI theme tokens\n\nFollow the Tecton MUI theme where it uses the new tokens:\n- popover (dialog, popover, hover card) on surface-elevation-2-bg;\n  menus (dropdown, context menu, select, combobox, composer list) on a\n  new `menu` token (bg-paper); sheet and drawer on `card` (paper).\n- modal overlays on a new `backdrop` token (backdrop-fill), no blur.\n- checked checkbox / radio on new `filled*` tokens (action-filled-bg),\n  with hover and pressed steps.\n- slider range on accent-lilac-main with a `slider-rail` (lilac-muted)\n  and a primary thumb; progress on extended-lilac-680 with a\n  `progress-track` (lilac-260).\n- sidebar-accent on content-bg-hover, with new `content-pressed` /\n  `content-active` for pressed and current sidebar items and the tree\n  view''s hover, press and selection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH S