","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:40:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:40:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Update the Tecton tokens and put tooltips on surface elevation 2\n\nReplace tecton-tokens.css with the token stylesheet embedded in\n@webframework/tecton v0.7.0: 82 new tokens (the surface elevation set,\naction-filled, content states, outline status borders and states, the\ndata/action/strong type scale), two renamed font weights, and updated\nstatus bright/muted values (the mapped `success` shifts slightly).\n\nThe tooltip now uses surface-elevation-2-bg with text-primary in both\nmodes, as Tecton''s MUI tooltip does. The new light\nsurface-base-border-active value is off the palette ramps and is\nallow-listed like focus-ring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15","tree":{"sha":"5eee9a2039636daccbf085cf63e7414c05863d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/5eee9a2039636daccbf085cf63e7414c05863d42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b","verification":{"payload":"tree 5eee9a2039636daccbf085cf63e7414c05863d42\nparent 5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790725231 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790725231 +0000\n\nUpdate the Tecton tokens and put tooltips on surface elevation 2\n\nReplace tecton-tokens.css with the token stylesheet embedded in\n@webframework/tecton v0.7.0: 82 new tokens (the surface elevation set,\naction-filled, content states, outline status borders and states, the\ndata/action/strong type scale), two renamed font weights, and updated\nstatus bright/muted values (the mapped `success` shifts slightly).\n\nThe tooltip now uses surface-elevation-2-bg with text-primary in both\nmodes, as Tecton''s MUI tooltip does. The new light\nsurface-base-border-active value is off the palette ramps and is\nallow-listed like focus-ring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF192obz\nnsdV0Y48ysTyL9Ibqh8k2bEN7l5yXLfmWYtOx4TaBg1reKg3MYEegIpaUUy1MjOrJY7mR7tqez0U\n1QM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T23:40:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDljOTA1ZmFhODFmMjQzNDY0ODA0YzhkYjBiNDFlMzIwNWNmZWE5OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024","sha":"5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024"}],"sha":"9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9c905faa81f243464804c8db0b41e3205cfea99b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:51:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:51:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Give tooltips a raised grey surface in dark mode\n\nThe tooltip used upstream''s inverted bg-foreground / text-background,\na near-white chip in dark mode. New tooltip / tooltip-foreground tokens\nkeep the light look and use the secondary action surface with primary\ntext in dark mode; the overlay patch points the popup and arrow at them\nand a Kbd inside a tooltip tints with tooltip-foreground.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15","tree":{"sha":"00c436d0fdc5a79fc3da90ee82f7c63e01a31cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/00c436d0fdc5a79fc3da90ee82f7c63e01a31cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024","verification":{"payload":"tree 00c436d0fdc5a79fc3da90ee82f7c63e01a31cc0\nparent 1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790707905 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790707905 +0000\n\nGive tooltips a raised grey surface in dark mode\n\nThe tooltip used upstream''s inverted bg-foreground / text-background,\na near-white chip in dark mode. New tooltip / tooltip-foreground tokens\nkeep the light look and use the secondary action surface with primary\ntext in dark mode; the overlay patch points the popup and arrow at them\nand a Kbd inside a tooltip tints with tooltip-foreground.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOkD11Tl\nfuR8YNSQ9+ITjqvilOrII7ar0B30OnnjS7X353qKOqopBH7/bnDxv4tg223ClTaLrJjMCvq2+3oT\nEgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T18:51:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDVlZjc5MjI5YjMzYzliZmQ4N2NjODhkNDgxMGNlZGFmYWEwNTcwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730","sha":"1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730"}],"sha":"5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5ef79229b33c9bfd87cc88d4810cedafaa057024"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:51:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:51:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fall back to the copy command when the Clipboard API is missing\n\nOver plain HTTP on a non-localhost address navigator.clipboard is\nundefined, so every CopyButton showed \"Copy failed\". CopyButton now\nretries through a selected textarea and execCommand(\"copy\") and only\nfails when both refuse. The docs site''s package-manager block uses\nCopyButton instead of its own silent clipboard call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15","tree":{"sha":"89c09376df165fc1711ed8c6b8d9bbb83380151a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/89c09376df165fc1711ed8c6b8d9bbb83380151a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/1da2e146a69d56e7ebfa0b321cb36d4857a0d730","verification":{"payload":"tree 89c09376df165fc1711ed8c6b8d9bbb83380151a\nparent 9d8457042a497a0cf65b0161eb3a94aa6e8eed87\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790707905 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790707905 +0000\n\nFall back to the copy command when the Clipboard API is missing\n\nOver plain HTTP on a non-localhost address navigator.clipboard is\nundefined, so every CopyButton showed \"Copy failed\". CopyButton now\nretries through a selected textarea and execCommand(\"copy\") and only\nfails when both refuse. The docs site''s package-manager block uses\nCopyButton instead of its own silent clipboard call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RuZJpF48J6sjt8Zjqhvr15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGjz49AS\n5wlWzPLYgDq1cizvHrTtICglsJvCIm7x2P6Ymi9j3LkUUUrODhYbylfahMsYdDdGtlXWRJpfl9FW\nZw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T18:51:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/co