l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9d8457042a497a0cf65b0161eb3a94aa6e8eed87","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDlkODQ1NzA0MmE0OTdhMGNmNjViMDE2MWViM2E5NGFhNmU4ZWVkODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/132dcde6746e66ee81487c8c6796ebb999c65bc7","sha":"132dcde6746e66ee81487c8c6796ebb999c65bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/132dcde6746e66ee81487c8c6796ebb999c65bc7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/dec356d1d3e52c07ba6e900b96f896d3ac7fa78b","sha":"dec356d1d3e52c07ba6e900b96f896d3ac7fa78b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/dec356d1d3e52c07ba6e900b96f896d3ac7fa78b"}],"sha":"9d8457042a497a0cf65b0161eb3a94aa6e8eed87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9d8457042a497a0cf65b0161eb3a94aa6e8eed87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/dec356d1d3e52c07ba6e900b96f896d3ac7fa78b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T18:33:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T18:33:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep left and right Sheet and Drawer panels physical in RTL\n\nThe CLI''s RTL transform made the border, corners, slide and (for\nDrawer) the edge, transform-origin and bleed of a left or right panel\nlogical, while `side` / `swipeDirection` and Base UI''s swipe are\nphysical: in RTL a left sheet drew its border on the screen edge and\nslid in from the right, and a left drawer anchored on the right. The\noverlay now writes those classes as ltr:/rtl: pairs, which the\ntransform leaves alone, and reverses a horizontal drawer''s row in RTL\nso the swipe handle stays on the inner edge.\n\nAlso pass the cn-* allowlist to awk through the environment:\na newline in an `awk -v` value is rejected by BSD awk, which made the\ncheck pass silently on macOS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"f2f98188ecb1d4a9ced7ac50ec0f5ebfcc5e3207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/f2f98188ecb1d4a9ced7ac50ec0f5ebfcc5e3207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/dec356d1d3e52c07ba6e900b96f896d3ac7fa78b","verification":{"payload":"tree f2f98188ecb1d4a9ced7ac50ec0f5ebfcc5e3207\nparent 9e1ed15cd107fc8ed5851bcb308f6e7449e3fbdd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790447590 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790447590 +0000\n\nKeep left and right Sheet and Drawer panels physical in RTL\n\nThe CLI''s RTL transform made the border, corners, slide and (for\nDrawer) the edge, transform-origin and bleed of a left or right panel\nlogical, while `side` / `swipeDirection` and Base UI''s swipe are\nphysical: in RTL a left sheet drew its border on the screen edge and\nslid in from the right, and a left drawer anchored on the right. The\noverlay now writes those classes as ltr:/rtl: pairs, which the\ntransform leaves alone, and reverses a horizontal drawer''s row in RTL\nso the swipe handle stays on the inner edge.\n\nAlso pass the cn-* allowlist to awk through the environment:\na newline in an `awk -v` value is rejected by BSD awk, which made the\ncheck pass silently on macOS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEa6IxLq\nKpCmMDxh3gNL5HNwQt1xvtcP0gqIAWN0I421PWXwRh50eD+xA4ZuQEErVrXSJavb8PviFTRV6fNU\nMAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T18:40:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_