er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/176768ff3f906d75db572849f02cfd83ab25b4a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:11:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:11:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Merge the logical position names for CanvasOverlay and CountBadge\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"874f0931bb165b4617f6ad174e031a54c842546d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/874f0931bb165b4617f6ad174e031a54c842546d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/176768ff3f906d75db572849f02cfd83ab25b4a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 874f0931bb165b4617f6ad174e031a54c842546d\nparent ea4e726475a013c23211d0dea0066f78f750da93\nparent 4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442695 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442695 +0000\n\nMerge the logical position names for CanvasOverlay and CountBadge\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNIGPtOA\ny2tlGPhaRlWXDfHFi7JBCfv6LIiBZijwJlFaECHHeT3l4Tz5X+6pB7S5qY657Hc0AAUxGyv1RujW\nbgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:16:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/p