id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:11:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:11:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Name CanvasOverlay positions and CountBadge anchors logically\n\nThe classes were already logical (start/end insets that mirror in RTL), so\nthe names now say so. Clean break, no aliases:\n\n- CanvasOverlay `position`: top-left -> top-start (default), top-right ->\n  top-end, left -> start, right -> end, bottom-left -> bottom-start,\n  bottom-right -> bottom-end (`top` and `bottom` unchanged).\n- CountBadge `anchor`: top-right -> top-end (default), top-left ->\n  top-start, bottom-right -> bottom-end, bottom-left -> bottom-start.\n\nUpdates the overflow menu badge, tests (with RTL assertions that the\nstart/end insets are logical), guidelines, docs pages, examples and the\ncanvas-01 block; regenerates the agent index and the block registry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"3a036a075fb3a6a0da13962e0d4225b5b7d5cff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/3a036a075fb3a6a0da13962e0d4225b5b7d5cff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a036a075fb3a6a0da13962e0d4225b5b7d5cff6\nparent 9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442671 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442671 +0000\n\nName CanvasOverlay positions and CountBadge anchors logically\n\nThe classes were already logical (start/end insets that mirror in RTL), so\nthe names now say so. Clean break, no aliases:\n\n- CanvasOverlay `position`: top-left -> top-start (default), top-right ->\n  top-end, left -> start, right -> end, bottom-left -> bottom-start,\n  bottom-right -> bottom-end (`top` and `bottom` unchanged).\n- CountBadge `anchor`: top-right -> top-end (default), top-left ->\n  top-start, bottom-right -> bottom-end, bottom-left -> bottom-start.\n\nUpdates the overflow menu badge, tests (with RTL assertions that the\nstart/end insets are logical), guidelines, docs pages, examples and the\ncanvas-01 block; regenerates the agent index and the block registry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEJCVbhL\nN6uVcpu7KEFbj/tq/LVhBAa1Jqw2kdR7e7RbOopvs7oYjRn3zaPZVDcoxvYOmUABopVJQCrYUTQF\nMQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:16:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDRmZGY2MzQyNTQ3M2MwZGRlNzliOTQxN2JiNmZlMmRhNTRjYmNiOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","sha":"9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3"}],"sha":"4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/4fdf63425473c0dde79b9417bb6fe2da54cbcb96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ea4e726475a013c23211d0dea0066f78f750da93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:09:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:09:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Strip Base UI references from the synced component docs\n\ndocs:sync now removes every consumer-visible pointer to the libraries the\ncomponents are built on: Base UI `links` in the frontmatter (the Docs /\nAPI Reference header buttons), the \"See the Base UI documentation\"\nsentences and the API Reference headings they leave empty, library\ncallouts and \"Migrating from ...\" sections (drawer), \"The Base UI `X`\ncomponent\" and \"from Base UI\" phrasing, and the avatar prop wording.\nA final guard fails the sync, naming file and line, if a generated page\nor synced example still says Base UI, React Aria or Radix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"8f6bda7568f167374e54ec9f4f0a50bca65cc2b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/8f6bda7568f167374e54ec9f4f0a50bca65cc2b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/ea4e726475a013c23211d0dea0066f78f750da93","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f6bda7568f167374e54ec9f4f0a50bca65cc2b9\nparent 9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442594 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790442594 +0000\n\nStrip Base UI references from the synced component docs\n\ndocs:sync now removes every consumer-visible pointer to the libraries the\ncomponents are built on: Base UI `links` in the frontmatter (the Docs /\nAPI Reference header buttons), the \"See the Base UI documentation\"\nsentences and the API Reference headings they leave empty, library\ncallouts and \"Migrating from ...\" sections (drawer), \"The Base UI `X`\ncomponent\" and \"from Base UI\" phrasing, and the avatar prop wording.\nA final guard fails the sync, naming file and line, if a generated page\nor synced example still says Base UI, React Aria or Radix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNb2S6Az\nmRychqLd+JszTzw1ctXXOH0W4lZA7+nNjr05tRQDkL3xsZjAexqfel4ZmReV3U6Dn6oL7+kVO477\n+gk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:10:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ea4e726475a013c23211d0dea0066f78f750da93","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKGVhNGU3MjY0NzVhMDEzYzIzMjExZDBkZWEwMDY2Zjc4Zjc1MGRhOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","sha":"9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f575924