-ui-1/git/commits/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9cace08b4c4575aa189d7290f08e8cb063cadd94\nparent da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb\nparent 29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790420227 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790420227 +0000\n\nMerge the public API and naming fixes from the verification pass\n\nAlso point CLAUDE.md at the internal AriaBridge module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFKOOxMU\nK45j7sT9bWf1mvBlHWcw13hZX7vXllkQYH2pYJCXcVtQkFIkRCo6B20DucAZkro/KbWqENlD+cam\n8Q8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T11:04:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDlhZGNkMGJiMDE2ODJiMWZlYjRjZDBmYTkzZjU3NTkyNDFiZjg0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb","sha":"da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04","sha":"29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04"}],"sha":"9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/9adcd0bb01682b1feb4cd0fa93f5759241bf84f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:56:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:56:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep React Aria and Base UI off the public surface; Base UI-style names across Tecton and blocks\n\n- Link/LinkButton: Tecton-owned prop types (anchor attributes + render\n  element or function); no library types in the emitted declarations.\n- AriaBridge, the router helpers and localeDirection move to\n  src/tecton/internal/ (built, not exported). The provider context is\n  tagged @internal and stripped from the .d.ts (stripInternal); the\n  portal module keeps only PortalProvider and usePortalTarget, both\n  internal. components/direction is left out of the exports map.\n- TreeView: TreeViewItem textValue -> label; props narrowed to what is\n  forwarded (id, className, style, aria-*, data-*); new onActivate,\n  empty and disallowEmptySelection.\n- Composer: attachment and command items use value (onRemove gets the\n  value); useComposer returns busy instead of isBusy.\n- ActionBar: onDismiss -> onOpenChange(false). Background: data-static\n  presence attribute instead of data-animate=\"false\".\n- CircularProgress: valueLabel restored (shown and announced).\n- Overflow Toolbar: arrow keys follow the TectonProvider direction.\n- Blocks: selected/onSelectedChange, busy, inline-end menus and\n  tooltips next to sidebars, direction-aware tool panel, row headers in\n  fda-comparison-table and list-01, no dead Help action in shell-01.\n- Examples: logical classes, labelled sliders on Base UI value arrays.\n- Federation shares the bare @base-ui/react specifier too.\n- Leftovers: package description, unused @internationalized/date,\n  base-tecton in TOKEN-MAPPING, removed \"direction\" id in agent-eval.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"120c26b78d3107070c63c1adb1b291ad9f062ff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/120c26b78d3107070c63c1adb1b291ad9f062ff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04","verification":{"payload":"tree 120c26b78d3107070c63c1adb1b291ad9f062ff7\nparent f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790420164 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790420164 +0000\n\nKeep React Aria and Base UI off the public surface; Base UI-style names across Tecton and blocks\n\n- Link/LinkButton: Tecton-owned prop types (anchor attributes + render\n  element or function); no library types in the emitted declarations.\n- AriaBridge, the router helpers and localeDirection move to\n  src/tecton/internal/ (built, not exported). The provider context is\n  tagged @internal and stripped from the .d.ts (stripInternal); the\n  portal module keeps only PortalProvider and usePortalTarget, both\n  internal. components/direction is left out of the exports map.\n- TreeView: TreeViewItem textValue -> label; props narrowed to what is\n  forwarded (id, className, style, aria-*, data-*); new onActivate,\n  empty and disallowEmptySelection.\n- Composer: attachment and command items use value (onRemove gets the\n  value); useComposer returns busy instead of isBusy.\n- ActionBar: onDismiss -> onOpenChange(false). Background: data-static\n  presence attribute instead of data-animate=\"false\".\n- CircularProgress: valueLabel restored (shown and announced).\n- Overflow Toolbar: arrow keys follow the TectonProvider direction.\n- Blocks: selected/onSelectedChange, busy, inline-end menus and\n  tooltips next to sidebars, direction-aware tool panel, row headers in\n  fda-comparison-table and list-01, no dead Help action in shell-01.\n- Examples: logical classes, labelled sliders on Base UI value arrays.\n- Federation shares the bare @base-ui/react specifier too.\n- Leftovers: package description, unused @internationalized/date,\n  base-tecton in TOKEN-MAPPING, removed \"direction\" id in agent-eval.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMIaCyg9\nHt2hDeREtWLpXT2EqgXneEwzzBAa3xGYwDMHc3KrO0cEzp52RwdsMS8CAONFcvN0+GjbIVxNrxv5\n+AU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T11:04:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDI5ZjFiNTM1YzJmNTk2NTYyZjI4NTQ0OWUzZWMwOGRkZTY1YjdmMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","sha":"f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028"}],"sha":"29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/29f1b535c2f596562f285449e3ec08dde65b7f04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatar