bar, button, slider overlay fixes and synced-docs rewrites\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIDBvxbC\nzGa5gdKgnTZbnlIpfAPJS5g7llNMRyHDliBMSDWv3ovFciXjGEL2DLI4PUsAjT7xMA4PKD8fZh7F\n+w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T10:46:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKGRhNjNkYTRjYTc0N2MxOTZjNGIwNjczZjg3ZDc3Nzk5NWZkMTNkZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1","sha":"5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329","sha":"aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329"}],"sha":"da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/da63da4ca747c196c4b0673f87d777995fd13deb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:46:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:46:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Drop the sidebar keyboard shortcut; button data attributes, slider thumb names, accurate synced docs\n\n- Overlay: SidebarProvider loses upstream''s window-wide Cmd/Ctrl+B listener\n  (SIDEBAR_KEYBOARD_SHORTCUT) and the Tecton `keyboardShortcut` prop; apps\n  call toggleSidebar() from their own key handler. Button renders\n  data-variant / data-size, so the button-group outline-stroke rule matches\n  again. Slider passes aria-label to every thumb''s range input.\n- Tests: no Cmd/Ctrl+B toggle and toggleSidebar still works; Button data\n  attributes; ButtonGroup stroke selector on mixed / filled-only groups;\n  slider thumbs named by aria-label and aria-labelledby.\n- Docs sync: sidebar page documents no built-in shortcut, toggle-group usage\n  drops the Radix `type` prop, alert and badge API tables list the Tecton\n  variant axes.\n- Sidebar and slider guidelines, micro-frontends and cli pages, and the\n  complete list of overlay hunks in docs/UPSTREAM.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"5844cc7eecf14e1c6dcc101859ff63e8baef2c7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/5844cc7eecf14e1c6dcc101859ff63e8baef2c7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329","verification":{"payload":"tree 5844cc7eecf14e1c6dcc101859ff63e8baef2c7a\nparent f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790419569 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790419569 +0000\n\nDrop the sidebar keyboard shortcut; button data attributes, slider thumb names, accurate synced docs\n\n- Overlay: SidebarProvider loses upstream''s window-wide Cmd/Ctrl+B listener\n  (SIDEBAR_KEYBOARD_SHORTCUT) and the Tecton `keyboardShortcut` prop; apps\n  call toggleSidebar() from their own key handler. Button renders\n  data-variant / data-size, so the button-group outline-stroke rule matches\n  again. Slider passes aria-label to every thumb''s range input.\n- Tests: no Cmd/Ctrl+B toggle and toggleSidebar still works; Button data\n  attributes; ButtonGroup stroke selector on mixed / filled-only groups;\n  slider thumbs named by aria-label and aria-labelledby.\n- Docs sync: sidebar page documents no built-in shortcut, toggle-group usage\n  drops the Radix `type` prop, alert and badge API tables list the Tecton\n  variant axes.\n- Sidebar and slider guidelines, micro-frontends and cli pages, and the\n  complete list of overlay hunks in docs/UPSTREAM.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ87eB06\nSGBnHDpt5w20LLcGQMWGW8vNgtOb48VJ/A1ekeN5ONnxsJnuSh3K+mPJGFwaveh0aD62zx5WlDG1\nqAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T10:46:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKGFhZTZmOTQ1ZThjODE1ODY3ZjBhNjE4NmU1OWNlZWVmZDE2YTczMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","sha":"f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028"}],"sha":"aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/aae6f945e8c815867f0a6186e59ceeefd16a7329"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:38:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:38:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep library names out of the guidelines and lint for them\n\n- Don''t entries name the wrong props instead of the library they come from\n  (\"onPress and isDisabled on a Button\", \"A trigger wrapping the button and\n  the overlay\", \"Unlike stock shadcn\"); conventions, theming and families.json\n  are library-free apart from the import prohibitions.\n- AlertDialog: AlertDialogAction always closes; a prompt kept open during\n  async work is controlled and confirms with a Button calling setOpen(false).\n- guidelines:check rejects library names in guideline, topic, skill,\n  families.json and adopted-rule text (package names only in an import\n  prohibition); documented in guidelines/README.md.\n- components/direction and tecton/portal are INTERNAL_MODULES: no family,\n  no guideline.\n- Search: \"chat input\" ranks Composer first (chat input / chat box / prompt\n  box synonyms), \"open a menu from a button\" ranks DropdownMenu first; the\n  agent-eval README keeps only the current table.\n- Docs: ThemeRoot without dir resolves to ltr (remotes pass dir and locale),\n  the shadcn-parity claim points at these pages, CopyButton lists its\n  variant and size unions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"d15fe85b3931b6128372d9d4e5a737805121b20a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/d15fe85b3931b6128372d9d4e5a737805121b20a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1","verification":{"payload":"tree d15fe85b3931b6128372d9d4e5a737805121b20a\nparent f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790419092 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790419092 +0000\n\nKeep library names out of the guidelines and lint for them\n\n- Don''t entries name the wrong props instead of the library they come from\n  (\"onPress and isDisabled on a Button\", \"A trigger wrapping the button and\n  the overlay\", \"Unlike stock shadcn\"); conventions, theming and families.json\n  are library-free apart from the import prohibitions.\n- AlertDialog: AlertDialogAction always closes; a prompt kept open during\n  async work is controlled and confirms with a Button calling setOpen(false).\n- guidelines:check rejects library names in guideline, topic, skill,\n  families.json and adopted-rule text (package names only in an import\n  prohibition); documented in guidelines/README.md.\n- components/direction and tecton/portal are INTERNAL_MODULES: no family,\n  no guideline.\n- Search: \"chat input\" ranks Composer first (chat input / chat box / prompt\n  box synonyms), \"open a menu from a button\" ranks DropdownMenu first; the\n  agent-eval README keeps only the current table.\n- Docs: ThemeRoot without dir resolves to ltr (remotes pass dir and locale),\n  the shadcn-parity claim points at these pages, CopyButton lists its\n  variant and size unions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNRYyPJ4\nbmkVdole3M5O3LD2zwd6c0TvDxEnoK7v+wdezfehhaB2VRNDWscuNJy9e8WVwdCWQsZBMGp2o53r\nXA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T10:38:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDVmMDYwYmU0MWNjMmEyNjBiYWZhOTQyMTZlOTc4ZDY2ODEwZWMxYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","sha":"f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028"}],"sha":"5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5f060be41cc2a260bafa94216e978d66810ec1b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:02:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:03:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Restore React Aria-era behaviour: closing AlertDialogAction, tabs that select on arrow keys, physical sidebar sides\n\n- Overlay: AlertDialogAction renders the AlertDialog Close part with Button\n  styling (variant/size kept), so a click closes the prompt again;\n  preventBaseUIHandler() in onClick keeps it open.\n- Overlay: TabsList defaults activateOnFocus to true (arrow keys select, as\n  before); activateOnFocus={false} restores manual activation.\n- Overlay: the sidebar border, offcanvas rail position and resize cursors\n  stay on the physical edge in RTL (the CLI''s RTL transform mirrored them),\n  and SidebarMenuButton opens its collapsed tooltip away from the sidebar''s\n  side instead of a hard-coded \"right\".\n- ColorSwatch: onChange -> onColorChange, value -> detail; every usage,\n  guideline, docs page, example and block updated.\n- Guidelines, rules, families and SKILL.md inverted for AlertDialogAction;\n  tabs and sidebar guidelines note the activation and the physical side.\n- Tests for all of the above in overlay-behaviour.test.tsx.\n- Regenerated docs pages, agent index and registry outputs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"b0832e79aaeaf25c52d692bbcd06ecb1fd922e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/b0832e79aaeaf25c52d692bbcd06ecb1fd922e85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/f8091411c0c7fe38944d2e95583ff57e7267d028","verification":{"payload":"tree b0832e79aaeaf25c52d692bbcd06ecb1fd922e85\nparent e8479b5ea318b2a3a190b5af1c7df503036c2e25\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790416969 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790417009 +0000\n\nRestore React Aria-era behaviour: closing AlertDialogAction, tabs that select on arrow keys, physical sidebar sides\n\n- Overlay: AlertDialogAction renders the AlertDialog Close part with Button\n  styling (variant/size kept), so a click closes the prompt again;\n  preventBaseUIHandler() in onClick keeps it open.\n- Overlay: TabsList defaults activateOnFocus to true (arrow keys select, as\n  before); activateOnFocus={false} restores manual activation.\n- Overlay: the sidebar border, offcanvas rail position and resize cursors\n  stay on the physical edge in RTL (the CLI''s RTL transform mirrored them),\n  and SidebarMenuButton opens its collapsed tooltip away from the sidebar''s\n  side instead of a hard-coded \"right\".\n- ColorSwatch: onChange -> onColorChange, value -> detail; every usage,\n  guideline, docs page, example and block updated.\n- Guidelines, rules, families and SKILL.md inverted for AlertDialogAction;\n  tabs and sidebar guidelines note the activation and the physical side.\n- Tests for all of the above in overlay-behaviour.test.tsx.\n- Regenerated docs pages, agent index and registry outputs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOQMQRGB\nv7xlVG8+ACkeC+V1NAXg0H6iQEZc0ar6XJl8w0OolYlHW3GHegPkAQScpA+ynfDilc6XkOSkjYtq\nWgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T10:10:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"