"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ad05d5122f4c802bfe1165b611bb273e491f2146","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKGFkMDVkNTEyMmY0YzgwMmJmZTExNjViNjExYmIyNzNlNDkxZjIxNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940","sha":"eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd","sha":"15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd"}],"sha":"ad05d5122f4c802bfe1165b611bb273e491f2146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ad05d5122f4c802bfe1165b611bb273e491f2146"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5772fd049b3b16223e94b6f6ef30eacf661dad92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:45:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:45:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix docs-site and block issues found in the Base UI browser QA\n\nSite:\n- Icons page crashed (Base UI error #82): the gallery still used the React\n  Aria two-child tooltip; use Tooltip > TooltipTrigger + TooltipContent.\n- app-finder, app-shell and tree-view docs referenced an undefined `{name}`\n  in MDX prose, so those pages failed to render; put the strings in code.\n- Docs previous / next links followed file-system order; use the sidebar\n  order (fumadocs findNeighbour).\n- Calendar page hydration mismatch: the synced RTL demos used ar-SA (Hijri\n  month names in Chromium, Gregorian in Node); rewrite them to ar-EG in\n  sync-upstream-docs.\n- The theme menu stayed open after choosing a mode (Base UI radio items\n  keep the menu open); close on click.\n- Themes page overflowed at phone width; the radius toggles wrap. The blocks\n  page title wraps instead of truncating.\n- Scan the block sources for Tailwind classes; they only reached the site\n  CSS through the built registry JSON.\n- Sidebar docs: `side` is physical, so RTL needs side=\"right\".\n\nBlocks:\n- Sidebars (sidebar-01..04, canvas-01, detail-01) put the start sidebar on\n  the right in right-to-left layouts; disclosure chevrons and panel icons\n  mirror.\n- canvas-01: clicking a preset thumbnail did nothing (the thumbnail covered\n  the card''s button).\n- detail-01 and ai-agent-panel action menus were as narrow as their icon\n  trigger and wrapped their items; give them a width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"ed811c5a2580d9df3408f0be5d0c415ded4336b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/ed811c5a2580d9df3408f0be5d0c415ded4336b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/5772fd049b3b16223e94b6f6ef30eacf661dad92","verification":{"payload":"tree ed811c5a2580d9df3408f0be5d0c415ded4336b6\nparent eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790415936 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790415936 +0000\n\nFix docs-site and block issues found in the Base UI browser QA\n\nSite:\n- Icons page crashed (Base UI error #82): the gallery still used the React\n  Aria two-child tooltip; use Tooltip > TooltipTrigger + TooltipContent.\n- app-finder, app-shell and tree-view docs referenced an undefined `{name}`\n  in MDX prose, so those pages failed to render; put the strings in code.\n- Docs previous / next links followed file-system order; use the sidebar\n  order (fumadocs findNeighbour).\n- Calendar page hydration mismatch: the synced RTL demos used ar-SA (Hijri\n  month names in Chromium, Gregorian in Node); rewrite them to ar-EG in\n  sync-upstream-docs.\n- The theme menu stayed open after choosing a mode (Base UI radio items\n  keep the menu open); close on click.\n- Themes page overflowed at phone width; the radius toggles wrap. The blocks\n  page title wraps instead of truncating.\n- Scan the block sources for Tailwind classes; they only reached the site\n  CSS through the built registry JSON.\n- Sidebar docs: `side` is physical, so RTL needs side=\"right\".\n\nBlocks:\n- Sidebars (sidebar-01..04, canvas-01, detail-01) put the start sidebar on\n  the right in right-to-left layouts; disclosure chevrons and panel icons\n  mirror.\n- canvas-01: clicking a preset thumbnail did nothing (the thumbnail covered\n  the card''s button).\n- detail-01 and ai-agent-panel action menus were as narrow as their icon\n  trigger and wrapped their items; give them a width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIl4flTr\nuIlTo4U/zMa9YOWG5mAQSwgHQORY9NFctb35ZYoWR2pd7OqOPHeZ1+ktpj3hQGbwCovVDJep8/4m\nEAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T09:47:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/5772fd049b3b16223e94b6f6ef30eacf661dad92","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDU3NzJmZDA0OWIzYjE2MjIzZTk0YjZmNmVmMzBlYWNmNjYxZGFkOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940","sha":"eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940"}],"sha":"5772fd049b3b16223e94b6f6ef30eacf661dad92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5772fd049b3b16223e94b6f6ef30eacf661dad92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:44:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:44:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix docs-site QA findings after the Base UI migration\n\nBrowser QA of every /docs/components and /docs/tecton page (console,\nkeyboard and mouse interaction, light screenshots, RTL previews).\n\n- Tree view, app finder and app shell pages crashed during server\n  rendering: `{name}` in an MDX table cell is a JS expression. Quote it as\n  inline code.\n- TreeView rows and Chips never showed their selected state, and the\n  wells-table / fda-comparison-table blocks never showed selected rows:\n  shadcn''s `data-selected:` variant matches only \"true\", while these parts\n  write the presence attribute. Use `data-[selected]:`, document it, and\n  guard it with a test.\n- Overlay (tecton.patch): Calendar kept remounting its grid (inline\n  DayPicker components) and its day button dropped the ref, so clicks lost\n  focus and the arrow keys did nothing; the month dropdown and data-day\n  used the locale''s default calendar (Hijri month names on a Gregorian\n  grid for ar-SA, and a hydration mismatch). PaginationLink rendered\n  <a role=\"button\">. Tabs never passed `orientation` to the Base UI root,\n  so vertical tabs kept horizontal arrow keys. Re-added calendar,\n  pagination and tabs; tested in overlay-behaviour.test.tsx.\n- Background: round the spoke coordinates, which differed in the last\n  digit between server and browser (hydration mismatch); tested.\n- Guidelines recommended `<Button render={<a/>} nativeButton={false}>` for\n  links, which keeps role=\"button\" (the synced button page says so too):\n  point to LinkButton / buttonVariants instead, and move the site chrome\n  and the synced empty-demo / empty-rtl examples to anchors.\n- input-group-button example: the popover trigger was the addon div with\n  a button inside (Base UI nativeButton error); rewrite it in docs:sync.\n- ThemeRoot demo reported \"no container\" because it looked for the popup\n  in an effect before it mounted; use a ref callback.\n- PageHeader docs claimed the header never wraps; describe when it does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"985731aebe25c597327302de42bfd082c670af20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/985731aebe25c597327302de42bfd082c670af20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd","verification":{"payload":"tree 985731aebe25c597327302de42bfd082c670af20\nparent eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790415896 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790415896 +0000\n\nFix docs-site QA findings after the Base UI migration\n\nBrowser QA of every /docs/components and /docs/tecton page (console,\nkeyboard and mouse interaction, light screenshots, RTL previews).\n\n- Tree view, app finder and app shell pages crashed during server\n  rendering: `{name}` in an MDX table cell is a JS expression. Quote it as\n  inline code.\n- TreeView rows and Chips never showed their selected state, and the\n  wells-table / fda-comparison-table blocks never showed selected rows:\n  shadcn''s `data-selected:` variant matches only \"true\", while these parts\n  write the presence attribute. Use `data-[selected]:`, document it, and\n  guard it with a test.\n- Overlay (tecton.patch): Calendar kept remounting its grid (inline\n  DayPicker components) and its day button dropped the ref, so clicks lost\n  focus and the arrow keys did nothing; the month dropdown and data-day\n  used the locale''s default calendar (Hijri month names on a Gregorian\n  grid for ar-SA, and a hydration mismatch). PaginationLink rendered\n  <a role=\"button\">. Tabs never passed `orientation` to the Base UI root,\n  so vertical tabs kept horizontal arrow keys. Re-added calendar,\n  pagination and tabs; tested in overlay-behaviour.test.tsx.\n- Background: round the spoke coordinates, which differed in the last\n  digit between server and browser (hydration mismatch); tested.\n- Guidelines recommended `<Button render={<a/>} nativeButton={false}>` for\n  links, which keeps role=\"button\" (the synced button page says so too):\n  point to LinkButton / buttonVariants instead, and move the site chrome\n  and the synced empty-demo / empty-rtl examples to anchors.\n- input-group-button example: the popover trigger was the addon div with\n  a button inside (Base UI nativeButton error); rewrite it in docs:sync.\n- ThemeRoot demo reported \"no container\" because it looked for the popup\n  in an effect before it mounted; use a ref callback.\n- PageHeader docs claimed the header never wraps; describe when it does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCMR06Br\nhi7dqMwSFg21MNQPZRV3KG3epjYNIGs1cnrMGpvwdBy/bmASxMku+oEPOgezyqyqoqEXLsay8rK0\nxwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T09:46:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/15ef6da640f63cdf3bb226be63c38d35ccdd5cdd","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDE1ZWY2ZGE2NDBmNjNjZGYzYmIyMjZiZTYzYzM4ZDM1Y2NkZDVjZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/eeb7b5152906d5af8054494800869b1cca180940","sha":"eeb7b5152906d5af80544948008