47,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/71fc73f90a3482b451c03c7680e9b9993b2521f6","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDcxZmM3M2Y5MGEzNDgyYjQ1MWMwM2M3NjgwZTliOTk5M2IyNTIxZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ac0c6c3040a58f3bc1f936d0560436c91321a26a","sha":"ac0c6c3040a58f3bc1f936d0560436c91321a26a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ac0c6c3040a58f3bc1f936d0560436c91321a26a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/1e34df0a893623243e95ae202d83c88c03d11356","sha":"1e34df0a893623243e95ae202d83c88c03d11356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1e34df0a893623243e95ae202d83c88c03d11356"}],"sha":"71fc73f90a3482b451c03c7680e9b9993b2521f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/71fc73f90a3482b451c03c7680e9b9993b2521f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1e34df0a893623243e95ae202d83c88c03d11356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:50:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:50:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Tighten the Tecton component docs and fix inaccuracies\n\nRewrite the 21 Tecton pages and the index to the synced shadcn shape\n(intro, Usage, examples, API Reference) and cut about 30 % of the\nhand-written text: implementation essays, \"why we built it\" notes,\ncomposition trees that repeat the usage snippet, changelog tables and\nprose the generated guideline section already says.\n\nAccuracy fixes against the current source:\n- drop the react-aria.adobe.com frontmatter links and the React Aria\n  wording on the index; the provider guideline''s \"Wrong\" example no\n  longer imports a Base UI provider\n- canvas usage used a bare Button in CanvasToolbar; it is\n  CanvasToolbarButton (focusableWhenDisabled, render documented)\n- copy-button state attributes are presence attributes, not \"true\"\n- composer: Stop only replaces Send when onStop is set, a send is\n  allowed again after `error`, the default button labels, drop the\n  internal docs/research reference\n- overflow: drop the internal OVERFLOW-RULES.md reference and the cost\n  section; app-finder documents `container`, `value` uniqueness\n- count-badge demo puts the count in the button''s accessible name, as\n  the page requires\n\nRemove seven examples the demo or the API table already covers:\nbackground-tones, background-intensity, chip-sizes, count-badge-anchor,\nlink-sizes, meter-sizes, panel-sizes.