a-open, useLocale from the\nTecton provider and LinkButton from tecton/link.\n\nThe wells and FDA tables are plain HTML tables: selection is a\nCheckbox per row plus a select-all (checked / mixed), sorting a button\nin the header with aria-sort, and a click on a row opens it. The canvas\ntools are CanvasToolbarButtons (arrow keys along the rail). The\nhorizons depth field is a text Input that keeps the partial-entry,\nlocale formatting and arrow-key stepping of the old NumberField.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"db57633ab7f7ceaefe7ddadb7f84e67b69dd5b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/db57633ab7f7ceaefe7ddadb7f84e67b69dd5b76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/f08df13d83376eba8112aa3aa78009f8c560ed2c","verification":{"payload":"tree db57633ab7f7ceaefe7ddadb7f84e67b69dd5b76\nparent e1396e47cc72dad4b65c6672310d7142c0c83098\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790408543 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790408543 +0000\n\nMove ten blocks to the Base UI components and the Tecton APIs\n\ncanvas-01, page-state, list-01, detail-01, facies-modeling-panel,\nhorizons-panel, well-design-card, fda-comparison-table, fda-card and\ncontent-01 now import only @tecton/react and ordinary libraries:\nonClick/disabled/checked, Root + Trigger(render) + Content menus and\ntooltips, Select items/value, Tabs and ToggleGroup values, Slider value\narrays, Collapsible defaultOpen with data-open, useLocale from the\nTecton provider and LinkButton from tecton/link.\n\nThe wells and FDA tables are plain HTML tables: selection is a\nCheckbox per row plus a select-all (checked / mixed), sorting a button\nin the header with aria-sort, and a click on a row opens it. The canvas\ntools are CanvasToolbarButtons (arrow keys along the rail). The\nhorizons depth field is a text Input that keeps the partial-entry,\nlocale formatting and arrow-key stepping of the old NumberField.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK3xcbMd\nHXKn1OjVAy2eAagMxHEu6wAKquOnG35WP60ZMBakb9XSMD1uyLKFNBXWnO5XB0UpsbOwiqynrERV\nywQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T07:49:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/f08df13d83376eba8112aa3aa78009f8c560ed2c","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKGYwOGRmMTNkODMzNzZlYmE4MTEyYWEzYWE3ODAwOWY4YzU2MGVkMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/e1396e47cc72dad4b65c6672310d7142c0c83098","sha":"e1396e47cc72dad4b65c6672310d7142c0c83098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/e1396e47cc72dad4b65c6672310d7142c0c83098"}],"sha":"f08df13d83376eba8112aa3aa78009f8c560