 API\n\n- sync-upstream-docs.mts reads content/docs/components/base and\n  examples/base: import rewrites for @/styles/base-*/ui (and the\n  pre-bases @/registry/new-york-v4/ui), date-fns / react-day-picker\n  instead of react-aria-components / @internationalized/date. The\n  React-Aria-only transforms go (onClick -> onPress/onAction, the Select\n  aria-labelledby rewrite, the collection-key exemption from the DOM id\n  checks, the select-field-dynamic skip). sonner keeps its page and\n  examples, now from the radix base (base documents toast); direction is\n  not synced (TectonProvider sets the direction). Calendar drops the\n  Persian section (it edits calendar.tsx); sidebar RTL points at\n  TectonProvider. docs:sync regenerated (62 pages, 438 examples).\n- Site: TectonProvider with the TanStack router''s navigate/useHref in\n  __root, TectonProvider direction/locale in the previews; Tabs, ToggleGroup,\n  Select, Sheet, Dialog, DropdownMenu, cmdk Command, Slider, Checkbox and\n  Switch on the Base UI props; LinkButton -> Button render={<Link/>};\n  sidebar links via render; data-active state attributes.\n- Hand-written examples (form-tanstack-*, data-table-*, select-variants,\n  alert-dismissible) and the compare matrices on the new API; data-table\n  selection is Checkbox + TanStack rowSelection on the plain table.\n- Docs: TanStack Form guide re-derived from upstream, React Aria wording\n  removed from the intro, components, forms, CLI, agents and theming pages.\n- www depends on date-fns and react-day-picker, no longer on\n  react-aria-components and @internationalized/date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"191451948b81ca2d670f2d9a5c73f31b29984be1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/191451948b81ca2d670f2d9a5c73f31b29984be1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/150804a2a3fee51f79bb90f1ff10dac2d6b7dcc2","verification":{"payload":"tree 191451948b81ca2d670f2d9a5c73f31b29984be1\nparent a6624219a9fcce8060cd04278c303631078b8b4d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790407932 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790407932 +0000\n\nSync the www docs from the Base UI base and migrate the site to the new API\n\n- sync-upstream-docs.mts reads content/docs/components/base and\n  examples/base: import rewrites for @/styles/base-*/ui (and the\n  pre-bases @/registry/new-york-v4/ui), date-fns / react-day-picker\n  instead of react-aria-components / @internationalized/date. The\n  React-Aria-only transforms go (onClick -> onPress/onAction, the Select\n  aria-labelledby rewrite, the collection-key exemption from the DOM id\n  checks, the select-field-dynamic skip). sonner keeps its page and\n  examples, now from the radix base (base documents toast); direction is\n  not synced (TectonProvider sets the direction). Calendar drops the\n  Persian section (it edits calendar.tsx); sidebar RTL points at\n  TectonProvider. docs:sync regenerated (62 pages, 438 examples).\n- Site: TectonProvider with the TanStack router''s navigate/useHref in\n  __root, TectonProvider direction/locale in the previews; Tabs, ToggleGroup,\n  Select, Sheet, Dialog, DropdownMenu, cmdk Command, Slider, Checkbox and\n  Switch on the Base UI props; LinkButton -> Button render={<Link/>};\n  sidebar links via render; data-active state attributes.\n- Hand-written examples (form-tanstack-*, data-table-*, select-variants,\n  alert-dismissible) and the compare matrices on the new API; data-table\n  selection is Checkbox + TanStack rowSelection on the plain table.\n- Docs: TanStack Form guide re-derived from upstream, React Aria wording\n  removed from the intro, components, forms, CLI, agents and theming pages.\n- www depends on date-fns and react-day-picker, no longer on\n  react-aria-components and @internationalized/date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude