edChange,\nvalue/defaultValue/onValueChange (arrays for multi-value), value as an\nitem''s identity, open/onOpenChange on the root, Root + Trigger + Content\noverlays with render={<Button />} triggers, side/align placement,\nreact-day-picker Calendar, cmdk Command, plain HTML Table, Base UI\nSelect/Combobox. guidelines:check passes (exports verified).\n\n- topics/react-aria.md is replaced by topics/conventions.md\n  (`tecton docs conventions`); rules.md, SKILL.md, families.json,\n  adopted/astryx.json, README and theming updated; new rules for\n  library-free imports, Root/Trigger/Content, AlertDialogAction not\n  closing, and no keyboard shortcut API.\n- link.md: frontmatter only (LinkButton no longer exists).\n- agent-eval: topic:react-aria -> topic:conventions; accuracy recorded.\n- agent-search test: Select expectation now value/onValueChange.\n- agent/ and the docs pages'' generated guideline sections regenerated;\n  agents.mdx points at `tecton docs conventions`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"f6aa554c13f37914f4f86fd5aa6d431c230e6cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/f6aa554c13f37914f4f86fd5aa6d431c230e6cd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/0d786a9e42dd33a4743180d140e53f7ea41392e1","verification":{"payload":"tree f6aa554c13f37914f4f86fd5aa6d431c230e6cd7\nparent a6624219a9fcce8060cd04278c303631078b8b4d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790407651 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790407651 +0000\n\nRewrite the agent guidelines for the Base UI prop conventions\n\nEvery generated-component guideline now matches src/components after the\nBase UI migration: onClick/disabled, checked/onCheckedChange,\nvalue/defaultValue/onValueChange (arrays for multi-value), value as an\nitem''s identity, open/onOpenChange on the root, Root + Trigger + Content\noverlays with render={<Button />} triggers, side/align placement,\nreact-day-picker Calendar, cmdk Command, plain HTML Table, Base UI\nSelect/Combobox. guidelines:check passes (exports verified).\n\n- topics/react-aria.md is replaced by topics/conventions.md\n  (`tecton docs conventions`); rules.md, SKILL.md, families.json,\n  adopted/astryx.json, README and theming updated; new rules for\n  library-free imports, Root/Trigger/Content, AlertDialogAction not\n  closing, and no keyboard shortcut API.\n- link.md: frontmatter only (LinkButton no longer exists).\n- agent-eval: topic:react-aria -> topic:conventions; accuracy recorded.\n- agent-search test: Select expectation now value/onValueChange.\n- agent/ and the docs pages'' generated guideline sections regenerated;\n  agents.mdx points at `tecton docs conventions`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEPz+K6X\nYGAOQaW0XEIlzQOjmwAq90sSxKgvi/OtwIHVkGKMxI0a9oBIVXSOaoIxjOCYmZO6Mkz2QbiW88W/\ndgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T07:28:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin