09-26T07:14:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:14:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Move the layout, action and readout Tecton components to Base UI\n\nmeter and circular-progress sit on Base UI Meter / Progress, canvas on\nBase UI Toolbar (with CanvasToolbarButton), app-finder on Popover + cmdk.\nOverflow''s Toolbar gets its own toolbar keyboard over every visible\ncontrol, and OverflowItem passes onClick/disabled to its control instead\nof React Aria''s ButtonContext. action-bar, app-shell, copy-button and\npage-header follow the new Button/Tooltip/DropdownMenu structure; no\nReact Aria remains in these files. Tests, guidelines, docs pages and\nexamples follow the new API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"a7512900f94c6fc37b033e72af84ba98040659a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/a7512900f94c6fc37b033e72af84ba98040659a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/0be3b47dde2eb67751dea5d9ddb4f36de701fa62","verification":{"payload":"tree a7512900f94c6fc37b033e72af84ba98040659a3\nparent ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790406891 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790406891 +0000\n\nMove the layout, action and readout Tecton components to Base UI\n\nmeter and circular-progress sit on Base UI Meter / Progress, canvas on\nBase UI Toolbar (with CanvasToolbarButton), app-finder on Popover + cmdk.\nOverflow''s Toolbar gets its own toolbar keyboard over every visible\ncontrol, and OverflowItem passes onClick/disabled to its control instead\nof React Aria''s ButtonContext. action-bar, app-shell, copy-button and\npage-header follow the new Button/Tooltip/DropdownMenu structure; no\nReact Aria remains in these files. Tests, guidelines, docs pages and\nexamples follow the new API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOw94cAC\nPxt3Dir+fGMXJmxcJM3MFl6Tk50CFS1cVWpxj6sTMcDRjLr2XRrOxOUZiT9D76B+4deRzZSoFgu7\nyQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T07:16:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/0be3b47dde2eb67751dea5d9ddb4f36de701fa62","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDBiZTNiNDdkZGUyZWI2Nzc1MWRlYTVkOWRkYjRmMzZkZTcwMWZhNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","sha":"ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c"}],"sha":"0be3b47dde2eb67751dea5d9ddb4f36de701fa62","url":"https://api.github.com/re