b.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","sha":"ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1","sha":"8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1"}],"sha":"5daefb65d0b16339bbe146949d2a2730e8e5d10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/5daefb65d0b16339bbe146949d2a2730e8e5d10c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:57:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:57:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Rebuild ColorSwatch on Base UI and culori\n\nColorSwatch no longer uses React Aria. The public API is unchanged:\nstring colours in, `#RRGGBB` out, with size, shape, label, value,\naria-label, presets and onChange. The React Aria prop types are\nreplaced by Tecton-defined props, and `colorName` stays as an override.\n\n- Static swatch: a role=\"img\" span with aria-roledescription\n  \"color swatch\". Its name is the caller''s aria-label (or a string\n  label) followed by an English colour name (\"Sandstone, vibrant\n  orange\"). The name comes from new OKLCH lightness/chroma/hue buckets\n  on culori. forced-color-adjust stays none, and a checkerboard shows\n  behind translucent colours and tokens.\n- Parsing: culori replaces parseColor. The sentinel DOM probe remains\n  only for var() tokens.\n- Picker: generated Popover with a Tecton Button trigger. The trigger is\n  described by the swatch. Presets are a Base UI RadioGroup labelled by\n  its \"Presets\" heading. Selection follows focus. The hex field is a\n  Base UI Field with Input: it commits on Enter or blur, reverts invalid\n  input and shows uppercase #RRGGBB.\n- culori moves to dependencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"8e73803c59c9137e44869358c7bec36e245013fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/8e73803c59c9137e44869358c7bec36e245013fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e73803c59c9137e44869358c7bec36e245013fc\nparent ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790405850 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790405850 +0000\n\nRebuild ColorSwatch on Base UI and culori\n\nColorSwatch no longer uses React Aria. The public API is unchanged:\nstring colours in, `#RRGGBB` out, with size, shape, label, value,\naria-label, presets and onChange. The React Aria prop types are\nreplaced by Tecton-defined props, and `colorName` stays as an override.\n\n- Static swatch: a role=\"img\" span with aria-roledescription\n  \"color swatch\". Its name is the caller''s aria-label (or a string\n  label) followed by an English colour name (\"Sandstone, vibrant\n  orange\"). The name comes from new OKLCH lightness/chroma/hue buckets\n  on culori. forced-color-adjust stays none, and a checkerboard shows\n  behind translucent colours and tokens.\n- Parsing: culori replaces parseColor. The sentinel DOM probe remains\n  only for var() tokens.\n- Picker: generated Popover with a Tecton Button trigger. The trigger is\n  described by the swatch. Presets are a Base UI RadioGroup labelled by\n  its \"Presets\" heading. Selection follows focus. The hex field is a\n  Base UI Field with Input: it commits on Enter or blur, reverts invalid\n  input and shows uppercase #RRGGBB.\n- culori moves to dependencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEpTNeve\nkscbDEnuK7QgXkT3fs1RpPPy3eV35obWhM4AB6j7Eh72zSXtoK+ckjFUigN9UaeAp3oWMaZ76GK2\nIgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T06:58:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDhjY2IxNWNkZTZjZDFhNzUzMDVkMjdhYWQxY2JlMjFmNmIxMGEyZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","sha":"ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c"}],"sha":"8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/8ccb15cde6cd1a75305d27aad1cbe21f6b10a2d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:40:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:40:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Move the generated components to the Base UI base (base-tecton)\n\nThe shadcn components are now generated from the `base` (Base UI) base\ninstead of `aria` (React Aria), with the Tecton look carried over by the\nsame registry overlay:\n\n- tecton.patch re-authored against registry/bases/base/ui: portal target\n  on every overlay (`container ?? usePortalTarget()` on the *Portal\n  wrappers, a new optional `container` prop on the content parts that\n  portal themselves), the alert/badge/separator/input/textarea/select\n  variant axes, tabs/toggle colours stripped, logical button-group\n  corners, sidebar cookieName/keyboardShortcut, slider thumb, input-otp\n  cva, sonner status colours, and a calendar cva (DayPicker classNames\n  are never inlined by the registry build).\n- style-tecton.css: shared classes key on Base UI state (:active instead\n  of data-pressed, data-active on tabs, has-focus-visible on the slider\n  thumb, :active in the button-group lift).\n- components.json: \"style\": \"base-tecton\", \"rtl\": true (logical classes\n  at install time); registry-mirror.sh builds base-tecton by default;\n  restore-use-client reads the base sources.\n- All 59 items re-added with the CLI against the mirror; the CLI added\n  cmdk, date-fns and react-day-picker.\n\nConsumers in src/tecton, blocks and the docs are migrated separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5","tree":{"sha":"d4d7959b733a63654f786c6b06609aeaab7adf4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/d4d7959b733a63654f786c6b06609aeaab7adf4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/ceb2574c87fe3febad94e5b965b9b723445d3c2c","verification":{"payload":"tree d4d7959b733a63654f786c6b06609aeaab7adf4e\nparent 132dcde6746e66ee81487c8c6796ebb999c65bc7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790404827 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790404827 +0000\n\nMove the generated components to the Base UI base (base-tecton)\n\nThe shadcn components are now generated from the `base` (Base UI) base\ninstead of `aria` (React Aria), with the Tecton look carried over by the\nsame registry overlay:\n\n- tecton.patch re-authored against registry/bases/base/ui: portal target\n  on every overlay (`container ?? usePortalTarget()` on the *Portal\n  wrappers, a new optional `container` prop on the content parts that\n  portal themselves), the alert/badge/separator/input/textarea/select\n  variant axes, tabs/toggle colours stripped, logical button-group\n  corners, sidebar cookieName/keyboardShortcut, slider thumb, input-otp\n  cva, sonner status colours, and a calendar cva (DayPicker classNames\n  are never inlined by the registry build).\n- style-tecton.css: shared classes key on Base UI state (:active instead\n  of data-pressed, data-active on tabs, has-focus-visible on the slider\n  thumb, :active in the button-group lift).\n- components.json: \"style\": \"base-tecton\", \"rtl\": true (logical classes\n  at install time); registry-mirror.sh builds base-tecton by default;\n  restore-use-client reads the base sources.\n- All 59 items re-added with the CLI against the mirror; the CLI added\n  cmdk, date-fns and react-day-picker.\n\nConsumers in src/tecton, blocks and the docs are migrated separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019akMe8fr1M9mgQfFEwH3x5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIPmrFGS\nQydGMF37zJKnB8qntw4Q4TvGGt9Y0L3l7CA1GZBMo33tdZTSWx7JWCVnQl0OloZoyBBHUqWbhl3w\n6Aw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"