KtoAKDgxNWM3ZDU5MDcwZTk0OGI4YWMzYzgyY2QyN2Y4ZjE3YmQ1MDZiMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/0b7ed640e1abd4f9224a046c4b55bc2d465be7e7","sha":"0b7ed640e1abd4f9224a046c4b55bc2d465be7e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/0b7ed640e1abd4f9224a046c4b55bc2d465be7e7"}],"sha":"815c7d59070e948b8ac3c82cd27f8f17bd506b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/815c7d59070e948b8ac3c82cd27f8f17bd506b17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/0b7ed640e1abd4f9224a046c4b55bc2d465be7e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:10:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:10:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Measure an Overflow row only when it is a live element\n\nReact Aria collections such as Tabs render their children a second time\ninto a hidden tree (fake nodes, or an inert <template>) to build the\ncollection. An Overflow inside Tabs then attached its store to that copy\nand crashed in getComputedStyle / ResizeObserver. The store now attaches,\nand items and dividers register, only when the element belongs to a\ndocument with a window and is connected; the hidden copy stays detached.\n\nAdds a regression test with a row inside Tabs, next to its panels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa","tree":{"sha":"22509573a28e90f47f423b62b425b134305ce6e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/22509573a28e90f47f423b62b425b134305ce6e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/0b7ed640e1abd4f9224a046c4b55bc2d465be7e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 22509573a28e90f47f423b62b425b134305ce6e9\nparent 978fafe52add5680dca589a347068f70c48bac02\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395809 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395809 +0000\n\nMeasure an Overflow row only when it is a live element\n\nReact Aria collections such as Tabs render their children a second time\ninto a hidden tree (fake nodes, or an inert <template>) to build the\ncollection. An Overflow inside Tabs then attached its store to that copy\nand crashed in getComputedStyle / ResizeObserver. The store now attaches,\nand items and dividers register, only when the element belongs to a\ndocument with a window and is connected; the hidden copy stays detached.\n\nAdds a regression test with a row inside Tabs, next to its panels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOC3A5pI\nv/z/f7ZNn55Kg3MYGchLDW7O8u5nNReiqNwBR8X5bYNpX9uPNlxzIm9BPmQSHJVpzPd6xOSwpMs0\nYwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verif