tack/eslint-config\n\nshadcn is pinned to 4.21.0 in @tecton/react and @tecton/blocks (the\ngenerated components and the registry build depend on its exact\noutput), and @tanstack/eslint-config moves from \"latest\" to 0.4.0, the\nversion the lockfile already resolves and www already pins. Only the\nlockfile specifiers change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa","tree":{"sha":"7d203fee1e4b9f1d44012fdae89394d8d1011c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/7d203fee1e4b9f1d44012fdae89394d8d1011c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/510e3a2e05be747c0d92338b7a084c2e5b0d39e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d203fee1e4b9f1d44012fdae89394d8d1011c17\nparent 3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395672 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395672 +0000\n\nPin shadcn and @tanstack/eslint-config\n\nshadcn is pinned to 4.21.0 in @tecton/react and @tecton/blocks (the\ngenerated components and the registry build depend on its exact\noutput), and @tanstack/eslint-config moves from \"latest\" to 0.4.0, the\nversion the lockfile already resolves and www already pins. Only the\nlockfile specifiers change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAUQ/4bb\nME4OkNcFli0U2EJ/u/fFuaqFQhIyxyOGJjRjsd369JO8bFikbuLlaPUgv8aN/bQJy27rFUe326Uz\n9wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T04:10:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","follower