om/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Use value / onChange on the docs site''s Selects\n\nThe language selector, the Select compare page and the\ndata-table-pagination and overflow-forms examples move off the\ndeprecated selectedKey / defaultSelectedKey / onSelectionChange. No\nsynced upstream example or page passes those props to a Select, so the\ndocs sync needs no rewrite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa","tree":{"sha":"b5f9e62f0dda1cdd2536a1b0b6de007308c49c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/b5f9e62f0dda1cdd2536a1b0b6de007308c49c43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89","verification":{"payload":"tree b5f9e62f0dda1cdd2536a1b0b6de007308c49c43\nparent 92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395667 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395667 +0000\n\nUse value / onChange on the docs site''s Selects\n\nThe language selector, the Select compare page and the\ndata-table-pagination and overflow-forms examples move off the\ndeprecated selectedKey / defaultSelectedKey / onSelectionChange. No\nsynced upstream example or page passes those props to a Select, so the\ndocs sync needs no rewrite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM1LV/9b\nps7XvEbGOtTptBFWiLDmcZEagKdiBv2BE8lsHcCnlmnZGqZU/uPwgEj5MTbnCkysZtR3X81iW15w\nbQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T04:10:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDNjMzE5MWY4OTcxMzIxZmI3M2YzNzYzZTczMTVkMzg2NDVhYzZmODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c","sha":"92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c"}],"sha":"3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/3c3191f8971321fb73f3763e7315d38645ac6f89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Use value / onChange on the blocks'' Selects\n\nSelect''s selectedKey, defaultSelectedKey and onSelectionChange are\ndeprecated in react-aria-components 1.21. In single-selection mode\nvalue / defaultValue / onChange take and report the same Key | null and\nfire only on a change, so behaviour is unchanged. Covers the Select\nwrappers SelectField (facies-modeling-panel) and SelectRow (settings-01),\nwhich forward to Select. Tabs, ToggleGroup, TreeView, Table and the menu\ngroups keep their selection props.\n\nAdds tests that picking a well type filters list-01 and that the picked\nrole reaches settings-01''s onSave, and rebuilds the registry output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa","tree":{"sha":"a25a4fef00b560c120d95919e9d0e368d0ee1b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/a25a4fef00b560c120d95919e9d0e368d0ee1b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/92a8f3f13a433afbbc6f1f14b2339c8e3279646c","verification":{"payload":"tree a25a4fef00b560c120d95919e9d0e368d0ee1b5d\nparent 978fafe52add5680dca589a347068f70c48bac02\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395662 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395662 +0000\n\nUse value / onChange on the blocks'' Selects\n\nSelect''s selectedKey, defaultSelectedKey and onSelectionChange are\ndeprecated in react-aria-components 1.21. In single-selection mode\nvalue / defaultValue / onChange take and report the same Key | null and\nfire only on a change, so behaviour is unchanged. Covers the Select\nwrappers SelectField (facies-modeling-panel) and SelectRow (settings-01),\nwhich forward to Select. Tabs, ToggleGroup, TreeView, Table and the menu\ngroups keep their selection props.\n\nAdds tests that picking a well type filters list-01 and that the picked\nrole reaches settings-01''s onSave, and rebuilds the registry output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAh/YSNW\nElOsKtsTopokdzIh2KPT9I1nGPAtljgGCEqJHbAYfpiNzlPqPQPNImYDl7dKqDVRxxQMzKghbmqj\nUg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T04:10:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/o