bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/1e81ef83ad2fd8df43413d47143261024460a6cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:07:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(upstream): describe the current overlay, mirror script and build output\n\ntecton.patch now also touches slider and input-otp, makes the Select\ntrigger variants a cva, drops sonner''s cn-toast toastOptions and lets\nDropdownMenu and ContextMenu take UNSTABLE_portalContainer. The mirror\nbuild fails on a cn-* class that was not inlined (upstream''s ALLOWLIST\nexcepted), setup resets the clone, the overlaid files are derived, and the\nlibrary build no longer emits .d.ts.map.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa","tree":{"sha":"d6b762683a4bf26af19b176f24e6425773fb61e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/trees/d6b762683a4bf26af19b176f24e6425773fb61e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/git/commits/1e81ef83ad2fd8df43413d47143261024460a6cb","verification":{"payload":"tree d6b762683a4bf26af19b176f24e6425773fb61e9\nparent 8d2949aefe45bc7f5af48bd5f7663ffa6f9374b9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395659 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790395659 +0000\n\ndocs(upstream): describe the current overlay, mirror script and build output\n\ntecton.patch now also touches slider and input-otp, makes the Select\ntrigger variants a cva, drops sonner''s cn-toast toastOptions and lets\nDropdownMenu and ContextMenu take UNSTABLE_portalContainer. The mirror\nbuild fails on a cn-* class that was not inlined (upstream''s ALLOWLIST\nexcepted), setup resets the clone, the overlaid files are derived, and the\nlibrary build no longer emits .d.ts.map.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AAvpvexueS6jCUzk9cwNa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF580rY6\nfKbx8nz9HzZ6NH5IPmq23KS4CkoNZAMuvQ9tlDw+NyDIoxZvbro+Q5/YwMWKxZwHHUohf5qIoQdW\nnwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T04:08:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/1e81ef83ad2fd8df43413d47143261024460a6cb","node_id":"C_kwDOUXcqKtoAKDFlODFlZjgzYWQyZmQ4ZGY0MzQxM2Q0NzE0MzI2MTAyNDQ2MGE2Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commit/8d2949aefe45bc7f5af48bd5f7663ffa6f9374b9","sha":"8d2949aefe45bc7f5af48bd5f7663ffa6f9374b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-ui-1/commits/8d2949aefe45bc7f5af48bd5f7663ffa6f9374b9"}],"s