thub.com/users/ReinTristan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReinTristan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReinTristan/polls-mfe/commits/40fecfcd86af69f4bae86c6f32a8a5be198f17d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:27:31Z","email":"zetaeugene@gmail.com","name":"ReinTristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:27:31Z","email":"zetaeugene@gmail.com","name":"ReinTristan"},"message":"Spec 02 part 2: Remotes expose the App\n\nAdded vite and the module federation plugin to each remote with its own module-federation.config.ts file exposing ./App with its federation name and\nwithout type generation.\n\nAdded the include in the ts configs for the module config.\n\nAdded react and react-dom to poll-list and poll-vote, and styled-components and jotai only to poll-vote. poll-results stays without react.\n\nAdded the mount of each remote, poll-list emits poll:selected from a button, poll-vote receives it with replay into a jotai store created per mount and renders it in a styled div, and poll-results is plain typescript that renders the pollId of the context. Every remote subscribes to an event and cleans it on unmount.\n(very minimal indeed)\n\nAdded a minimal index.html to each remote to make the build.","tree":{"sha":"409af14fa37a1b4bd5b34f2914db4555e29ac442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReinTristan/polls-mfe/git/trees/409af14fa37a1b4bd5b34f2914db4555e29ac442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReinTristan/polls-mfe/git/commits/40fecfcd86af69f4bae86c6f32a8a5be198f17d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52648025?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReinTristan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReinTristan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReinTristan/following{/other