template-validator 中路径校验逻辑，防止正则匹配误判\n- 重构测试配置生成器，精简接口，支持布尔特性选择和多组合维度覆盖\n- e2e 测试中默认启用 i18n、sentry、eslint、husky，限定使用 pnpm\n- 恢复并扩展构建测试，验证构建产物存在和有效性\n- 严格控制临时目录清理，防止误删非测试目录\n- 允许微前端项目覆盖 React 入口模式，新增对应单元测试\n- 单元测试中增加对无效能力组合的拒绝及规范化状态的验证\n- 生成项目输出测试中新增对 React standard 和 React qiankun 模式输出的验证\n- 修复部分工具和测试脚本中异步回调和路径解析细节，提升稳定性和正确性\n- 调整测试依赖，添加 playwright、qiankun、single-spa 等包支持E2E及微前端测试","tree":{"sha":"a9c5b92405139a78e15dbd81172b138c35896c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moluoxixi/vite-cli/git/trees/a9c5b92405139a78e15dbd81172b138c35896c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moluoxixi/vite-cli/git/commits/53e1a2df82cc761cebca905dbbd4b1da6195a16a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57121471?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moluoxixi","id":57121471,"login":"moluoxixi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MTIxNDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluoxixi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/moluoxixi/vite-cli/commit/53e1a2df82cc761cebca905dbbd4b1da6195a16a","node_id":"C_kwDOUXikK9oAKDUzZTFhMmRmODJjYzc2MWNlYmNhOTA1ZGJiZDRiMWRhNjE5NWExNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/moluoxixi/vite-cli/commit/1dfadbb284f7caa3d4111d90f7cc